ontrol\xfc (TCU)",moduleBcm:"G\xf6vde Elektroni\u011fi (BCM)",simSaveBlocked:"Sim Save Blocked",scannedModules:"Scanned Modules"},service:{safetyWarning:" G\xdcVENL\u0130K UYARISI",safetyWarningDesc:"Bu i\u015flem s\u0131ras\u0131nda:\n\n\u2022 Kontak A\xc7IK olmal\u0131\n\u2022 Motor KAPALI olmal\u0131\n\u2022 Arac\u0131 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmay\u0131n\n\nDevam etmek istiyor musunuz?",step1:"Ad\u0131m 1: Ar\u0131za Kodlar\u0131n\u0131 Sil",step1Desc:"T\xfcm kay\u0131tl\u0131 ar\u0131za kodlar\u0131 (DTC) ve Check Engine \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 silinecek. Yak\u0131t trim de\u011ferleri s\u0131f\u0131rlanacak.\n\nBu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz!",step2:"Ad\u0131m 2: ECU Hard Reset",step2Desc:"Motor beynine elektriksel s\u0131f\u0131rlama (Hard Reset) g\xf6nderilecek. Ak\xfc s\xf6k\xfcp takmak gibi \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.\n\n Desteklemeyen ECU'larda etkisizdir. Zarar vermez.",clearCodes:"Kodlar\u0131 Sil",ecuReset:"Hata Kodlar\u0131n\u0131 Sil",finish:"Atla (Bitir)",completed:"Tamamland\u0131 ",completedDesc:"Servis i\u015flemleri ba\u015far\u0131yla tamamland\u0131. Arac\u0131 yeniden \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsiniz.",hardResetDesc:"T\xfcm servis i\u015flemleri ba\u015far\u0131yla tamamland\u0131.\n\n\u2022 Ar\u0131za kodlar\u0131 silindi\n\u2022 Yak\u0131t trimleri s\u0131f\u0131rland\u0131\n\u2022 ECU resetlendi\n\nArac\u0131 yeniden \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsiniz."},info:{desc:"Profesyonel motosiklet ve ara\xe7 te\u015fhis uygulamas\u0131.\nT\xfcm ara\xe7larla uyumludur.",upgrade:" Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner PRO'ya Y\xfckselt",upgradeAlert:"Erken Eri\u015fim ",upgradeAlertDesc:"Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner \u015fu an geli\u015ftirme a\u015famas\u0131ndad\u0131r. Siz erken d\xf6nem kullan\u0131c\u0131m\u0131z oldu\u011funuz i\xe7in t\xfcm profesyonel \xf6zellikler \u015fu an size a\xe7\u0131kt\u0131r. Geri bildirimleriniz bizim i\xe7in \xe7ok de\u011ferli!",helpGuide:"YARDIM VE REHBER",support:"DESTEK MERKEZ\u0130",supportSubject:"Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner Destek ve Geri Bildirim",thanks:"Te\u015fekk\xfcrler!",thanksDesc:"G\xf6r\xfc\u015fleriniz i\xe7in te\u015fekk\xfcr ederiz. Play Store \xfczerinden bize yorum b\u0131rakabilirsiniz.",sections:{featureCoding:{title:"G\u0130ZL\u0130 \xd6ZELL\u0130K A\xc7MA & UDS KODLAMA",content:"ISO 14229 UDS Protokol Motoru sayesinde VAG (VW, Audi, SEAT, Skoda), BMW, Renault ve Dacia ara\xe7larda Amerikan Park, Kadran Selamlama, Kornal\u0131 Kilit \u0130kaz\u0131, Konfor Cam ve G\xfcnd\xfcz Far\u0131 aktivasyonlar\u0131n\u0131 g\xfcvenle a\xe7\u0131p kapatabilirsiniz."},multiEcu:{title:"MULTI-ECU T\xdcM MOD\xdcLLER\u0130 TARAMA",content:"Sadece motor (ECU) beynini de\u011fil; ABS, Hava Yast\u0131\u011f\u0131 (Airbag), \u015eanz\u0131man (TCU), G\xf6sterge Paneli, Klima (HVAC) ve G\xf6vde Kontrol (BCM) mod\xfcllerini ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z tarayabilir ve ar\u0131za kodlar\u0131n\u0131 silebilirsiniz."},advancedDiagnostics:{title:"DCT ADAPTASYONU, DPF & HP G\xdc\xc7 \xd6L\xc7ER",content:"\u2022 DCT / DSG \u015eanz\u0131man Kavrama Nokta \xd6\u011frenme ve Adaptasyon S\u0131f\u0131rlama\n\u2022 DPF Kurum Doluluk (%/g) ve Egzoz Rejenerasyon S\u0131cakl\u0131k Takibi\n\u2022 Anl\u0131k K\u0131sa/Uzun Vadeli Yak\u0131t Trimi (STFT/LTFT) ve Lambda Analizi\n\u2022 Dinamik Beygir G\xfcc\xfc (HP) ve Tork (Nm) Canl\u0131 Grafi\u011fi"},demoMode:{title:"DEMO MODU (S\u0130M\xdcLASYON)",content:"Herhangi bir OBD2 cihaz\u0131n\u0131z olmasa bile uygulamay\u0131 tam i\u015flevli olarak test edebilirsiniz. Ger\xe7ek\xe7i CAN-Bus ve UDS canl\u0131 telemetri sim\xfclasyonu ile t\xfcm \xf6zellikleri deneyimleyin."},live:{title:"CANLI \u0130ZLEME SENS\xd6RLER\u0130",content:"Devir, H\u0131z, Motor S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131, Gaz Pozisyonu, Ak\xfc Voltaj\u0131, Motor Y\xfck\xfc, Emme Hava S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve Manifold Bas\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131 (MAP) anl\u0131k olarak izleyebilirsiniz.\n\nDe\u011ferler Bluetooth h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131za ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak saniyede 1-5 kez yenilenir. Terminal \xfczerinden UDS / OBD komutlar\u0131 ile araca direkt m\xfcdahale edebilirsiniz."},expertise:{title:"EKSPERT\u0130Z VE GARANT\u0130",content:"Uygulama, hatalar\u0131 tespit etmek i\xe7in ECU (Beyin) kodlar\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131r. \u015easi Numaras\u0131 (VIN) ve araca kaydedilmi\u015f mevcut kilometre \xe7ekilir.\n\nAyr\u0131ca Check Engine \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 ile arac\u0131n ne kadar mesafe gitti\u011fi hesaplanarak ge\xe7mi\u015f hatalar belirlenir. \xc7\u0131kan rapor PDF ve Mesajla\u015fma ortamlar\u0131nda payla\u015f\u0131labilir."},tests:{title:"AK\xdc / PERFORMANS TESTLER\u0130",content:"Ak\xfc testi 3 a\u015famal\u0131d\u0131r: Dinlenme, Mar\u015f ve R\xf6lanti \u015earj testleri ile batarya/reg\xfclat\xf6r sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfcr.\n\nPerformans testi, telefonunuzun i\u015flemcisi ve arac\u0131n\u0131zdan gelen anl\u0131k h\u0131z verisiyle 0-60 ve 0-100 km/s h\u0131zlanma de\u011ferlerini 50ms hata pay\u0131 ile \xf6l\xe7er."},hardware:{title:"DONANIM UYUMLULU\u011eU",content:"ELM327 Bluetooth (v1.5) \xf6nerilir. v2.1 KLON versiyonlu kalitesiz donan\u0131mlarla baz\u0131 geli\u015fmi\u015f kodlar \xe7al\u0131\u015fmayabilir. vLinker ve OBDLink gibi premium adapt\xf6rlerde en y\xfcksek h\u0131z\u0131 al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z."},warnings:{title:"\xd6NEML\u0130 UYARILAR",content:"\u2022 Ar\u0131za kodu silme i\u015flemi veya ECU Reset fonksiyonu esnas\u0131nda Kontak A\xc7IK, Motor KAPALI konumda olmal\u0131d\u0131r.\n\u2022 \xc7al\u0131\u015fan araca Reset g\xf6ndermeyiniz.\n\u2022 Her ara\xe7 t\xfcm sens\xf6rleri desteklemeyebilir, desteklenmeyen sens\xf6rlerde \"--\" g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr."},onboarding:{title:"YASAL \u0130Z\u0130NLER & ANON\u0130M TELEMETR\u0130",content:"Uygulama kalitesini ve ara\xe7 uyumlulu\u011funu art\u0131rmak amac\u0131yla; ar\u0131za te\u015fhisi s\u0131ras\u0131nda olu\u015fan tamamen anonimle\u015ftirilmi\u015f motor parametreleri ve ar\u0131za kodlar\u0131 (ki\u015fisel veri ve \u015fasi numaras\u0131 bar\u0131nd\u0131rmaks\u0131z\u0131n) g\xfcvenli sunucular\u0131m\u0131zda analiz edilebilir. Devam ederek bu anonim telemetri ko\u015fullar\u0131n\u0131 kabul etmi\u015f say\u0131l\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z.\n\nBluetooth ve Konum izinleri, motosikletinizin ECU beyniyle ileti\u015fim kurmak i\xe7in gereklidir."}},reconfigurePermissions:"\u0130zinleri & Yasal \u015eartlar\u0131 Yeniden G\xf6ster",language:" Dil / Dil / Bahasa",shareWithFriend:"ARKADA\u015eINLA PAYLA\u015e",shareMessageText:"Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner ile arac\u0131n\u0131n ECU ar\u0131za kodlar\u0131n\u0131 ve canl\u0131 sens\xf6r verilerini hemen ke\u015ffet!\n\nHemen \u0130ndir:\n iOS (App Store): https://apps.apple.com/app/id6742882583\n Android (Play Store): https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ismail.motocortexv2\n Web Portal: https://motocortex-telemetry.vercel.app/"},report:{title:" \u2550\u2550\u2550 CORTEX OBD2 TE\u015eH\u0130S RAPORU \u2550\u2550\u2550 ",vehicleIdentity:" ARA\xc7 K\u0130ML\u0130\u011e\u0130",vin:"\u015easi No (VIN)",odometer:"Mesafe (KM)",milDist:"Motor I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 Yan\u0131k",distSinceCleared:"Ar\u0131za Silineli",dtcCount:" ARIZA KODLARI ({{count}} adet)",sensorData:" CANLI SENS\xd6R VER\u0130LER\u0130",noData:"Veri okunamad\u0131",proApp:"Cortex OBD2 Diagnostic Scanner v7 PRO ile taranm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.",date:"Tarih",vinNotFound:"Tespit Edilemedi",noDtcs:"HATA KODU YOK \u2014 TEM\u0130Z",speed:"H\u0131z",coolant:"Motor S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131",throttle:"Gaz",engineLoad:"Motor Y\xfck\xfc",intakeAir:"Emme Hava",voltage:"Ak\xfc Voltaj\u0131",shareMessage:"Motocortex OBD2 Ar\u0131za Tespit Uygulamas\u0131 ile motosikletinizin durumunu cebinizden takip edin! \n\n\u0130ndir: https://cortexobd2.app",manifold:"Manifold",subtitle:"Kapsaml\u0131 \u0130kinci El Te\u015fhis ve Telemetri Denetimi",vehicleInfo:"Ara\xe7 Tan\u0131mlama ve ECU Meta Verileri",healthScore:"Genel ECU Sa\u011fl\u0131k Puan\u0131",dtcSection:"Diyagnostik Sorun Kodlar\u0131 (DTC Denetimi)",telemetrySection:"Canl\u0131 Telemetri ve Sens\xf6r Anl\u0131k G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcs\xfc",maintenanceSection:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Garaj Servis ve Bak\u0131m Ge\xe7mi\u015fi",aiSection:"AI Doktor Genel Durum Analizi",noFaults:"ECU haf\u0131zas\u0131nda kay\u0131tl\u0131 aktif veya ge\xe7mi\u015f ar\u0131za kodu yok.",noMaintenance:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Garaj'da kay\u0131tl\u0131 hizmet giri\u015fi bulunmamaktad\u0131r.",disclaimer:"Yasal Uyar\u0131: Bu rapor MotoCortex te\u015fhis yaz\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan olu\u015fturulmu\u015ftur. Ara\xe7 sat\u0131n al\u0131nmadan \xf6nce sertifikal\u0131 bir teknisyen taraf\u0131ndan fiziksel muayene yap\u0131lmas\u0131 tavsiye edilir.",shareTitle:"MotoCortex De\u011ferleme Raporunu Payla\u015f\u0131n"},battery:{title:"AK\xdc & MAR\u015e TEST\u0130",ready:"Teste ba\u015flamaya haz\u0131r.",restingStatus:"Kontak a\xe7\u0131k, motor kapal\u0131... Ak\xfc voltaj\u0131 okunuyor...",crankingStatus:"\u015e\u0130MD\u0130 MAR\u015eA BASIN! (5 saniye \xf6l\xe7\xfcm yap\u0131lacak)",chargingStatus:"Motor r\xf6lantide... \u015earj voltaj\u0131 okunuyor...",doneStatus:"Test tamamland\u0131!",voltageError:"Voltaj okunamad\u0131. Ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 kontrol edin.",start:"TEST\u0130 BA\u015eLAT",retry:"TEST\u0130 TEKRARLA",procedure:"TEST PROSED\xdcR\xdc",steps:{1:"1. Kontak a\xe7\u0131k, motor kapal\u0131 \u2192 Dinlenme voltaj\u0131 \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfcr",2:"2. \"\u015e\u0130MD\u0130 MAR\u015eA BASIN\" yaz\u0131s\u0131 \xe7\u0131k\u0131nca mar\u015fa bas\u0131n",3:"3. 5 saniye boyunca en d\xfc\u015f\xfck voltaj kaydedilir",4:"4. Motor \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken \u015farj/reg\xfclat\xf6r voltaj\u0131 \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfcr"},warning:"Test s\u0131ras\u0131nda Bluetooth ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kesmeyin.",resting:"D\u0130NLENME",cranking:"MAR\u015e",charging:"\u015eARJ",instantV:"ANLIK VOLTAJ",evaluation:"DE\u011eERLEND\u0130RME",verdicts:{full:"Ak\xfc: Tam dolu"