S\xfcrekli Amerikan park lambalar\u0131 baz\u0131 Avrupa \xfclkelerinde muayene standartlar\u0131na tak\u0131labilir (T\xdcV).",legalDisclaimerVim:" Not: S\xfcr\xfc\u015f esnas\u0131nda video oynatma yaln\u0131zca yolcular i\xe7indir. S\xfcr\xfcc\xfcn\xfcn dikkatinin yolda olmas\u0131 zorunludur.",safetyAlertTitle:" D\xfc\u015f\xfck Ak\xfc Voltaj Uyar\u0131s\u0131",allMakes:"T\xdcM MARKALAR",techEcuSpecs:"TEKN\u0130K ECU \xd6ZELL\u0130KLER\u0130 VE PAYLOAD \xd6N\u0130ZLEMES\u0130",targetEcuHeaderLabel:"Hedef ECU Adresi:",udsDidLabel:"UDS Veri Kimli\u011fi (DID):",bitPositionLabel:"Bit Pozisyonu:",targetPayloadLabel:"Hedef UDS Payload:",byteBitValue:"Bayt {{byte}}, Bit {{bit}}",items:{vag_oil_service_reset:{name:"Ya\u011f De\u011fi\u015fim Servis S\u0131f\u0131rlama (Esnek Aral\u0131k)",desc:"G\xf6sterge panelindeki ya\u011f de\u011fi\u015fim sayac\u0131n\u0131 fabrika \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 15.000 km / 365 g\xfcne s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},bmw_oil_service_reset:{name:"CBS Motor Ya\u011f Servisi S\u0131f\u0131rlama (BMW)",desc:"Condition Based Service (CBS) motor ya\u011f \xf6mr\xfcn\xfc fabrika de\u011feri %100'e getirir."},generic_oil_service_reset:{name:"Evrensel Ya\u011f Bak\u0131m G\xf6stergesi S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"Desteklenen OBD2/UDS mod\xfcllerinde g\xf6sterge paneli ya\u011f bak\u0131m uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 siler."},vag_epb_pad_change:{name:"EPB Fren Balata De\u011fi\u015fim Servis Modu (VAG)",desc:"Arka fren balatas\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fimi i\xe7in elektronik park freni kaliperlerini geri \xe7eker."},bmw_epb_pad_change:{name:"EPB Fren Servis Konumu (BMW)",desc:"Arka balata de\u011fi\u015fimi i\xe7in park freni motorlar\u0131n\u0131 servis konumuna getirir."},mb_epb_pad_change:{name:"EPB Balata Takma Servis Modu (Mercedes-Benz)",desc:"Fren servisi i\xe7in park freni milini at\xf6lye konumuna serbest b\u0131rak\u0131r."},vag_dpf_regen:{name:"DPF Servis Rejenerasyon Tetikleme (VAG)",desc:"Sabit konumda Dizel Partik\xfcl Filtresi (DPF) kurum yakma s\xfcrecini ba\u015flat\u0131r."},bmw_dpf_regen:{name:"DPF Zorunlu Rejenerasyon Tetikleme (BMW)",desc:"DDE motor beynine aktif partik\xfcl filtre temizlik rutinini ba\u015flatma iste\u011fi g\xf6nderir."},psa_dpf_regen:{name:"DPF Rejenerasyon \u0130ste\u011fi (Peugeot/Citro\xebn)",desc:"HDi dizel ara\xe7larda ara\xe7 durur halde DPF rejenerasyonunu ba\u015flat\u0131r."},bmw_bms_battery_register:{name:"BMS Ak\xfc De\u011fi\u015fimi Kayd\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"Yeni tak\u0131lan ak\xfcy\xfc Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Ak\xfc Sens\xf6r\xfc (IBS) ve DME/DDE beynine tan\u0131mlar."},mb_bms_battery_register:{name:"Ak\xfc Kayd\u0131 ve Ya\u015flanma Sayac\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rlama (Mercedes-Benz)",desc:"Ak\xfc de\u011fi\u015fimi sonras\u0131 SAM mod\xfcl\xfcndeki ak\xfc ya\u015flanma sayac\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},vag_sas_calibrate:{name:"Direksiyon A\xe7\u0131s\u0131 Sens\xf6r\xfc (SAS) Kalibrasyonu (VAG)",desc:"ABS/ESP beyni i\xe7in G85 direksiyon a\xe7\u0131 sens\xf6r\xfcn\xfcn s\u0131f\u0131r noktas\u0131n\u0131 kalibre eder."},toyota_sas_calibrate:{name:"Direksiyon A\xe7\u0131 Sens\xf6r\xfc S\u0131f\u0131rlama (Toyota)",desc:"Kayma Kontrol ECU'sunda direksiyon a\xe7\u0131 sens\xf6r\xfc s\u0131f\u0131r nokta kalibrasyonunu yapar."},generic_tba_adapt:{name:"Gaz Kelebe\u011fi Hizalama ve Adaptasyonu",desc:"Motor beyninde elektronik gaz kelebe\u011fi durma noktas\u0131 \xf6\u011frenme rutinini \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},epb_service_reset:{name:"Evrensel EPB Bak\u0131m S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"Elektronik park freni balata a\u015f\u0131nma sayac\u0131n\u0131 ve hava aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},vag_dsg_reset:{name:"DSG \u015eanz\u0131man Temel Ayar S\u0131f\u0131rlama (VAG)",desc:"DSG/S-Tronic \u015fanz\u0131manda debriyaj kavrama ve valf adaptasyonlar\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},bmw_zf_reset:{name:"ZF 8HP \u015eanz\u0131man Adaptasyon S\u0131f\u0131rlama (BMW)",desc:"EGS \u015fanz\u0131man vites ge\xe7i\u015f s\xfcreleri ve bas\u0131n\xe7 adaptasyon de\u011ferlerini temizler."},bmw_brake_fluid_reset:{name:"Fren Hidrolik Servis Sayac\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rlama (BMW)",desc:"Condition Based Service (CBS) 2 y\u0131ll\u0131k fren hidroli\u011fi de\u011fi\u015fim zamanlay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},ford_injector_code:{name:"Enjekt\xf6r D\xfczeltme Fakt\xf6r\xfc Kodlama (Ford)",desc:"Dizel enjekt\xf6rler i\xe7in 16 haneli IQA kodlar\u0131n\u0131 PCM motor beynine kaydeder."},bmw_injector_code:{name:"Yak\u0131t Enjekt\xf6r\xfc Debisi Kodlama (BMW)",desc:"De\u011fi\u015ftirilen yak\u0131t enjekt\xf6rlerinin kalibrasyon kodlar\u0131n\u0131 DME beynine yazar."},generic_headlight_aim:{name:"Otomatik Far Seviye Kalibrasyonu",desc:"Adaptif far y\xfckseklik motorlar\u0131 i\xe7in referans s\u0131f\u0131r noktas\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar."},bmw_12v_battery_reg:{name:"12V Yedek Ak\xfc Kayd\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"PCU \xfcnitesine yedek AGM mar\u015f/destek ak\xfcs\xfc de\u011fi\u015fimini tan\u0131mlar."},vag_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Konfor Sinyal Fla\u015f Say\u0131s\u0131 (VAG)",desc:"\u015eerit de\u011fi\u015ftirme sinyali vuru\u015f say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 3, 4 veya 5 olarak ayarlar."},vag_coming_home_duration:{name:"Coming/Leaving Home Far S\xfcresi (VAG)",desc:"Arac\u0131 kilitledikten sonra farlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131k kalma s\xfcresini belirler (10s - 60s)."},vag_remote_windows:{name:"Kumandadan Konfor Cam A\xe7ma/Kapatma (VAG)",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda tu\u015funa uzun basarak camlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131l\u0131p kapanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_auto_lock_15kmh:{name:"15 km/h H\u0131zda Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitleme (VAG)",desc:"Ara\xe7 h\u0131z\u0131 15 km/saate ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda t\xfcm kap\u0131lar\u0131 otomatik kilitler."},vag_sfd_unlock_prep:{name:"SFD Gateway Kilit Durumu Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 (VAG 2020+)",desc:"MQB-evo platformunda SFD korumal\u0131 ECU'lara yazma yapmak i\xe7in oturum a\xe7ar."},bmw_asd_deactivate:{name:"Active Sound Design (ASD) Motor Sesi \u0130ptali (BMW)",desc:"Hoparl\xf6rlerden i\xe7eri verilen yapay motor sesini tamamen kapat\u0131r."},bmw_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Konfor Sinyal Vuru\u015f Say\u0131s\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"Tek dokunu\u015fta sinyal lambas\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131p s\xf6nme say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar (1 - 5 fla\u015f)."},bmw_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Kilitlemede Yan Aynalar\u0131 Otomatik Katlama (BMW)",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde katlan\u0131r aynalar\u0131n an\u0131nda kapanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},toyota_coming_home_duration:{name:"Gecikmeli Far Kapanma / Refakat Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 (Toyota)",desc:"Kontak kapat\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra farlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131k kalma s\xfcresini ayarlar (30s-120s)."},toyota_lane_change_flash:{name:"\u015eerit De\u011fi\u015ftirme Sinyal Say\u0131s\u0131 (Toyota)",desc:"Sinyal koluna dokunuldu\u011funda lamban\u0131n yanma say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 belirler."},toyota_remote_window_close:{name:"Kumandadan Cam Kapatma (Toyota)",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda kilit tu\u015funa uzun basarak t\xfcm camlar\u0131 kapatmay\u0131 aktif eder."},toyota_autolock_behavior:{name:"Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitleme/Kilit A\xe7ma Ayarlar\u0131 (Toyota)",desc:"Kap\u0131 kilitleme tetikleyicisini belirler (Vites P'den \xe7\u0131k\u0131nca vs H\u0131z > 20 km/s)."},toyota_approach_welcome_lights:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar Yakla\u015fma Kar\u015f\u0131lama I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 (Toyota)",desc:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 anahtar araca yakla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda taban ve kabin ayd\u0131nlatmalar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik yakar."},hyundai_autolock_behavior:{name:"Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitlenme Modu (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Vitese tak\u0131nca veya h\u0131za ba\u011fl\u0131 otomatik kilitlenme ve P'ye al\u0131nca a\xe7\u0131lma modunu ayarlar."},hyundai_window_remote:{name:"Kumandadan Uzaktan Cam Kontrol\xfc (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 anahtar tu\u015flar\u0131yla camlar\u0131n uzaktan a\xe7\u0131l\u0131p kapanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},hyundai_sport_mode_memory:{name:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Modu Se\xe7im Haf\u0131zas\u0131 (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Ara\xe7 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda son se\xe7ilen s\xfcr\xfc\u015f modunu (Sport/Eco) haf\u0131zada tutar."},tesla_charge_limit_custom:{name:"Batarya \u015earj Limiti \xd6zelle\u015ftirme (Tesla)",desc:"Varsay\u0131lan y\xfcksek voltaj batarya \u015farj \xfcst s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar (%80 G\xfcnl\xfck / %100 Yolculuk)."},tesla_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Uzakla\u015f\u0131nca Otomatik Ayna Katlama (Tesla)",desc:"Telefon anahtarla ara\xe7tan uzakla\u015f\u0131nca kilitlenmede aynalar\u0131 otomatik katlar."},nissan_coming_home:{name:"Refakat Far Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 (Nissan)",desc:"Ara\xe7tan indikten sonra farlar\u0131n 30 saniye boyunca a\xe7\u0131k kalmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},nissan_lane_change_flash:{name:"Dokunmatik \u015eerit De\u011fi\u015ftirme Sinyal Say\u0131s\u0131 (Nissan)",desc:"Sinyal koluna hafift\xe7e dokunuldu\u011fundafla\u015f\xf6r\xfcn ka\xe7 kez yanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirler."},nissan_autolock_behavior:{name:"H\u0131za Duyarl\u0131 Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitleme (Nissan)",desc:"Ara\xe7 h\u0131z\u0131 24 km/saate ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda t\xfcm kap\u0131lar\u0131 otomatik kilitler."},nissan_window_remote:{name:"Kumandadan Elektrikli Cam A\xe7ma/Kapama (Nissan)",desc:"Kilit tu\u015funa uzun basarak \xf6n camlar\u0131n kumandadan kontrol edilmesini a\xe7ar."},nissan_seatbelt_chime_mute:{name:"Emniyet Kemeri Sesli Uyar\u0131 Sesi Kapatma (Nissan)",desc:"G\xf6sterge ikonunu koruyarak sesli emniyet kemeri ikaz biplerini kapat\u0131r."},porsche_sport_chrono_launch:{name:"Sport Chrono Launch Control Yan\u0131t Profili (Porsche)",desc:"PDK \u015fanz\u0131man kalk\u0131\u015f kontrol\xfc (Launch Control) devir ve kavramas\u0131n\u0131 optimize eder."},porsche_pasm_default:{name:"PASM S\xfcspansiyon Modu Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 Ayar\u0131 (Porsche)",desc:"PASM adaptif s\xfcspansiyonun kontak a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki varsay\u0131lan sertli\u011fini belirler."},porsche_exhaust_flap:{name:"Spor Egzoz Valfi S\xfcrekli A\xe7\u0131k Override (Porsche)",desc:"Aktif egzoz valflerinin t\xfcm devirlerde %100 a\xe7\u0131k kalmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},audi_drive_select_memory:{name:"Audi Drive Select Mod Haf\u0131zas\u0131 (Audi)",desc:"Kontak yeniden a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda son aktif S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Profilini (Dynamic/Individual) korur."},audi_virtual_cockpit_themes:{name:"Audi Virtual Cockpit S/RS Spor Tasar\u0131m Temas\u0131 (Audi)",desc:"Dijital g\xf6sterge panelinde S/RS merkezi devir saati spor grafik temas\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},vag_epb_service_mode:{name:"Elektronik Park Freni (EPB) Balata De\u011fi\u015fim Modu",desc:"Arka fren balata ve disk de\u011fi\u015fimi i\xe7in EPB kaliper pistonlar\u0131n\u0131 geriye \xe7eker."},bmw_bms_battery_registration:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Ak\xfc Sens\xf6r\xfc (IBS) Ak\xfc Tan\u0131tma",desc:"Yeni 12V AGM/Sulu ak\xfc de\u011fi\u015fimini motor kontrol \xfcnitesine (DME/DDE) kaydeder."},bmw_motorrad_service_indicator_reset:{name:"BMW Motorrad Y\u0131ll\u0131k Bak\u0131m & Ya\u011f S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"TFT g\xf6sterge ekran\u0131ndaki y\u0131ll\u0131k bak\u0131m tarihi ve 10.000 km servis uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 siler."},ducati_desmo_service_reset:{name:"Ducati Desmo Supap Bak\u0131m Uyar\u0131s\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"15.000 / 30.000 km Desmoservice anahtar ikonu uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6stergeden temizler."},byd_bms_isolation_self_test:{name:"BYD Blade Batarya Y\xfcksek Gerilim \u0130zolasyon Testi",desc:"BMS \xfcnitesinde 400V/800V y\xfcksek voltaj sistemi ka\xe7ak ve diren\xe7 te\u015fhisini \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},vag_drl_brightness_multi:{name:"G\xfcnd\xfcz Far\u0131 (DRL) Parlakl\u0131k Ayar\u0131",desc:"Park ve k\u0131sa far modunda LED g\xfcnd\xfcz s\xfcr\xfc\u015f far\u0131 yo\u011funluk seviyesini ayarlar."},bmw_comfort_turn_signal_cycles:{name:"Tek Dokunu\u015f Konfor Sinyali Yan\u0131p S\xf6nme Say\u0131s\u0131",desc:"Sinyal koluna dokunuldu\u011funda lamban\u0131n ka\xe7 kez konfor sinyali verece\u011fini belirler."},vag_staging_needle_sweep:{name:"Kadran Selamlama (Staging / Needle Sweep)",desc:"Kontak a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\xf6sterge ibrelerinin sona vurup geri gelmesini sa\u011flar."},vag_acoustic_lock_confirmation:{name:"Korna ile Kilit Geri Bildirimi",desc:"Ara\xe7 kumandadan kilitlendi\u011finde kornan\u0131n k\u0131sa bip uyar\u0131s\u0131 vermesini sa\u011flar."},vag_american_parking_lights:{name:"Amerikan Park Sinyalleri",desc:"\xd6n sinyal lambalar\u0131n\u0131n parklar a\xe7\u0131kken %20 parlakl\u0131kta sabit yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_drl_menu_toggle:{name:"G\xfcnd\xfcz Far\u0131 Men\xfcs\xfc (DRL Toggle)",desc:"G\xfcnd\xfcz s\xfcr\xfc\u015f farlar\u0131n\u0131n g\xf6sterge/multimedya ekran\u0131ndan a\xe7\u0131l\u0131p kapat\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_tear_wiping:{name:"Silecek Son Damla Silme (Tear Wiping)",desc:"Cam y\u0131kama \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131ktan 5 saniye sonra sileceklerin akan son damlay\u0131 silmesini sa\u011flar."},vag_emergency_brake_flashing:{name:"Ani Frende Fla\u015f\xf6r Yakma",desc:"Sert fren yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda stop lambalar\u0131n\u0131n ve d\xf6rtl\xfclerin h\u0131zl\u0131ca fla\u015f yapmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_cornering_lights:{name:"Viraj Ayd\u0131nlatma Sis Farlar\u0131",desc:"Direksiyon \xe7evrilen taraftaki sis far\u0131n\u0131n viraj ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 olarak yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_comfort_mirror_folding:{name:"Kumandadan Ayna Katlama",desc:"Kumandadan kilit butonuna bas\u0131l\u0131 tutuldu\u011funda dikiz aynalar\u0131n\u0131n otomatik katlanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_lap_timer:{name:"Pist Tur Sayac\u0131 (Lap Timer)",desc:"G\xf6sterge bilgi ekran\u0131na tur s\xfcresi \xf6l\xe7er sekmesini ekler."},vag_refuel_quantity:{name:"Depo Bo\u015f Litre G\xf6stergesi",desc:"Depoya tam dolum i\xe7in ka\xe7 litre yak\u0131t gerekti\u011fini g\xf6stergede g\xf6sterir."},bmw_start_stop_memory:{name:"Auto Start-Stop Haf\u0131za Modu",desc:"Auto Start-Stop sisteminin ara\xe7 kapat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131ndaki son durumunu (A\xe7\u0131k/Kapal\u0131) hat\u0131rlamas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},bmw_digital_speedometer:{name:"Dijital H\u0131z G\xf6stergesi",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneli bilgi ekran\u0131na anl\u0131k dijital h\u0131z se\xe7ene\u011fini ekler."},bmw_sport_displays:{name:"Spor G\xf6stergeler (HP & Nm Kadran\u0131)",desc:"iDrive multimedya ekran\u0131na anl\u0131k beygir g\xfcc\xfc (HP) ve tork (Nm) kadranlar\u0131n\u0131 ekler."},bmw_acoustic_lock_sound:{name:"Kilit Sesli Uyar\u0131s\u0131 (Acoustic Lock)",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde veya a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda fabrika alarm\u0131ndan k\u0131sa onay bipleri verir."},bmw_mirror_fold_delay_zero:{name:"Gecikmesiz Ayna Katlama",desc:"Kumandadan kilit butonuna bas\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 an bekleme s\xfcresi olmadan (0.0s) aynalar\u0131 katlar."},bmw_tpms_tire_temperature:{name:"Lastik S\u0131cakl\u0131k Ekran\u0131",desc:"Lastik bas\u0131n\xe7 kontrol ekran\u0131nda bas\u0131n\xe7 de\u011ferine ek olarak anl\u0131k lastik s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 da g\xf6sterir."},renault_trip_computer_enable:{name:"Yol Bilgisayar\u0131 Aktifle\u015ftirme",desc:"Yol bilgisayar\u0131 kapal\u0131 gelen ara\xe7larda ortalama t\xfcketim ve menzil ekranlar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},renault_external_temp_display:{name:"D\u0131\u015f S\u0131cakl\u0131k G\xf6stergesi",desc:"G\xf6sterge ekran\u0131nda d\u0131\u015f hava s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\xf6stergesini aktif eder."},renault_automatic_tailgate:{name:"Kumandadan Bagaj Kapa\u011f\u0131 A\xe7ma",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda \xfczerindeki bagaj butonuna t\u0131kland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kapa\u011f\u0131 tam kilit a\xe7arak b\u0131rak\u0131r."},renault_alarm_chirp:{name:"Korna / Siren Kilit Onay\u0131",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde kornadan onay sesi verir."},renault_shift_indicator:{name:"Vites De\u011fi\u015fim \u0130kaz I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131",desc:"Ekonomik s\xfcr\xfc\u015f i\xe7in g\xf6stergede yukar\u0131/a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 vites de\u011fi\u015ftirme oklar\u0131n\u0131 aktifle\u015ftirir."},ford_double_horn_honk_disable:{name:"Motor \xc7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken \xc7ift Korna \u0130ptali",desc:"Motor \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken anahtarla ara\xe7tan inip kap\u0131 kapat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xe7alan rahats\u0131z edici \xe7ift kornay\u0131 kapat\u0131r."},ford_auto_door_locking:{name:"20 km/h H\u0131zda Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitleme",desc:"Ara\xe7 h\u0131z\u0131 20 km/h \xfczerine \xe7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda t\xfcm kap\u0131lar\u0131n otomatik kilitlenmesini sa\u011flar."},ford_tpms_psi_display:{name:"Say\u0131sal Lastik Bas\u0131n\xe7 Ekran\u0131",desc:"G\xf6sterge ekran\u0131nda her lasti\u011fin anl\u0131k bar/psi de\u011ferini say\u0131sal olarak g\xf6sterir."},ford_sync_climate_screen:{name:"SYNC Ekran\u0131nda Klima Kontrol\xfc",desc:"SYNC multimedya ekran\u0131na klima ve koltuk \u0131s\u0131tma kontrol sekmesini ekler."},stellantis_power_windows_remote:{name:"Kumandadan Cam Otomatik Kapatma/A\xe7ma",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda kilit butonuna bas\u0131l\u0131 tutuldu\u011funda a\xe7\u0131k camlar\u0131 otomatik kapat\u0131r."},stellantis_cornering_fogs:{name:"Viraj Sis Farlar\u0131",desc:"D\xfc\u015f\xfck h\u0131zlarda d\xf6n\xfc\u015f y\xf6n\xfcndeki sis far\u0131n\u0131 yakarak viraj ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_traffic_sign_recognition:{name:"Tabela Okuma (Traffic Sign Recognition / VZE)",desc:"\xd6n kamera \xfczerinden tespit edilen h\u0131z tabelalar\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6stergede ve HUD'da g\xf6sterir."},vag_ambient_color_palette_30:{name:"30 Renkli Ambiyans Ayd\u0131nlatma Paleti",desc:"MIB multimedya ekran\u0131na 30 farkl\u0131 RGB i\xe7 ayd\u0131nlatma renk se\xe7ene\u011fini ekler."},vag_seatbelt_warning_mute:{name:"Emniyet Kemeri \u0130kaz Sesini Kapatma",desc:"Tak\u0131l\u0131 olmayan emniyet kemeri sesli uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 deaktif eder."},bmw_alpina_cluster_theme:{name:"Alpina Kadran Tasar\u0131m\u0131",desc:"Dijital g\xf6sterge paneline mavi renkli Alpina performans temas\u0131n\u0131 uygular."},bmw_video_in_motion:{name:"Hareket Halinde Video \u0130zleme (VIM)",desc:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f esnas\u0131nda iDrive multimedya ekran\u0131nda USB video oynatmay\u0131 a\xe7ar."},bmw_sport_plus_mode_unlock:{name:"Sport+ S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Modu Aktivasyonu",desc:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f modu se\xe7icisine y\xfcksek performansl\u0131 Sport+ se\xe7ene\u011fini ekler."},mercedes_amg_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performans G\xf6sterge Men\xfcs\xfc",desc:"G\xf6stergeye AMG ya\u011f s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131, \u015fanz\u0131man s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131, lap timer ve G-Metre ekran\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},mercedes_agility_mode_enable:{name:"Agility (A) \u015eanz\u0131man Ge\xe7i\u015f Modu",desc:"7G/9G-Tronic \u015fanz\u0131mana y\xfcksek tepkili Agility s\xfcr\xfc\u015f program\u0131n\u0131 ekler."},mercedes_drl_brightness_boost:{name:"G\xfcnd\xfcz Farlar\u0131 %100 Parlakl\u0131k",desc:"LED g\xfcnd\xfcz s\xfcr\xfc\u015f farlar\u0131n\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 tam g\xfc\xe7 %100 seviyesine \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},mercedes_alarm_lock_chirp:{name:"Kilit Korna Onay Sesi",desc:"Merkezi kilitlemede kornadan k\u0131sa bip onay sesi verir."},mercedes_dpf_adblue_gauge:{name:"DPF Kurum & AdBlue Seviye Ekran\u0131",desc:"G\xf6stergede DPF kurum doluluk y\xfczdesini ve AdBlue menzilini g\xf6sterir."},renault_rs_monitor_enable:{name:"Renault Sport RS Monitor Telemetri",desc:"R-Link ekran\u0131na anl\u0131k G-Kuvveti, turbo bas\u0131nc\u0131 ve ya\u011f s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 verilerini a\xe7ar."},renault_duster_mirror_fold:{name:"Duster Kilitte Otomatik Ayna Katlama",desc:"Kumandadan kilitlendi\u011finde yan aynalar\u0131 BCM \xfczerinden otomatik katlar."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_light:{name:"Bambi Modu (Sisler + Uzunlar Birlikte)",desc:"Uzun farlar yak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda sis farlar\u0131n\u0131n s\xf6nmeden birlikte yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},ford_st_rs_boot_animation:{name:"ST/RS SYNC A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f Ekran\u0131",desc:"SYNC dokunmatik multimedya a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f animasyonunu ST / RS logosuna \xe7evirir."},toyota_reverse_beep_mute:{name:"Geri Vites S\xfcrekli Uyar\u0131 Sesini Susturma",desc:"Kabin i\xe7indeki s\xfcrekli \xf6ten geri vites ikaz bip sesini tek bir bipe d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr."},toyota_remote_window_drop:{name:"Kumandadan Otomatik Cam \u0130ndirme",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda kilit a\xe7ma butonuna bas\u0131l\u0131 tutuldu\u011funda camlar\u0131 indirir."},toyota_auto_lock_shift_p:{name:"Vites P'den \xc7\u0131k\u0131nca Kap\u0131lar\u0131 Kilitleme (P -> D)",desc:"Vites Park konumundan al\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131nda t\xfcm kap\u0131lar\u0131 otomatik kilitler."},peugeot_icockpit_theme_unlock:{name:"Peugeot 3D i-Cockpit Performans Temas\u0131",desc:"3D dijital kadrana Bak\u0131r ve Bak\u0131r K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 performans temalar\u0131n\u0131 ekler."},jeep_offroad_pages_enable:{name:"Jeep Uconnect Off-Road Bilgi Ekran\u0131",desc:"Yat\u0131\u015f/e\u011fim a\xe7\u0131lar\u0131, tekerlek a\xe7\u0131lar\u0131 ve 4x4 kilit durum ekranlar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},hyundai_smart_welcome_mirror:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar Yakla\u015fma Ayna A\xe7ma",desc:"Anahtarla araca yakla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda yan aynalar\u0131 otomatik a\xe7ar."},hyundai_one_touch_turn_7_flashes:{name:"Tek Dokunu\u015f Sinyal Say\u0131s\u0131 (7 Fla\u015f\xf6r)",desc:"\u015eerit de\u011fi\u015ftirme sinyal s\xfcresini 7 fla\u015f\xf6re \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},hyundai_svm_camera_speed_extend:{name:"360\xb0 \xc7evre G\xf6r\xfc\u015f Kamera H\u0131z Limiti Uzatma (20 km/h)",desc:"Park kameras\u0131n\u0131n 20 km/h ileri h\u0131za kadar a\xe7\u0131k kalmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},hyundai_n_performance_exhaust_flap:{name:"N-Performance Egzost Klapesi Varsay\u0131lan A\xc7IK",desc:"Motor \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda aktif egzoz valfini A\xc7IK konuma getirir."},vag_rain_closing_sunroof:{name:"Ya\u011fmurda Otomatik Cam & Sunroof Kapatma (Regenschlie\xdfen)",desc:"Park halindeyken ya\u011fmur alg\u0131land\u0131\u011f\u0131nda a\xe7\u0131k camlar\u0131 ve sunroof'u otomatik kapat\u0131r."},bmw_launch_control_unlock:{name:"Launch Control (Kalk\u0131\u015f Kontrol) Aktivasyonu",desc:"\u015eanz\u0131man kontrol \xfcnitesindeki fabrika kalk\u0131\u015f kontrol program\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},mercedes_ambient_64_multi_zone:{name:"64-Renk Dinamik \xc7ok B\xf6lgeli Ambiyans Profili",desc:"MBUX multimedyada kapal\u0131 tutulan renk ge\xe7i\u015fli ambiyans profillerini a\xe7ar."},ford_trailer_brake_activation:{name:"R\xf6mork Fren Kontrol\xf6r\xfc (TBC) Aktivasyonu",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneline entegre r\xf6mork fren kontrol men\xfcs\xfcn\xfc ekler."},gm_afm_dfm_cylinder_deactivation_disable:{name:"AFM/DFM V8 Silindir Sabitleme (V4 \u0130ptali)",desc:"Motor titre\u015fimini \xf6nlemek i\xe7in motoru s\xfcrekli 8 silindir modunda sabitler."},gm_remote_start_time_extend:{name:"Uzaktan \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma S\xfcresi Uzatma (20 Dakika)",desc:"Kumandadan uzaktan \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma s\xfcresini 10 dakikadan 20 dakikaya \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},dodge_srt_performance_pages:{name:"SRT Performance Pages & S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Modlar\u0131",desc:"Uconnect ekran\u0131nda 0-100 km/h \xf6l\xe7er, G-Kuvveti metre ve kalk\u0131\u015f kontrol sayfalar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},ram_bambi_mode_fog:{name:"RAM Bambi Modu (Uzun Far + Sis Lambas\u0131)",desc:"Uzun farlar yak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda sis lambalar\u0131n\u0131n s\xf6nmeden a\xe7\u0131k kalmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},byd_avas_pedestrian_siren_mute:{name:"AVAS Elektrikli Ara\xe7 D\xfc\u015f\xfck H\u0131z Siren Sesini Kapatma",desc:"30 km/h alt\u0131ndaki yapay elektrik motoru yaya ikaz sirenini susturur."},chery_isa_overspeed_chime_mute:{name:"ISA A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 H\u0131z \u0130kaz Sesini Kapatma (80/120 km/h Bip)",desc:"S\xfcrekli \xf6ten a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 h\u0131z uyar\u0131s\u0131 bip sesini deaktif eder (Tiggo / MG)."},mg_ev_battery_preconditioning_toggle:{name:"EV Batarya H\u0131zl\u0131 \u015earj \xd6n Is\u0131tma Manuel Anahtar\u0131",desc:"DC h\u0131zl\u0131 \u015farj \xf6ncesi batarya \u0131s\u0131tmay\u0131 elle ba\u015flatma anahtar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},chery_dms_fatigue_camera_mute:{name:"DMS S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Yorgunluk Kameras\u0131 \u0130kaz Hassasiyeti D\xfc\u015f\xfcrme",desc:"Direksiyon kameras\u0131n\u0131n a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 hassas y\xfcz/g\xf6z takibi ikazlar\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131r."},honda_walk_away_auto_lock:{name:"Honda Walk-Away Otomatik Kilitleme",desc:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc anahtarla 2 metre uzakla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kap\u0131lar\u0131 otomatik kilitler."},subaru_avh_auto_hold_memory:{name:"Auto Vehicle Hold (AVH) Fren Tutma Haf\u0131za Modu",desc:"Otomatik fren tutma sistemini ara\xe7 yeniden ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda A\xc7IK hat\u0131rlat\u0131r."},volvo_start_stop_default_off:{name:"Auto Start-Stop Varsay\u0131lan KAPALI Modu",desc:"Start-Stop sistemini ara\xe7 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda varsay\u0131lan KAPALI konuma getirir."},volvo_polestar_digital_theme:{name:"Polestar Mavi Dijital G\xf6sterge Temas\u0131",desc:"S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc ekran\u0131na Polestar imzal\u0131 mavi dinamik g\xf6sterge temas\u0131n\u0131 uygular."},vag_virtual_cockpit_r_theme:{name:"Virtual Cockpit R / S / Cupra Performans Temalar\u0131",desc:"Dijital kadrana R-Line, S-Line ve Cupra merkeze yerle\u015fen devir g\xf6sterge temalar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},vag_sound_symposer_mute:{name:"Sound Symposer Hoparl\xf6r Motor Ses \u0130ptali",desc:"Hoparl\xf6rden kabin i\xe7ine verilen yapay motor sesini tamamen kapat\u0131r."},vag_wireless_carplay_enable:{name:"Kablosuz Apple CarPlay & Android Auto Aktivasyonu",desc:"MIB2.5/MIB3 \xfcnitelerinde 5GHz Wi-Fi \xfczerinden kablosuz CarPlay ve Android Auto ba\u011fda\u015ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},vag_offroad_telemetry_menu:{name:"MIB Offroad Telemetri & G\xf6sterge Men\xfcs\xfc",desc:"Ekrana direksiyon a\xe7\u0131s\u0131, ya\u011f s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131, so\u011futma suyu ve rak\u0131m kadranlar\u0131n\u0131 yans\u0131t\u0131r."},vag_easy_entry_driver_seat:{name:"Otomatik Kolay Bini\u015f Elektrikli Koltuk",desc:"Kap\u0131 a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc koltu\u011funu 5 cm geriye \xe7ekerek bini\u015fi kolayla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},vag_hba_memory_state:{name:"Otomatik Uzun Far Haf\u0131zas\u0131 (HBA Memory)",desc:"Kontak kapat\u0131lsa bile Otomatik Uzun Far (HBA) a\xe7\u0131k durumunu haf\u0131zada tutar."},vag_battery_soc_display:{name:"Ak\xfc Doluluk Oran\u0131 G\xf6stergesi (% SOC)",desc:"S\u0131f\u0131rlama butonuna bas\u0131l\u0131 tutuldu\u011funda ak\xfcn\xfcn anl\u0131k doluluk y\xfczdesini g\xf6sterir."},bmw_idrive7_m_animation:{name:"iDrive 7 / 8 M-Performance Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 Animasyonu",desc:"iDrive ekran a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131na M-Performance veya M-GmbH logo animasyonunu ekler."},bmw_bowers_wilkins_audio_profiles:{name:"Bowers & Wilkins 3D Ses Profili A\xe7ma",desc:"Standart ses sistemine Bowers & Wilkins Concert ve Studio 3D ses profillerini a\xe7ar."},bmw_hitch_zoom_camera:{name:"Geri Vites \xc7eki Demiri Zoom Kameras\u0131",desc:"Geri vites kameras\u0131nda \xe7eki demirine odaklanan ku\u015f bak\u0131\u015f\u0131 zoom modunu aktifle\u015ftirir."},bmw_secure_idle_protection:{name:"G\xfcvenli R\xf6lanti Vites Kilit Korumas\u0131 (Secure Idle)",desc:"Motor \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken anahtarla ara\xe7tan \xe7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda vitesin P konumundan \xe7\u0131kar\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 kilitler."},bmw_seatbelt_handover_mute:{name:"Coupe Elektrikli Kemer Uzatma Kolu \u0130ptali",desc:"4 Serisi / 2 Serisi Coupe modellerde kemer uzatan motorlu kolu pasif yapar."},bmw_auto_heat_threshold_5c:{name:"Koltuk & Direksiyon Otomatik Is\u0131tma E\u015fi\u011fi (+5\xb0C)",desc:"D\u0131\u015f s\u0131cakl\u0131k 5\xb0C alt\u0131na d\xfc\u015ft\xfc\u011f\xfcnde koltuk ve direksiyon \u0131s\u0131tmay\u0131 otomatik \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},mercedes_amg_track_pace_unlock:{name:"MBUX AMG Track Pace Telemetri & Tur Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131",desc:"MBUX ekran\u0131na pist tur s\xfcreleri, 0-100/0-200 telemetrisi ve G-Kuvveti grafiklerini ekler."},mercedes_drive_mode_last_memory:{name:"Dynamic Select Son S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Modu Haf\u0131zas\u0131",desc:"Ara\xe7 her \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda varsay\u0131lan Comfort modu yerine en son se\xe7ilen modda ba\u015flamas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},mercedes_proximity_360_camera_auto:{name:"Park Sens\xf6r\xfcnde Otomatik 360\xb0 Kamera A\xe7\u0131lma",desc:"\xd6n sens\xf6r nesneye 50 cm yakla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131nda 360 kameray\u0131 otomatik ekrana getirir."},ford_sync_climate_screen_unlock:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Dokunmatik Ekran Klima Men\xfcs\xfc",desc:"Dokunmatik ekrana dijital klima, koltuk \u0131s\u0131tma ve y\xf6nlendirme sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},ford_turn_signal_5_flashes:{name:"Tek Dokunu\u015f Sinyal Say\u0131s\u0131 (5 Fla\u015f\xf6r)",desc:"Otoban sinyal koluna dokunuldu\u011fundaki 3 olan fla\u015f\xf6r say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 5'e \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},ford_auto_engine_shutdown_disable:{name:"30 Dakika Otomatik Motor Stop \u0130ptali",desc:"R\xf6lantide 30 dakika durduktan sonra motorun otomatik stop etmesini engeller."},ev_battery_preheat_manual_switch:{name:"EV Batarya H\u0131zl\u0131 \u015earj \xd6n Is\u0131tma Manuel Anahtar\u0131",desc:"DC h\u0131zl\u0131 \u015farj \xf6ncesi bataryay\u0131 manuel olarak 25\xb0C ideal \u015farj s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131na \u0131s\u0131t\u0131r."},ev_v2l_power_output_expand:{name:"V2L (Vehicle-to-Load) 220V G\xfc\xe7 \xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Limit Art\u0131r\u0131m\u0131 (3.6 kW)",desc:"Ara\xe7tan d\u0131\u015far\u0131ya verilen 220V \u015febeke elektri\u011fi limitini 2.2 kW'tan 3.6 kW'a \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},ev_one_pedal_regen_force_level3:{name:"EV Tek Pedal (One-Pedal Drive) Maksimum Rejenerasyon",desc:"Gazdan ayak \xe7ekildi\u011finde maksimum rejeneratif frenleme ile durmay\u0131 varsay\u0131lan yapar."},byd_soc_max_charge_target_limit:{name:"BYD Batarya Sa\u011fl\u0131k Koruma \u015earj Limiti (%80 / %90)",desc:"Blade batarya \xf6mr\xfcn\xfc uzatmak i\xe7in AC/DC \u015farj\u0131 %80 veya %90'da otomatik kesen koruma modunu a\xe7ar."},byd_dmi_forced_pure_ev_speed_override:{name:"BYD DM-i Elektrikli Mod Benzinli Motor Engelleyici",desc:"Tam gaz h\u0131zlanmada dahi 130 km/h h\u0131za kadar benzinli motorun devreye girmesini engeller."},byd_vtol_v2v_rescue_charge_mode:{name:"BYD VTOL Ara\xe7tan Araca (V2V) \u015earj Modu",desc:"Yolda kalan di\u011fer elektrikli ara\xe7lar\u0131 \u015farj etmek i\xe7in ters de\u015farj kurtarma modunu a\xe7ar."},hyundai_ipedal_memory_lock:{name:"Hyundai / Kia i-PEDAL Tek Pedal S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Haf\u0131za Kilidi",desc:"Geri vitese tak\u0131l\u0131p tekrar D'ye ge\xe7ildi\u011finde i-PEDAL modunun Seviye 3'e d\xfc\u015fmesini engeller."},hyundai_utility_mode_12v_saver:{name:"Kamp / Utility Modu 12V Ak\xfc Koruyucu Kilidi",desc:"Kamp modunda ara\xe7 i\xe7i t\xfcm elektroni\u011fi do\u011frudan y\xfcksek voltajl\u0131 \xe7eki\u015f bataryas\u0131ndan besler."},hyundai_phev_no_ice_climate_start:{name:"PHEV Elektrik Modu Is\u0131tma Motor Engelleyici",desc:"K\u0131\u015f\u0131n kalorifer a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda benzinli motorun \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 engeller, \u0131s\u0131 pompas\u0131n\u0131 zorunlu k\u0131lar."},vag_taycan_ess_sound_profile_swap:{name:"Electric Sport Sound (ESS) Taycan / RS e-tron Ses Profili",desc:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f sesini Porsche Taycan GTS ve Audi RS e-tron GT performans ses motoruna g\xfcnceller."},vag_meb_daily_charge_target_menu:{name:"MEB Batarya G\xfcnl\xfck %80 / H\u0131zl\u0131 Y\u0131l %100 \u015earj Bar\u0131",desc:"MIB ekran\u0131na g\xfcnl\xfck kullan\u0131m i\xe7in %80, uzun yol i\xe7in %100 \u015farj k\u0131s\u0131tlama men\xfcs\xfcn\xfc ekler."},vag_gte_generator_charge_reserve:{name:"GTE / E-Mode Jenerat\xf6r \u015earj Modu (%80)",desc:"Benzinli motorun s\xfcr\xfc\u015f esnas\u0131nda y\xfcksek voltajl\u0131 bataryay\u0131 %80'e kadar zorunlu \u015farj etmesini sa\u011flar."},bmw_hans_zimmer_iconic_sounds_m:{name:"Hans Zimmer IconicSounds Electric M-Performance Ses Motoru",desc:"i4 ve iX modellerinde Hans Zimmer imzal\u0131 M-Performance elektrikli h\u0131zlanma seslerini a\xe7ar."},bmw_phev_max_edrive_140kmh:{name:"PHEV MAX eDrive Elektrikli S\xfcr\xfc\u015f H\u0131z Tavan\u0131 (140 km/h)",desc:"330e / 530e modellerinde benzinli motor \xe7al\u0131\u015fmadan \xe7\u0131k\u0131labilen elektrikli h\u0131z\u0131 140 km/h yapar."},bmw_ac_charging_current_limit_menu:{name:"AC Ev Tipi \u015earj Ak\u0131m Limitleyici (6A - 32A)",desc:"Ev tesisat\u0131n\u0131 korumak i\xe7in AC \u015farj ak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 6A, 10A, 16A veya 32A s\u0131n\u0131rland\u0131rma men\xfcs\xfcn\xfc a\xe7ar."},toyota_hybrid_ev_mode_override:{name:"Toyota / Lexus EV Mod Benzinli Motor \u0130ptali",desc:"EV butonuna bas\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda gaza bas\u0131lsa dahi benzinli motorun devreye girmesini engeller."},toyota_hybrid_battery_fan_speed_boost:{name:"Toyota / Lexus Hibrit Batarya So\u011futma Fan\u0131 H\u0131z Art\u0131r\u0131m\u0131 (+%30)",desc:"S\u0131cak iklimlerde hibrit bataryan\u0131n \u0131s\u0131nmas\u0131n\u0131 \xf6nlemek i\xe7in so\u011futma fan\u0131 devrini %30 art\u0131r\u0131r."},tesla_sentry_high_bitrate_video:{name:"Tesla N\xf6bet\xe7i Modu Y\xfcksek \xc7\xf6z\xfcn\xfcrl\xfckl\xfc Kay\u0131t",desc:"N\xf6bet\xe7i modu kamera kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131n netli\u011fini art\u0131rarak plakalar\u0131n okunmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},tesla_cabin_overheat_threshold_30c:{name:"Tesla Kabin A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 Is\u0131nma Korumas\u0131 E\u015fik Derecesi (30\xb0C)",desc:"G\xfcne\u015f alt\u0131nda kalan ara\xe7ta kliman\u0131n a\xe7\u0131lma e\u015fik s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 40\xb0C yerine 30\xb0C'ye d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr."},bmwmotorrad_quickshifter_pro_readapt:{name:"Shift Assistant Pro Vites Sens\xf6r\xfc Yeniden Kalibrasyonu",desc:"Vites de\u011fi\u015fim sens\xf6r\xfc \xf6\u011frenme parametrelerini s\u0131f\u0131rlar ve h\u0131zl\u0131 vites kalibrasyonunu ba\u015flat\u0131r."},bmwmotorrad_esa_zero_point_calib:{name:"Dynamic ESA Elektronik S\xfcspansiyon S\u0131f\u0131r Noktas\u0131 Kalibrasyonu",desc:"Elektronik s\xfcspansiyon y\xfck ve strok sens\xf6rlerini fabrika s\u0131f\u0131r konumuna kalibre eder."},bmwmotorrad_abs_pro_cornering_toggle:{name:"ABS Pro Viraj Modu M\xfcdahale E\u015fi\u011fi",desc:"Pist kullan\u0131m\u0131 i\xe7in yat\u0131\u015f a\xe7\u0131s\u0131na duyarl\u0131 ABS m\xfcdahale hassasiyetini ayarlar."},bmwmotorrad_service_interval_reset:{name:"Y\u0131ll\u0131k ve Mesafe Servis Hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneli servis g\xf6stergesini s\u0131f\u0131rlar ve \xf6zel bak\u0131m aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 tan\u0131mlar."},bmwmotorrad_headlight_pro_cornering:{name:"Headlight Pro Adaptif Viraj Far\u0131 Hassasiyeti",desc:"Adaptif viraj farlar\u0131n\u0131n devreye girmesi i\xe7in gereken motor yat\u0131\u015f a\xe7\u0131s\u0131 e\u015fi\u011fini ayarlar."},bmwmotorrad_keyless_ride_range_extend:{name:"Keyless Ride Anahtars\u0131z \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma Alg\u0131lama Menzili",desc:"Anahtars\u0131z ate\u015fleme sens\xf6r\xfc i\xe7in transponder sinyal alg\u0131lama menzilini optimize eder."},bmwmotorrad_reverse_assist_sensitivity:{name:"Elektrikli Geri Vites Motoru Hassasiyeti",desc:"Geri vites mar\u015f motoru h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 ve tork limitini ince ayarlar."},ducati_riding_mode_custom_profile:{name:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Modu \xd6zel Profil Olu\u015fturucu",desc:"Race, Sport, Touring ve Urban profilleri i\xe7in \xf6zel parametre kombinasyonlar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},ducati_ohlins_suspension_mapping:{name:"\xd6hlins Smart EC 2.0 Yar\u0131 Aktif S\xfcspansiyon Haritas\u0131",desc:"Elektronik s\xfcspansiyon s\xf6n\xfcmleme e\u011frisi ve sertlik \xf6n ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 ince ayarlar."},ducati_dashboard_lap_timer_gps:{name:"TFT G\xf6sterge Tur Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131 ve GPS Sekt\xf6r S\xfcreleri",desc:"G\xf6sterge panelinde pist tur zamanlay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 ve sekt\xf6r s\xfcresi ekran\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},ducati_engine_brake_control_ebc:{name:"Motor Freni Kontrol\xfc (EBC) Seviye Ayar\u0131",desc:"Sert viraj giri\u015flerinde arka tekerlek kompresyon frenleme torkunu ayarlar."},ducati_cruise_control_retrofit_enable:{name:"H\u0131z Sabitleyici Sonradan Montaj (Retrofit) Aktivasyonu",desc:"Sonradan tak\u0131lan elektronik h\u0131z sabitleme d\xfc\u011fmeleri i\xe7in ECU yaz\u0131l\u0131m bayra\u011f\u0131n\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirir."},ducati_exhaust_valve_sound_map:{name:"Egzoz Servo Valfi A\xe7\u0131lma Devir Haritas\u0131",desc:"Geli\u015fmi\u015f egzoz sesi i\xe7in akustik egzoz valfi a\xe7\u0131lma devir e\u015fi\u011fini ayarlar."},ducati_pit_lane_limiter_config:{name:"Pit Yolu H\u0131z S\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131c\u0131 E\u015fi\u011fi",desc:"Gidonda yer alan 60 km/s pit yolu h\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131c\u0131 anahtar\u0131n\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirir."},ducati_desmo_service_light_reset:{name:"Ya\u011f ve Desmo Supap Servis I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 S\u0131f\u0131rlama",desc:"G\xf6sterge panelindeki Desmodromik supap bak\u0131m\u0131 hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131 uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 temizler."},ktm_quickshifter_plus_delay_tuning:{name:"Quickshifter+ Vites Kesme S\xfcresi ve Gecikme Ayar\u0131",desc:"Kesintisiz vites ge\xe7i\u015fleri i\xe7in vites baz\u0131nda ate\u015fleme kesme s\xfcresini \xf6zelle\u015ftirir."},ktm_rally_offroad_abs_tc_unlock:{name:"Rally / Arazi ABS ve TC Modu Kilidi A\xe7ma",desc:"Rally modunda arka tekerlek ABS'sini kapat\u0131r ve 9 kademeli patinaj ayar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},ktm_my_ktm_connectivity_unlock:{name:"My KTM / Husqvarna Ba\u011flant\u0131 Mod\xfcl\xfc Aktivasyonu",desc:"TFT ekranda Bluetooth navigasyon ve ad\u0131m ad\u0131m rota y\xf6nlendirmesini a\xe7ar."},ktm_cruise_control_retrofit_enable:{name:"H\u0131z Sabitleyici Sonradan Tak\u0131m Yaz\u0131l\u0131m Kilidi",desc:"Gidon d\xfc\u011fme kiti tak\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra h\u0131z sabitleme fonksiyonunu aktifle\u015ftirir."},ktm_clutch_pull_map_switch_gesture:{name:"Debriyaj \xc7ekme Hareketiyle Harita De\u011fi\u015ftirme",desc:"\xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmada debriyaj kolu hareketi yaparak h\u0131zl\u0131 harita ge\xe7i\u015fini etkinle\u015ftirir."},yamaha_quickshifter_cut_time_adjust:{name:"Quickshifter Ate\u015fleme Kesme S\xfcresi ve Hassasiyeti",desc:"Quickshifter sens\xf6r y\xfck e\u015fi\u011fini ve buji ate\u015fleme kesinti gecikmesini ayarlar."},yamaha_ride_by_wire_throttle_map:{name:"Elektronik Gaz Kolu Harita \xd6n Ayar Se\xe7ici",desc:"A-Modu (Agresif), STD ve B-Modu (Yumu\u015fak) gaz haritalar\u0131 aras\u0131nda ge\xe7i\u015f yapar."},yamaha_tft_track_theme_unlock:{name:"TFT Pist Ekran Tasar\u0131m\u0131 ve Vites I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 Kilidi",desc:"R1/MT-09 SP pist kadran d\xfczenini ve programlanabilir vites devir \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},yamaha_launch_control_sensitivity:{name:"Kalk\u0131\u015f Kontrol Sistemi (LCS) Devir Tavan\u0131",desc:"Kalk\u0131\u015f kontrol\xfc tutma devrini (8.000 - 10.000 RPM aral\u0131\u011f\u0131) yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131r."},yamaha_heated_grips_accessory_enable:{name:"Orijinal Is\u0131tmal\u0131 Elcik TFT Men\xfc Entegrasyonu",desc:"TFT ekranda \u0131s\u0131tmal\u0131 elcik kontrollerini ve s\u0131cakl\u0131k g\xf6stergesini etkinle\u015ftirir."},honda_hstc_wheelie_control_fine_tune:{name:"HSTC \xc7eki\u015f ve \xd6n Tekerlek Kald\u0131rma Kontrol\xfc \u0130nce Ayar\u0131",desc:"Honda \xc7eki\u015f Kontrol\xfc kayma oran\u0131n\u0131 ve \xf6n tekerlek kalk\u0131\u015f tolerans\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar."},honda_bi_directional_quickshifter_enable:{name:"\xc7ift Y\xf6nl\xfc Quickshifter Retrofit Aktivasyonu",desc:"ECU belle\u011finde auto-blipper ve alt/\xfcst quickshifter kodlamas\u0131n\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirir."},honda_service_reminder_custom_interval:{name:"Ya\u011f Bak\u0131m Hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131 Mesafe \xd6zelle\u015ftirici",desc:"Dijital g\xf6stergede \xf6zel ya\u011f de\u011fi\u015fim kilometresi aral\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar."},honda_track_abs_rear_disable:{name:"Pist Kullan\u0131m\u0131 Arka Tekerlek ABS \u0130ptali",desc:"Pist g\xfcnlerinde \xf6n viraj ABS'sini korurken arka tekerlek ABS kanal\u0131n\u0131 devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131r."},honda_cold_start_idle_enrichment:{name:"So\u011fuk \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rma Yak\u0131t Zenginle\u015ftirmesi ve R\xf6lanti Devri",desc:"Performans egzoz sistemleri i\xe7in ilk \u0131s\u0131nma r\xf6lanti devrini ayarlar."},harley_custom_throttle_curve_editor:{name:"\xd6zel Gaz Tepkisi E\u011fri D\xfczenleyici",desc:"Milwaukee-Eight / Revolution Max elektronik gaz kolu ilerlemesini ayarlar."},harley_security_alarm_sensitivity:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 G\xfcvenlik Sistemi Hareket ve E\u011fim Hassasiyeti",desc:"Hareket sens\xf6r\xfc hassasiyetini ve eller serbest anahtar kurma gecikmesini ayarlar."},harley_boom_box_gts_hidden_diagnostics:{name:"Boom! Box GTS Multimedya Gizli Te\u015fhis Men\xfcs\xfc",desc:"M\xfchendislik telemetri ekranlar\u0131n\u0131, motor s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve ya\u011f bas\u0131nc\u0131 g\xf6stergelerini a\xe7ar."},harley_rdrs_defensive_system_tune:{name:"RDRS Motor Freni Kayma Kontrol\xfc Hassasiyeti",desc:"Vites k\xfc\xe7\xfcltmede RDRS arka tekerlek kayma \xf6nleme m\xfcdahalesini ince ayarlar."},byd_avas_low_speed_siren_mute:{name:"AVAS D\xfc\u015f\xfck H\u0131z EV Yaya Uyar\u0131 Siren Sesi \u0130ptali",desc:"30 km/s alt\u0131nda d\u0131\u015far\u0131ya ses yayan yaya ikaz sirenini sessize al\u0131r veya sesini d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr."},byd_ev_battery_preheat_manual_switch:{name:"Manuel EV Batarya \xd6n Is\u0131tma D\xfc\u011fmesi",desc:"DC h\u0131zl\u0131 \u015farj \xf6ncesinde batarya termal \u015fartland\u0131rmas\u0131n\u0131 manuel olarak ba\u015flat\u0131r."},byd_v2l_220v_outlet_power_expansion:{name:"V2L (Ara\xe7tan Y\xfcke) 220V Priz G\xfc\xe7 Geni\u015fletme (3.6 kW)",desc:"Harici V2L de\u015farj g\xfc\xe7 tavan\u0131n\u0131 2.2 kW'tan maksimum 3.6 kW'a \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},byd_one_pedal_regen_default_max:{name:"Tek Pedal S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Rejeneratif Frenleme Varsay\u0131lan Maksimum",desc:"Y\xfcksek rejeneratif frenlemeyi ara\xe7 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda varsay\u0131lan olarak kilitler."},mg_ismart_connectivity_unlock:{name:"i-SMART Ba\u011flant\u0131 ve Uzaktan Telemetri Kilidi",desc:"Uzaktan klima kontrol\xfc ve ara\xe7 durum takip \xf6zelliklerini aktifle\u015ftirir."},mg_mg4_xpower_launch_control_enable:{name:"MG4 XPower \xc7ift Motorlu Kalk\u0131\u015f Kontrol\xfc (Launch Control)",desc:"3.8 saniyelik 0-100 km/s kalk\u0131\u015f kontrol\xfc h\u0131zlanma modunu a\xe7ar."},mg_battery_preheat_manual_trigger:{name:"Manuel H\u0131zl\u0131 \u015earj Batarya \xd6n \u015eartland\u0131rma",desc:"Maksimum DC \u015farj h\u0131zlar\u0131 i\xe7in y\xfcksek voltajl\u0131 batarya \u0131s\u0131t\u0131c\u0131 elemanlar\u0131n\u0131 zorla A\xc7IK konuma getirir."},xpeng_xngp_adas_region_unlock:{name:"XNGP Otonom S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Asistan\u0131 B\xf6lge Kilidi A\xe7ma",desc:"Desteklenen b\xf6lgelerde navigasyon destekli geli\u015fmi\u015f otonom s\xfcr\xfc\u015f asistan\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},xpeng_ambient_lighting_music_sync:{name:"M\xfczi\u011fe Duyarl\u0131 Ritimli Ambiyans Ayd\u0131nlatma",desc:"Kabin LED ambiyans ayd\u0131nlatma ritmini ses sisteminin bas vuru\u015flar\u0131yla senkronize eder."},xpeng_rear_camera_trailer_hitch_view:{name:"360\xb0 Kamera R\xf6mork \xc7eki Demiri ve Zemin \xc7izgileri",desc:"Geri g\xf6r\xfc\u015f kameras\u0131na y\xfcksek \xe7\xf6z\xfcn\xfcrl\xfckl\xfc \xe7eki demiri hizalama k\u0131lavuz \xe7izgileri ekler."},nio_battery_swap_interval_reminder:{name:"Batarya De\u011fi\u015fim \u0130stasyonu \xd6n Haz\u0131rl\u0131k Modu",desc:"De\u011fi\u015fim \xf6ncesinde batarya kilit pinlerini otomatik gev\u015fetir ve bataryay\u0131 iklimlendirir."},nio_nomi_assistant_custom_voice_phrases:{name:"NOMI AI Sesli Asistan Ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirme ve Animasyonlar",desc:"NOMI i\xe7in \xf6zel avatar animasyonlar\u0131n\u0131 ve ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirilmi\u015f kar\u015f\u0131lama c\xfcmlelerini a\xe7ar."},nio_sentry_watchdog_continuous_recording:{name:"NIO N\xf6bet\xe7i Modu (Sentry) 4K Kamera Kayd\u0131",desc:"Park halindeyken USB belle\u011fe y\xfcksek kaliteli \xe7evre kamera kayd\u0131 yap\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},xiaomi_su7_hyperos_driver_profile_sync:{name:"Xiaomi SU7 HyperOS S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Profili Ekosistem Senkronizasyonu",desc:"Koltuk, ayna ve klima ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 Xiaomi telefon Bluetooth ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131yla otomatik senkronize eder."},xiaomi_su7_boost_mode_throttle_curve:{name:"Boost Modu 20 Saniyelik A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 G\xfc\xe7 (Overboost) Kilidi",desc:"Tam gaz h\u0131zlanmada maksimum elektrik motoru overboost s\xfcresini uzat\u0131r."},xiaomi_su7_drift_mode_torque_vectoring:{name:"Drift Modu Arka Tekerlek Tork Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131",desc:"\xc7eki\u015f kontrol\xfc devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131yken motor torkunun %100'\xfcn\xfc arka aksa aktar\u0131r."},chery_isa_overspeed_warning_chime_off:{name:"ISA Ak\u0131ll\u0131 H\u0131z Asistan\u0131 A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 H\u0131z Uyar\u0131 Sesini Kapatma",desc:"Tespit edilen h\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 a\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xe7alan s\xfcrekli sesli ikaz\u0131 devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131r."},chery_driver_monitoring_camera_sensitivity:{name:"DMS S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Yorgunluk \u0130zleme Kameras\u0131 Hassasiyeti",desc:"\u0130\xe7 izleme kameras\u0131ndan kaynaklanan yanl\u0131\u015f pozitif dikkat da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 uyar\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131r."},retrofit_parking_sensor_coding:{name:"Retrofit \xd6n/Arka Park Sens\xf6r\xfc (PDC) Kodlamas\u0131",desc:"Sonradan tak\u0131lan park sens\xf6r\xfc mod\xfcl\xfcn\xfc Canbus Gateway montaj listesine kaydeder."},retrofit_360_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit 360\xb0 \xc7evre G\xf6r\xfc\u015f Kamera Sistemi",desc:"\xc7evre g\xf6r\xfc\u015f kamera kontrolc\xfcs\xfcn\xfc etkinle\u015ftirir ve multimedyaya kamera g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfcn\xfc ekler."},retrofit_led_license_plate_light_coding:{name:"Retrofit LED Plaka ve Stop Lambas\u0131 Ar\u0131za \u0130ptali",desc:"LED ampullerde ampul patlak uyar\u0131s\u0131 vermesini \xf6nlemek i\xe7in so\u011fuk ampul kontrol\xfcn\xfc kapat\u0131r."},retrofit_dash_cam_sentry_integration:{name:"Retrofit Ara\xe7 Kameras\u0131 S\xfcrekli G\xfc\xe7 ve Park Kayd\u0131 Entegrasyonu",desc:"Park halinde s\xfcrekli kay\u0131t i\xe7in G\xf6vde Kontrol Mod\xfcl\xfc Klips 30 g\xfc\xe7 hatt\u0131n\u0131 yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131r."},retrofit_heated_windshield_activation:{name:"Retrofit \xd6n Cam Rezistans\u0131 Is\u0131tma Kodlamas\u0131",desc:"\xd6n cam buz \xe7\xf6z\xfcc\xfc rezistans r\xf6le \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 ve klima ekran\u0131 d\xfc\u011fmesini etkinle\u015ftirir."},retrofit_wireless_charger_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Qi Kablosuz Telefon \u015earj Ped Entegrasyonu",desc:"Kablosuz \u015farj durum LED'ini ve telefonda unutma hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131 uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirir."},retrofit_acc_radar_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit Adaptif H\u0131z Sabitleyici (ACC) \xd6n Radar Mod\xfcl\xfc",desc:"Sonradan tak\u0131lan \xf6n mesafe radar \xfcnitesini CAN bus ara\xe7 a\u011f\u0131na kodlar."},retrofit_traffic_sign_camera_activation:{name:"Retrofit Tabela Okuma \xd6n Cam Kameras\u0131 Kodlamas\u0131",desc:"Sonradan tak\u0131lan cam kameras\u0131nda VZE trafik i\u015fareti tan\u0131ma i\u015flemesini etkinle\u015ftirir."},retrofit_heated_steering_wheel_coding:{name:"Retrofit Is\u0131tmal\u0131 Direksiyon Mod\xfcl\xfc Aktivasyonu",desc:"Direksiyon \u0131s\u0131tma eleman\u0131 \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 ve otomatik a\xe7\u0131lma s\u0131cakl\u0131k tetikleyicilerini a\xe7ar."},retrofit_fatigue_camera_calibration:{name:"Retrofit S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Yorgunluk \u0130zleme Kameras\u0131 Entegrasyonu",desc:"Direksiyon kolonu montaj\u0131 sonras\u0131nda k\u0131z\u0131l\xf6tesi s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc izleme sens\xf6r\xfcn\xfc kalibre eder."},retrofit_trailer_hitch_module_coding:{name:"Retrofit \xc7eki Demiri ve R\xf6mork Elektrik Mod\xfcl\xfc Kodlamas\u0131",desc:"R\xf6mork savrulma \xf6nleme i\xe7in r\xf6mork mod\xfcl\xfcn\xfc ESP stabilite sistemine kodlar."},retrofit_power_tailgate_trunk_kit_coding:{name:"Retrofit Elektrikli Bagaj ve Ayakla A\xe7ma Sens\xf6r\xfc Entegrasyonu",desc:"Elektrikli bagaj kapa\u011f\u0131 motorlar\u0131n\u0131 ve tampon alt\u0131 ayak sens\xf6r\xfc kodlamas\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},easteregg_urban_joke_light_show:{name:"Urban Joke \xc7apraz Fla\u015f\xf6r I\u015f\u0131k \u015eovu",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlenirken stop lambalar\u0131 ve sinyallerin s\u0131rayla \xe7apraz yan\u0131p s\xf6nmesini sa\u011flar."},easteregg_custom_boot_greeting_text:{name:"Dijital G\xf6sterge \xd6zel Kar\u015f\u0131lama Yaz\u0131s\u0131",desc:"Kontak a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\xf6sterge ekran\u0131nda ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirilmi\u015f kar\u015f\u0131lama mesaj\u0131 g\xf6sterir."},easteregg_cluster_mini_game_mode:{name:"G\xf6sterge Paneli Gizli Mini Oyun Men\xfcs\xfc",desc:"Park halindeyken direksiyon d\xfc\u011fmeleriyle oynanan nostaljik mini oyunu a\xe7ar."},easteregg_custom_horn_melody_package:{name:"\xd6zel Akustik Korna Kar\u015f\u0131lama Melodisi",desc:"Arac\u0131n kilidi a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda korna ile k\u0131sa ritmik ikaz sesi \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},easteregg_welcome_lighting_door_sequence:{name:"Kayan LED Kap\u0131 Kolu Kar\u015f\u0131lama I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131",desc:"D\u0131\u015f kap\u0131 kollar\u0131nda kayan LED kar\u015f\u0131lama animasyonunu \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},easteregg_developer_service_menu_shortcut:{name:"Geli\u015ftirici ve Servis Te\u015fhis Ekran\u0131 K\u0131sayolu",desc:"Gizli m\xfchendislik ve te\u015fhis ekranlar\u0131na eri\u015fmek i\xe7in h\u0131zl\u0131 d\xfc\u011fme k\u0131sayolunu a\xe7ar."},easteregg_seasonal_cluster_theme_effect:{name:"Mevsimsel Hava Temas\u0131 G\xf6sterge Efekti (Kar/Ya\u011fmur)",desc:"K\u0131\u015f aylar\u0131nda kadran arka plan\u0131na hareketli kar tanesi veya ya\u011fmur efekti ekler."},easteregg_valet_mode_prank_warning_message:{name:"Valet Modu \u015eaka H\u0131z Limiti Uyar\u0131 Mesaj\u0131",desc:"Vale modu h\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 a\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ekranda esprili uyar\u0131 mesaj\u0131 g\xf6sterir."},adas_lane_keep_assist_gentle_curve:{name:"\u015eerit Takip Asistan\u0131 (LKA) Yumu\u015fak Direksiyon M\xfcdahalesi",desc:"Kademeli tork m\xfcdahalesi uygulayarak ani direksiyon m\xfcdahalelerini yumu\u015fat\u0131r."},adas_lka_last_state_memory_mode:{name:"\u015eerit Takip Asistan\u0131 Son Durum Haf\u0131za Kilidi",desc:"LKA'n\u0131n kontak her a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda otomatik olarak tekrar devreye girmesini engeller."},adas_acc_default_follow_distance:{name:"Adaptif H\u0131z Sabitleyici (ACC) Varsay\u0131lan Takip Mesafesi",desc:"ACC her a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda varsay\u0131lan takip mesafesini (1-4 kademe) kilitler."},adas_acc_speed_step_adjustment:{name:"ACC H\u0131z Art\u0131rma Ad\u0131m Se\xe7ici (+5 / +10 km/s)",desc:"Direksiyondaki h\u0131z d\xfc\u011fmesine k\u0131sa bas\u0131\u015f ad\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 1 km/s'den 5 km/s'ye \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r."},adas_matrix_led_glare_free_high_beam_unlock:{name:"Matrix LED G\xf6z Almayan Adaptif Uzun Far Kilidi",desc:"Kuzey Amerika ara\xe7lar\u0131nda Avrupa spek adaptif g\xf6lgelemeli uzun farlar\u0131 a\xe7ar."},adas_traffic_jam_assist_follow_fine_tune:{name:"Trafik S\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131 Asistan\u0131 Dur-Kalk Yeniden Ba\u015flama S\xfcresi",desc:"Otomatik dur-kalk yeniden ba\u015flama s\xfcresini 3 saniyeden 15 saniyeye uzat\u0131r."},adas_rear_radar_blind_spot_zero_point_reset:{name:"Arka K\xf6r Nokta Radar S\u0131f\u0131r Noktas\u0131 A\xe7\u0131 Kalibrasyonu",desc:"Tampon onar\u0131m\u0131 veya s\xf6k\xfcm\xfc sonras\u0131nda arka radar a\xe7\u0131 y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc yeniden kalibre eder."},adas_surround_camera_stitching_recalib:{name:"\xc7evre G\xf6r\xfc\u015f Kameras\u0131 Dinamik G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc Birle\u015ftirme Hizalamas\u0131",desc:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f esnas\u0131nda kameralar aras\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc birle\u015ftirme \xe7izgi kalibrasyonunu \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},adas_steering_angle_sensor_zero_point_reset:{name:"Direksiyon A\xe7\u0131 Sens\xf6r\xfc (SAS) S\u0131f\u0131r Noktas\u0131 Kalibrasyonu",desc:"\xd6n d\xfczen / rot ayar\u0131 sonras\u0131nda direksiyon merkez a\xe7\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 0.0\xb0 seviyesine s\u0131f\u0131rlar."},adas_cross_traffic_alert_sensitivity_adjust:{name:"Arka \xc7apraz Trafik Uyar\u0131 (RCTA) Alg\u0131lama Menzili",desc:"Geri \xe7\u0131karken yakla\u015fan ara\xe7lar i\xe7in yan radar alg\u0131lama mesafesini art\u0131r\u0131r."},adas_aeb_emergency_braking_threshold_preview:{name:"Otomatik Acil Fren (AEB) Uyar\u0131 Erkenlik Derecesi",desc:"\xd6nden \xe7arp\u0131\u015fma uyar\u0131lar\u0131 i\xe7in ikaz sesi zamanlamas\u0131n\u0131 ince ayarlar."},adas_night_vision_camera_alignment:{name:"K\u0131z\u0131l\xf6tesi Gece G\xf6r\xfc\u015f Termal Kamera Hizalamas\u0131",desc:"K\u0131z\u0131l\xf6tesi gece g\xf6r\xfc\u015f kameras\u0131 hedef hizalama do\u011frulama dizisini ba\u015flat\u0131r."},adas_dms_driver_monitoring_ir_threshold:{name:"DMS S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Dikkat Kameras\u0131 K\u0131z\u0131l\xf6tesi Hassasiyeti",desc:"Koyu renk polarize g\xfcne\u015f g\xf6zl\xfc\u011f\xfc takan s\xfcr\xfcc\xfcler i\xe7in g\xf6z takip hassasiyetini ayarlar."},toyota_soft_close_door_retrofit_coding:{name:"Vakum Kap\u0131 (Soft-Close) Akt\xfcat\xf6r Kodlamas\u0131",desc:"G\xf6vde kontrol mod\xfcl\xfcnde elektrikli vakum kap\u0131 kilitlerini etkinle\u015ftirir."},toyota_digital_speedometer_display_enable:{name:"Dijital H\u0131z G\xf6stergesi Ekran\u0131",desc:"Analog kadran LCD ekran\u0131na b\xfcy\xfck dijital h\u0131z okumas\u0131 ekler."},toyota_walk_away_auto_lock_sensitivity:{name:"Uzakla\u015f\u0131nca Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilitleme Hassasiyeti",desc:"Anahtarla ara\xe7tan uzakla\u015f\u0131rken otomatik kilitleme mesafesini ayarlar."},toyota_jbl_3d_eq_audio_profile_unlock:{name:"JBL Premium 3D Konser Ekolayz\u0131r Profilleri",desc:"JBL ses sisteminde 3D konser salonu ekolayz\u0131r profillerini a\xe7ar."},toyota_ev_mode_throttle_override_suppression:{name:"EV Modu Elektrikli S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Gaz Limiti Bast\u0131rma",desc:"Orta derece gaz bas\u0131mlar\u0131nda benzinli motorun devreye girmesini engeller."},ford_sync3_engineering_diagnostics_page:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Dokunmatik Ekran M\xfchendislik Te\u015fhis Sayfalar\u0131",desc:"SYNC ekran\u0131nda ham GPS, APIM test ve ses frekans te\u015fhis ekranlar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},ford_rear_seat_entertainment_unlock:{name:"Arka Koltuk HDMI / Video E\u011flence Ses Aktar\u0131m\u0131",desc:"Arka koltuk ekranlar\u0131 i\xe7in kabin kulakl\u0131k ses ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirir."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_light_expansion:{name:"Bambi Modu Uzun Far + Sis Far\u0131 E\u015fzamanl\u0131 Ayd\u0131nlatma",desc:"Uzun farlar yak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xf6n sis farlar\u0131n\u0131n s\xf6nmesini engeller."},ford_auto_engine_idle_shutdown_30min_override:{name:"30 Dakika R\xf6lanti Otomatik Motor Kapanma \u0130ptali",desc:"Park halindeyken motorun 30 dakika sonra otomatik stop etmesini engeller."},hyundai_n_grin_shift_retrofit_enable:{name:"N Grin Shift (NGS) 20 Saniyelik Overboost Aktivasyonu",desc:"ECU'da direksiyon NGS d\xfc\u011fmesi overboost fonksiyonunu aktifle\u015ftirir."},hyundai_smart_tailgate_approach_distance:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Bagaj Kapa\u011f\u0131 Yakla\u015fma Mesafe Sens\xf6r\xfc",desc:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 bagaj\u0131n a\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131 i\xe7in gereken bekleme s\xfcresini (3sn -> 1sn) d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr."},hyundai_digital_cluster_n_performance_theme:{name:"N Performance Dijital G\xf6sterge Paneli Tasar\u0131m\u0131",desc:"Standart LCD kadrana N-Performance k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 vites \u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131 d\xfczenini uygular."},stellantis_scr_adblue_warning_threshold_adjust:{name:"SCR AdBlue Uyar\u0131 Mesafe E\u015fi\u011fi Ayar\u0131",desc:"\u0130lk AdBlue dolum ikaz mesafesini 2400 km'den 1000 km'ye d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcr."},stellantis_jeep_trail_rated_offroad_pages:{name:"Jeep Uconnect Off-Road Arazi Telemetri Sayfalar\u0131",desc:"Uconnect ekran\u0131nda e\u011fim, yat\u0131\u015f, tekerlek a\xe7\u0131lar\u0131 ve hararet sayfalar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},stellantis_peugeot_icockpit_3d_color_schemes:{name:"Peugeot 3D i-Cockpit \xd6zel Renk Paletleri",desc:"3D holografik g\xf6sterge paneli i\xe7in Bak\u0131r ve Kuvars renk temalar\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7ar."},gm_super_cruise_follow_distance_adjust:{name:"Super Cruise Hands-Free Takip Mesafesi Ofseti",desc:"Otonom Super Cruise otoyol s\xfcr\xfc\u015f\xfc esnas\u0131nda g\xfcvenli takip mesafesini ayarlar."},gm_instrument_hud_calibration_reset:{name:"Head-Up Display (HUD) Pozisyon ve E\u011fim S\u0131f\u0131rlamas\u0131",desc:"\xd6n cam HUD projekt\xf6r\xfcn\xfcn g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc a\xe7\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve ufkunu s\u0131f\u0131r seviyesine kalibre eder."},gm_afm_v8_cylinder_lock_no_v4_drop:{name:"AFM / DFM Silindir \u0130ptali (S\xfcrekli V8 Modu)",desc:"Motorun V4 moduna ge\xe7mesini engelleyerek s\xfcrekli 8 silindir \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},dodge_ram_truck_fog_lights_with_high_beam:{name:"RAM Truck Uzun Far ile Sis Far\u0131 Kombinasyonu",desc:"Uzun farlar yak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda sis farlar\u0131n\u0131n otomatik s\xf6nmesini engeller."},toyota_keyless_window_down:{name:"Toyota Anahtarl\u0131k Penceresi A\xe7\u0131k (Kilidi Tut)",desc:"Uzaktan kumandadaki K\u0130L\u0130T A\xc7MA d\xfc\u011fmesine bas\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda t\xfcm elektrikli camlar a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r."},toyota_seatbelt_chime_disable:{name:"Toyota Yolcu Emniyet Kemeri Alarm\u0131n\u0131 Kapatma (Park/Off-Road)",desc:"Yolcu koltu\u011funda s\xfcrekli akustik emniyet kemeri uyar\u0131 sesini devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131r."},honda_walkaway_auto_lock:{name:"Honda Walk-Away Otomatik Kap\u0131 Kilidi",desc:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar arac\u0131n 2,5 m yar\u0131\xe7ap\u0131ndan \xe7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda t\xfcm kap\u0131lar\u0131 otomatik olarak kilitler."},volvo_speed_limiter_unlock:{name:"Volvo 180 km/saat Fabrika H\u0131z S\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n Uzat\u0131lmas\u0131",desc:"Pist / Otoban performans kullan\u0131m\u0131 i\xe7in 180 km/saat fabrika h\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar."},byd_v2l_3kw_power_unlock:{name:"BYD Ara\xe7tan Y\xfcke (V2L) 3,6kW AC \xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Modu",desc:"Kamp aletleri i\xe7in harici 220V/3,6kW V2L AC de\u015farj portunu etkinle\u015ftirir."},xiaomi_su7_drift_mode_unlock:{name:"Xiaomi SU7 Track Drift Modu ve Arka Tork \xd6nyarg\u0131s\u0131",desc:"%100 arka motor tork \xf6nyarg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve ESC Takip Drift Modunu etkinle\u015ftirir."},vag_scandinavian_drl:{name:"\u0130skandinav DRL G\xfcnd\xfcz Far\u0131 Modu (VAG)",desc:"\xd6n g\xfcnd\xfcz farlar\u0131yla birlikte arka stop lambalar\u0131n\u0131n da s\xfcrekli yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_mirror_dip_reverse:{name:"Geri Viteste Sa\u011f Ayna \u0130ndirme",desc:"Geri vitese tak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kald\u0131r\u0131m kenar\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6rmek i\xe7in sa\u011f dikiz aynas\u0131n\u0131 otomatik a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 e\u011fer."},vag_dynamic_turn_signal:{name:"Dinamik Kayar Sinyal Modu (VAG)",desc:"Uyumlu LED stoplarda kayar dinamik sinyal efektini etkinle\u015ftirir."},vag_seatbelt_warning_duration:{name:"Emniyet Kemeri Uyar\u0131s\u0131 S\xfcre Ayar\u0131 (VAG)",desc:"Sesli emniyet kemeri ikaz biplerinin s\xfcresini k\u0131salt\u0131r veya kapat\u0131r."},vag_sunroof_remote:{name:"Kumandadan Sunroof Konfor A\xe7ma/Kapama (VAG)",desc:"Anahtar tu\u015funa uzun basarak panoramik sunroofun uzaktan kontrol\xfcn\xfc sa\u011flar."},vag_acc_distance_preset:{name:"ACC Adaptif H\u0131z Sabitleyici Varsay\u0131lan Takip Mesafesi (VAG)",desc:"Kontak a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda varsay\u0131lan ACC radar takip mesafesi profilini ayarlar."},vag_infotainment_startup_logo:{name:"Multimedya Ekran\u0131 Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 Logosu (VAG)",desc:"Multimedya ekran a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f g\xf6rselini R-Line, GTI veya RS logosuna \xe7evirir."},vag_ambient_color_cycle:{name:"\u0130\xe7 Ambiyans Ayd\u0131nlatma Renk Yelpazesi (VAG)",desc:"Ara\xe7 ayarlar men\xfcs\xfcnde i\xe7 ambiyans ayd\u0131nlatma i\xe7in 30 renk se\xe7ene\u011fi a\xe7ar."},vag_service_interval_custom:{name:"\xd6zel Bak\u0131m Periyodu ve Mesafe E\u015fi\u011fi (VAG)",desc:"Bir sonraki servis uyar\u0131s\u0131 i\xe7in \xf6zel km ve g\xfcn hedeflerini tan\u0131mlar."},vag_door_handle_lights_reverse:{name:"Geri Vites Kademesinde Kap\u0131 Kolu Ayd\u0131nlatmalar\u0131 (VAG)",desc:"Geri vitese tak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda zemin g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfc i\xe7in d\u0131\u015f kap\u0131 kolu LEDlerini yakar."},bmw_msport_exhaust_burble:{name:"M-Sport Egzoz Patlatma ve \xc7atlama Yo\u011funlu\u011fu (BMW)",desc:"Sport modda gaz kesmedeki egzoz patlatma ve burble sesinin agresifli\u011fini ayarlar."},bmw_welcome_light_sequence:{name:"Kar\u015f\u0131lama Far Animasyonu ve Melek G\xf6zler (BMW)",desc:"Kilit a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda LED far ve Angel Eyes kar\u015f\u0131lama seremonisini \xf6zelle\u015ftirir."},bmw_service_history_menu:{name:"Dijital Servis Ge\xe7mi\u015fi Men\xfcs\xfc (BMW)",desc:"iDrive multimedya ekran\u0131nda dijital bak\u0131m defteri men\xfcs\xfcn\xfc aktif eder."},bmw_hud_speed_display:{name:"Head-Up Display Dijital H\u0131z G\xf6stergesi (BMW)",desc:"\xd6n cama yans\u0131t\u0131lan HUD ekran\u0131na anl\u0131k dijital h\u0131z verisini ekler."},bmw_cornering_lights_fog:{name:"Sis Farlar\u0131 ile D\xf6n\xfc\u015f Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"Direksiyon \xe7evrildi\u011finde veya sinyal verildi\u011finde ilgili \xf6n sis far\u0131n\u0131 yakar."},bmw_easy_entry_steering:{name:"Easy Entry Konforlu Bini\u015f/\u0130ni\u015f Direksiyon Hareketi (BMW)",desc:"Motor kapat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda elektrikli direksiyonu yukar\u0131 \xe7ekerek kolay ini\u015f sa\u011flar."},bmw_bluetooth_audio_enable:{name:"Geli\u015fmi\u015f Bluetooth Kablosuz M\xfczik Ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"iDrive multimedya \xfcnitesinde A2DP kablosuz Bluetooth m\xfczik \xe7almay\u0131 a\xe7ar."},bmw_door_handle_lights_reverse:{name:"Geri Vites Kademesinde D\u0131\u015f Kap\u0131 Kolu Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"Geri vitese tak\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xe7evre g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfc i\xe7in d\u0131\u015f kap\u0131 kollar\u0131 LED \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 yakar."},toyota_auto_headlight_threshold:{name:"Otomatik Far I\u015f\u0131k Sens\xf6r\xfc Hassasiyeti (Toyota)",desc:"Otomatik farlar\u0131n hava karar\u0131rken devreye girme \u0131\u015f\u0131k hassasiyetini ayarlar."},toyota_turn_signal_click_volume:{name:"Sinyal Sesi Hoparl\xf6r Ses Seviyesi (Toyota)",desc:"Sinyal verildi\u011finde \xe7\u0131kan klik uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n ses seviyesini ayarlar."},toyota_smart_key_approach_lights:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar Yakla\u015fma Kar\u015f\u0131lama Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 (Toyota)",desc:"Anahtar ile araca yakla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda dikiz ayna alt\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131lama \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 yakar."},toyota_rear_hatch_behavior:{name:"Elektrikli Bagaj Kapa\u011f\u0131 A\xe7ma/Kapama Mant\u0131\u011f\u0131 (Toyota)",desc:"Uzaktan kumanda bagaj tu\u015funun \xe7al\u0131\u015fma ve a\xe7\u0131lma y\xfcksekli\u011fi mant\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 d\xfczenler."},toyota_open_windows_smart_key:{name:"Kumandadan Uzaktan Cam \u0130ndirme (Toyota)",desc:"Kilit a\xe7ma tu\u015funa uzun basarak t\xfcm camlar\u0131n indirilebilmesini aktif eder."},toyota_interior_light_dim_timer:{name:"Kabin \u0130\xe7 Ayd\u0131nlatma Kapanma Gecikmesi (Toyota)",desc:"Kap\u0131lar kapat\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra tavan lambalar\u0131n\u0131n yava\u015f\xe7a s\xf6nme s\xfcresini ayarlar."},toyota_panic_alarm_remote:{name:"Uzaktan Kumanda Panik Alarm\u0131 Fonksiyonu (Toyota)",desc:"Kumanda tu\u015fu ile ara\xe7 korna panik alarm\u0131n\u0131n tetiklenmesini a\xe7ar/kapat\u0131r."},toyota_eco_drive_indicator:{name:"ECO S\xfcr\xfc\u015f G\xf6sterge I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve Grafi\u011fi (Toyota)",desc:"Ekonomik s\xfcr\xfc\u015f yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\xf6sterge panelinde ye\u015fil ECO \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 yakar."},hyundai_coming_home_duration:{name:"Refakat Farlar\u0131 Ayd\u0131nlatma Gecikmesi (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Ara\xe7tan indikten sonra \xf6n k\u0131sa farlar\u0131n 30 saniye yolu ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},hyundai_drl_menu_toggle:{name:"G\xfcnd\xfcz Farlar\u0131 G\xf6sterge Men\xfc Kontrol\xfc (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneli ayarlar men\xfcs\xfcne g\xfcnd\xfcz far\u0131 a\xe7ma/kapama se\xe7ene\u011fi ekler."},hyundai_welcome_sequence:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar Yakla\u015fma Kar\u015f\u0131lama & Ayna A\xe7ma (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Araca yakla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda yan aynalar\u0131 a\xe7ar ve kap\u0131 kolu \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 yakar."},hyundai_interior_light_delay:{name:"Kabin \u0130\xe7 Lambalar\u0131 Otomatik Kapanma S\xfcresi (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Ak\xfc tasarrufu i\xe7in i\xe7 ayd\u0131nlatmalar\u0131n otomatik kesilme s\xfcresini ayarlar."},hyundai_heat_pump_efficiency:{name:"EV Is\u0131 Pompas\u0131 Termal Verimlilik Modu (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"So\u011fuk havalarda elektrikli ara\xe7 \u0131s\u0131 pompas\u0131n\u0131n enerji verimlili\u011fini optimize eder."},tesla_track_mode_params:{name:"Pist Modu Tork Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 ve Stratejisi (Tesla)",desc:"\xd6n/arka motor g\xfc\xe7 da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 ve stabilite kontrol m\xfcdahalesini ayarlar."},tesla_regen_brake_strength:{name:"Rejeneratif Frenleme G\xfc\xe7 Profili (Tesla)",desc:"Gaz pedal\u0131ndan ayak \xe7ekildi\u011finde bataryaya d\xf6nen \u015farj \u015fiddetini ayarlar."},tesla_walkaway_door_lock:{name:"Uzakla\u015f\u0131nca Telefon Anahtar ile Otomatik Kilit (Tesla)",desc:"Telefon anahtarla ara\xe7tan uzakla\u015f\u0131l\u0131nca kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitler ve korna ile onaylar."},tesla_acceleration_boost_unlock:{name:"H\u0131zlanma Takviyesi Motor S\xfcr\xfcc\xfc Yan\u0131t\u0131 (Tesla)",desc:"0-100 km/s h\u0131zlanmas\u0131n\u0131 iyile\u015ftirmek i\xe7in inverter gaz yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 keskinle\u015ftirir."},tesla_interior_ambient_color:{name:"Kabin Ayak Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131 Ambiyans Rengi (Tesla)",desc:"Ayak alt\u0131 LED ambiyans \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131n RGB renk paletini \xf6zelle\u015ftirir."},audi_matrix_led_animation:{name:"Matrix LED Far Dinamik Kar\u015f\u0131lama Dans\u0131 (Audi)",desc:"Kilit a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda Matrix LED farlarda dinamik \u0131\u015f\u0131k koreografisini ba\u015flat\u0131r."},audi_mmi_startup_screen:{name:"MMI Dokunmatik Ekran Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 Temas\u0131 (Audi)",desc:"MMI orta ekran a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f animasyonunu S, RS veya e-tron temas\u0131na \xe7evirir."},audi_drive_select_efficiency:{name:"Audi Drive Select Verimlilik (Efficiency) Modu (Audi)",desc:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Se\xe7imi men\xfcs\xfcne yak\u0131t tasarrufu sa\u011flayan Efficiency modunu ekler."},audi_laptimer_boost_display:{name:"Tur Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131 & Turbo Bas\u0131n\xe7 G\xf6stergesi (Audi)",desc:"Dijital g\xf6sterge ekran\u0131na tur zaman \xf6l\xe7er ve anl\u0131k turbo bar bas\u0131nc\u0131n\u0131 ekler."},audi_needle_sweep_gauge:{name:"Spor G\xf6sterge \u0130bre Selamlama Testi (Audi)",desc:"Kontak a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda kadran ibrelerinin sona vurup geri gelmesini sa\u011flar."},skoda_coming_home_lights:{name:"Refakat Far Ayd\u0131nlatma Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 (Skoda)",desc:"Ara\xe7tan indikten sonra farlar\u0131n yolu ayd\u0131nlatma s\xfcresini belirler."},skoda_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Konfor Sinyal Vuru\u015f Say\u0131s\u0131 Ayar\u0131 (Skoda)",desc:"\u015eerit de\u011fi\u015ftirme sinyal vuru\u015f say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 3 ila 5 aras\u0131nda ayarlar."},cupra_sport_display_menu:{name:"Cupra Performans G\xf6stergesi & G-Metre Men\xfcs\xfc (Cupra)",desc:"G\xf6sterge ekran\u0131nda G-kuvveti \xf6l\xe7er, kW g\xfc\xe7 ve ya\u011f s\u0131cakl\u0131k men\xfcs\xfcn\xfc a\xe7ar."},cupra_virtual_cockpit_copper:{name:"Bak\u0131r Temal\u0131 G\xf6sterge Grafik Detaylar\u0131 (Cupra)",desc:"Dijital g\xf6sterge paneline \xf6zel Cupra bak\u0131r rengi vurgu temas\u0131n\u0131 uygular."},vag_brake_disc_drying:{name:"Ya\u011fmurda Fren Diski Kurutma Fonksiyonu (VAG)",desc:"Ya\u011fmurlu havalarda diskteki suyu temizlemek i\xe7in fren balatalar\u0131n\u0131 hafif\xe7e yak\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r."},vag_tourist_mode_lights:{name:"Turist Modu Far I\u015f\u0131k Deseni (VAG)",desc:"Yurt d\u0131\u015f\u0131 s\xfcr\xfc\u015flerde far h\xfczmesini sol/sa\u011f direksiyon trafi\u011fine g\xf6re ayarlar."},vag_hood_warning_mute:{name:"Kaput A\xe7\u0131k \u0130kaz Sesini Kapatma (VAG)",desc:"Kaput mandal\u0131 a\xe7\u0131kken g\xf6stergede \xe7alan s\xfcrekli sesli ikaz\u0131 susturur."},vag_emergency_brake_hazard:{name:"Ani Frenlemede Otomatik D\xf6rtl\xfc Fla\u015f\xf6r (VAG)",desc:"Sert fren yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda arkadaki ara\xe7lar\u0131 uyarmak i\xe7in d\xf6rtl\xfcleri h\u0131zl\u0131ca yakar."},vag_sunroof_comfort_open:{name:"Sunroof Uzaktan Kumanda A\xe7\u0131lma Pozisyonu (VAG)",desc:"Kumandadan cam a\xe7ma bas\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda sunroofun devrilme mi yoksa tam m\u0131 a\xe7\u0131laca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 se\xe7er."},bmw_ecopro_display_variant:{name:"ECO PRO G\xf6sterge Paneli Grafik Temas\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"ECO PRO modundaki mavi tasarruf g\xf6stergesi grafik stilini \xf6zelle\u015ftirir."},bmw_volume_bar_hud:{name:"Head-Up Display Ses Seviyesi \xc7ubu\u011fu (BMW)",desc:"Direksiyondan ses ayarland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda seviye \xe7ubu\u011funu \xf6n cama yans\u0131t\u0131r."},bmw_anti_dazzle_mirror:{name:"Otomatik Kararan Dikiz Aynas\u0131 Hassasiyeti (BMW)",desc:"Arkadaki ara\xe7 farlar\u0131na g\xf6re dikiz aynas\u0131n\u0131n otomatik kararma hassasiyetini ayarlar."},bmw_camera_pdc_warning_mute:{name:"PDC Park Sens\xf6r\xfc ve Kamera Kapanma H\u0131z\u0131 (BMW)",desc:"Park kameralar\u0131 ve sens\xf6rlerin s\xfcr\xfc\u015fe ba\u015flarken kapanaca\u011f\u0131 h\u0131z e\u015fi\u011fini y\xfckseltir."},toyota_pcs_distance_preset:{name:"\xc7arp\u0131\u015fma \xd6nleyici Sistem (PCS) Uyar\u0131s\u0131 Mesafesi (Toyota)",desc:"Olas\u0131 \xe7arp\u0131\u015fma uyar\u0131 radar\u0131n\u0131n varsay\u0131lan ikaz mesafesini tan\u0131mlar."},toyota_bsm_timing:{name:"K\xf6r Nokta Uyar\u0131 Sistemi (BSM) \u0130kaz Zamanlamas\u0131 (Toyota)",desc:"Aynadaki k\xf6r nokta uyar\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n yanma zamanlama hassasiyetini ayarlar."},toyota_ac_noise_reduction:{name:"Klima Kompres\xf6r\xfc Sessiz \xc7al\u0131\u015fma Modu (Toyota)",desc:"Kabin sessizli\u011fi i\xe7in klima \xfcfleme fan\u0131n\u0131n maksimum g\xfcr\xfclt\xfc seviyesini s\u0131n\u0131rlar."},toyota_sflow_control:{name:"S-Flow Ak\u0131ll\u0131 \u0130klimlendirme Tek Yolcu Modu (Toyota)",desc:"Klimay\u0131 koltuk sens\xf6rlerine g\xf6re yaln\u0131zca ara\xe7 i\xe7indeki yolculara y\xf6nlendirir."},toyota_relock_timeout:{name:"Kap\u0131 Kilitlenmeme Durumunda Otomatik Yeniden Kilitleme (Toyota)",desc:"Uzaktan kilit a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131ktan sonra kap\u0131 a\xe7\u0131lmazsa yeniden kilitlenme s\xfcresini ayarlar."},lexus_mark_levinson_audio_profile:{name:"Mark Levinson Surround Ses Akustik Profili (Lexus)",desc:"Mark Levinson hoparl\xf6rler i\xe7in 3 boyutlu mekanik ses profilini optimize eder."},lexus_ev_mode_beeper_mute:{name:"D\xfc\u015f\xfck H\u0131z Sessiz EV Elektrikli S\xfcr\xfc\u015f \u0130kaz Bipi (Lexus)",desc:"Elektrikli modda giderken d\u0131\u015far\u0131ya verilen yaya ikaz sesini kapat\u0131r."},lexus_easy_access_seat:{name:"Kolay Giri\u015f/\xc7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Koltuk ve Direksiyon Geri \xc7ekme (Lexus)",desc:"\u0130ni\u015f ve bini\u015flerde s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc koltu\u011funu otomatik geriye s\xfcrer."},nissan_epower_regen_mode:{name:"e-POWER Tek Pedal Rejeneratif Frenleme Modu (Nissan)",desc:"e-Pedal tek pedalla s\xfcr\xfc\u015fteki rejeneratif \u015farj ve yava\u015flama seviyesini ayarlar."},nissan_propilot_assist_timing:{name:"ProPILOT \u015eerit Takip Direksiyon M\xfcdahale Hassasiyeti (Nissan)",desc:"ProPILOT otonom \u015ferit merkezleme direksiyon m\xfcdahale derecesini ayarlar."},nissan_intelligent_around_view:{name:"\xc7evre G\xf6r\xfc\u015f Kamera Sisteminin Otomatik A\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131 (Nissan)",desc:"\xd6n sens\xf6rler engel alg\u0131lad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda 360 derece kameray\u0131 ekrana getirir."},mazda_g_vectoring_display:{name:"G-Vectoring Control Dinamik Viraj Grafi\u011fi (Mazda)",desc:"Virajlarda G-Vectoring tork da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 grafi\u011fini g\xf6stergeye yans\u0131t\u0131r."},mazda_ieloop_capacitor_monitor:{name:"i-ELOOP Fren Enerjisi Kapasit\xf6r G\xf6stergesi (Mazda)",desc:"Frenleme esnas\u0131nda kapasit\xf6rde toplanan enerjiyi ekranda canl\u0131 g\xf6sterir."},mazda_smart_city_brake_sens:{name:"\u015eehir \u0130\xe7i Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Fren Deste\u011fi (SCBS) Hassasiyeti (Mazda)",desc:"D\xfc\u015f\xfck h\u0131zlarda \xe7al\u0131\u015fan otomatik \u015fehir i\xe7i acil fren sens\xf6r mesafesini ayarlar."},subaru_eyesight_distance_preset:{name:"EyeSight Adaptif H\u0131z Kontrol\xfc Varsay\u0131lan Takip Mesafesi (Subaru)",desc:"EyeSight stereo kameras\u0131n\u0131n a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015ftaki takip mesafesi ayar\u0131n\u0131 tan\u0131mlar."},subaru_xmode_auto_engage:{name:"X-Mode Arazi \xc7eki\u015f Sistemi Otomatik Devreye Girme (Subaru)",desc:"Kaygan zeminde X-Mode arazi \xe7eki\u015f modunun otomatik a\xe7\u0131lma kayma e\u015fi\u011fini ayarlar."},subaru_steering_responsive_headlights:{name:"Direksiyona Duyarl\u0131 Adaptif Far Sistemi (SRH) (Subaru)",desc:"Viraja g\xf6re d\xf6nen adaptif farlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131l\u0131p kapat\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},genesis_sport_plus_mode:{name:"Sport+ Performans ve Elektronik S\xfcspansiyon Modu (Genesis)",desc:"ESC \u0130ptalli ve sertle\u015ftirilmi\u015f amortis\xf6rl\xfc Sport+ pist modunu a\xe7ar."},genesis_ambient_active_light:{name:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Moduyla Senkronize Aktif Ambiyans I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 (Genesis)",desc:"Ambiyans ayd\u0131nlatma rengini se\xe7ilen s\xfcr\xfc\u015f moduna g\xf6re otomatik de\u011fi\u015ftirir."},volvo_city_safety_warning:{name:"City Safety Acil Fren \u0130kaz Hassasiyeti (Volvo)",desc:"City Safety acil fren sisteminin \xe7arp\u0131\u015fma uyar\u0131 zamanlamas\u0131n\u0131 ayarlar."},chery_ar_navigation_hud:{name:"AR Art\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f Ger\xe7eklik Navigasyon Yans\u0131tma (Chery)",desc:"\xd6n cama yans\u0131t\u0131lan HUD \xfczerine 3 boyutlu oklarla navigasyon \xe7izgisini ekler."},jlr_terrain_response_preset:{name:"Terrain Response Arazi Modu Haf\u0131zas\u0131 (Jaguar Land Rover)",desc:"Son se\xe7ilen Terrain Response arazi modunu kontak a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda hat\u0131rlar."},jlr_adaptive_dynamics_firm:{name:"Adaptive Dynamics Amortis\xf6r Sertlik Profili (Jaguar Land Rover)",desc:"Elektronik amortis\xf6rlerin varsay\u0131lan sertlik profilini tan\u0131mlar."},jlr_wading_sensor_alert:{name:"Derin Sudan Ge\xe7me Derinlik \u0130kaz Uyar\u0131 E\u015fi\u011fi (Jaguar Land Rover)",desc:"Sudan ge\xe7erken ultrasonik derinlik uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n \xf6tt\xfc\u011f\xfc su seviyesini ayarlar."},alfa_dna_dynamic_memory:{name:"Alfa DNA Se\xe7ici Dynamic Modu Haf\u0131zas\u0131 (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Kontak yeniden a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda DNA anahtar\u0131n\u0131n Dynamic modunu korur."},alfa_q4_torque_split:{name:"Q4 D\xf6rt \xc7eker Tork Da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m Grafi\u011fi (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"D\xf6rt \xe7eker sisteminin \xf6n ve arka aksa anl\u0131k tork da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6stergede sergiler."},li_auto_range_extender_mode:{name:"REV Jenerat\xf6r \u015earj Koruma Seviyesi (Li Auto)",desc:"Menzil uzat\u0131c\u0131 jenerat\xf6r motorun devreye girece\u011fi batarya seviyesini ayarlar."},li_auto_cinema_seat_position:{name:"Sinema / Tiyatro Modu Koltuk Ergonomi Konumu (Li Auto)",desc:"Sinema modu a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda arka koltuklar\u0131 yat\u0131r\u0131r ve ayak dinlendirmeyi a\xe7ar."},zeekr_drift_mode_torque:{name:"Performans Yanlama (Drift) Modu Arka Tork Aktar\u0131m\u0131 (Zeekr)",desc:"Kontroll\xfc drift i\xe7in g\xfcc\xfcn %100'\xfcn\xfc arka elektrik motoruna y\xf6nlendirir."},zeekr_ambient_beat_sync:{name:"M\xfczik Ritmiyle Senkronize Ambiyans I\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 Dans\u0131 (Zeekr)",desc:"\xc7alan m\xfczi\u011fin bas ve ritmine g\xf6re i\xe7 ayd\u0131nlatma renklerini dans ettirir."},tata_drive_mode_voice:{name:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Modu Ge\xe7i\u015finde Sesli Anons Uyar\u0131s\u0131 (Tata)",desc:"S\xfcr\xfc\u015f modu de\u011fi\u015ftirildi\u011finde hoparl\xf6rden T\xfcrk\xe7e/\u0130ngilizce sesli anons yapar."},mahindra_zip_zap_zoom_custom:{name:"Zip/Zap/Zoom Gaz Tepkisi S\xfcr\xfc\u015f E\u011frisi (Mahindra)",desc:"Zip, Zap ve Zoom s\xfcr\xfc\u015f modlar\u0131ndaki gaz pedal\u0131 tepki e\u011frisini \xf6zelle\u015ftirir."},fun_cyberpunk_cluster_theme:{name:"Cyberpunk Neon Grafikli G\xf6sterge Tasar\u0131m Temas\u0131",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneline siber neon turkuaz ve turuncu dijital spor temay\u0131 uygular."},fun_exhaust_flame_sound_effect:{name:"Kablosuz M\xfczik Sisteminde V8 Egzoz Patlatma FX",desc:"Vites ge\xe7i\u015flerinde kabin i\xe7i hoparl\xf6rlerden V8 egzoz patlatma efekti \xe7alar."},fun_matrix_light_show_welcome:{name:"M\xfczikli Adaptif Far I\u015f\u0131k Dans\u0131 \u015eovu (Light Show)",desc:"Kilit a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda farlar ve sinyallerle ritmik \u0131\u015f\u0131k \u015fovu sergiler."},fun_stealth_fighter_display:{name:"Hayalet Avc\u0131 U\xe7a\u011f\u0131 Gece S\xfcr\xfc\u015f\xfc G\xf6sterge Modu",desc:"Gece g\xf6z yormamas\u0131 i\xe7in h\u0131z kadran\u0131 hari\xe7 t\xfcm g\xf6sterge \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcr."},vag_lap_timer_oil_temp:{name:"Pist Tur Sayac\u0131 & Motor Ya\u011f S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneline anl\u0131k motor ya\u011f\u0131 s\u0131cakl\u0131k derecesini ve pist tur s\xfcresi kronometresini ekler."},vag_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"\u0130skandinav G\xfcnd\xfcz Farlar\u0131 (Arka Stoplar Aktif)",desc:"G\xfcnd\xfcz farlar\u0131 yanarken arka LED stop lambalar\u0131n\u0131n da s\xfcrekli yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_drl_handbrake_off:{name:"El Freni \xc7ekilince G\xfcnd\xfcz Far\u0131 Kapatma",desc:"El freni \xe7ekildi\u011finde g\xfcnd\xfcz s\xfcr\xfc\u015f farlar\u0131n\u0131n otomatik olarak s\xf6nmesini sa\u011flar."},vag_drl_menu_in_mib:{name:"Multimedya Ekran\u0131nda G\xfcnd\xfcz Far\u0131 Men\xfcs\xfc",desc:"Multimedya ara\xe7 ayarlar\u0131 men\xfcs\xfcne G\xfcnd\xfcz Farlar\u0131n\u0131 A\xe7/Kapat onay kutusunu ekler."},vag_rain_closing_windows:{name:"Ya\u011fmurda Otomatik Cam & Sunroof Kapatma",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitliyken ya\u011fmur sens\xf6r\xfc ya\u011fmur alg\u0131lad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda a\xe7\u0131k camlar\u0131 ve sunroofu otomatik kapat\u0131r."},vag_audi_dynamic_throttle:{name:"Audi Do\u011frudan Gaz Pedal\u0131 Tepkisi",desc:"Gaz pedal\u0131ndaki gecikmeyi kald\u0131rarak motorun pedala an\u0131nda ve do\u011frudan tepki vermesini sa\u011flar."},vag_xds_differential_sensitivity:{name:"XDS Elektronik Diferansiyel Kilidi Hassasiyeti",desc:"Virajlarda i\xe7 tekerle\u011fe daha fazla fren torku uygulayarak \xf6nden kaymay\u0131 azalt\u0131r ve yol tutu\u015fu art\u0131r\u0131r."},vag_offroad_display_mib:{name:"Off-Road Telemetri Ekran\u0131 & Pusula",desc:"Multimedya ekran\u0131na direksiyon a\xe7\u0131s\u0131, pusula ve ya\u011f/so\u011futma s\u0131v\u0131s\u0131 s\u0131cakl\u0131k g\xf6stergelerini ekler."},vag_highbeam_assist_memory:{name:"Otomatik Uzun Far Asistan\u0131 Haf\u0131zas\u0131",desc:"Kontak kapat\u0131l\u0131p a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda Otomatik Uzun Far (Light Assist) modunun a\xe7\u0131k kalmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},vag_comfort_turn_signals_count:{name:"Konfor Sinyal Yan\u0131p S\xf6nme Say\u0131s\u0131",desc:"\u015eerit de\u011fi\u015ftirirken sinyal koluna dokunuldu\u011funda sinyalin 3 yerine 4 veya 5 kez yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},bmw_video_in_motion_speedlock:{name:"Hareket Halinde Video \u0130zleme (VIM)",desc:"Ara\xe7 hareket halindeyken iDrive ekran\u0131nda USB ve video oynat\u0131m h\u0131z kilidini kald\u0131r\u0131r."},bmw_digital_speedo_kombi:{name:"G\xf6sterge Panelinde Dijital H\u0131z (V= km/h)",desc:"G\xf6sterge panelindeki yol bilgisayar\u0131 ekran\u0131na anl\u0131k say\u0131sal dijital h\u0131z g\xf6stergesini ekler."},bmw_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Chirp on Lock / Unlock",desc:"Adds acoustic confirmation chirp via alarm siren with volume setting in iDrive menu."},bmw_auto_mirror_fold_comfort_close:{name:"Tek T\u0131kla An\u0131nda Ayna Katlama",desc:"Kumandadan kilit butonuna bas\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bekleme s\xfcresi olmadan aynalar\u0131n an\u0131nda katlanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},bmw_rolls_royce_warning_chimes:{name:"Rolls-Royce & BMW i Uyar\u0131 Sesleri",desc:"Kap\u0131 a\xe7\u0131k, emniyet kemeri ve s\u0131cakl\u0131k uyar\u0131 seslerini l\xfcks Rolls-Royce tonlar\u0131na d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfcr."},bmw_m_performance_boot_animation:{name:"M Performance & Alpina Kadran Logosu",desc:"Dijital g\xf6sterge panelinin a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f animasyonunu M Performance veya Alpina temas\u0131na \xe7evirir."},bmw_tpms_temperature_display:{name:"Lastik Bas\u0131nc\u0131 & S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 Canl\u0131 G\xf6sterimi",desc:"iDrive ekran\u0131ndaki lastik bas\u0131n\xe7lar\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131nda her lasti\u011fin anl\u0131k s\u0131cakl\u0131k derecesini g\xf6sterir."},bmw_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Arka LED Stoplar G\xfcnd\xfcz Far\u0131 ile Birlikte A\xe7\u0131k",desc:"G\xfcnd\xfcz s\xfcr\xfc\u015f farlar\u0131 devredeyken arka neon LED halkalar\u0131n da s\xfcrekli yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},bmw_sport_automatic_transmission_2tb:{name:"2TB Spor Otomatik \u015eanz\u0131man & Launch Control",desc:"Daha h\u0131zl\u0131 vites ge\xe7i\u015fleri, ara gazl\u0131 vites k\xfc\xe7\xfcltme ve fabrika \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Launch Control modunu a\xe7ar."},merc_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"AMG Kadran Selamlama (Needle Staging)",desc:"Kontak a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda g\xf6sterge ibrelerinin sonuna kadar vurup ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 noktas\u0131na d\xf6nmesini sa\u011flar."},merc_highbeam_memory:{name:"Adaptif Uzun Far Asistan\u0131 Durum Haf\u0131zas\u0131",desc:"Adaptif Uzun Far Asistan\u0131n\u0131n son durumunu hat\u0131rlar ve her \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmada a\xe7\u0131k kalmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},merc_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Alarm Sireni ile Kilit Geri Bildirimi",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde alarm sireninden k\u0131sa bir onay bip sesi vermesini sa\u011flar."},merc_amg_cluster_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performans Men\xfcs\xfc & Ya\u011f/\u015eanz\u0131man S\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneline motor ya\u011f\u0131, \u015fanz\u0131man s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131, tur kronometresi ve G-metre AMG ekran\u0131n\u0131 ekler."},merc_ambient_lighting_64_colors:{name:"64 Renk Dinamik Ambiyans Ayd\u0131nlatma Kilidi",desc:"MBUX multimedya ekran\u0131nda ambiyans ayd\u0131nlatma renk paletini 64 dinamik temaya geni\u015fletir."},merc_start_stop_last_state_memory:{name:"ECO Start-Stop Son Durum Haf\u0131zas\u0131",desc:"Start-Stop sisteminin son durumunu hat\u0131rlar ve arac\u0131 her \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmada otomatik a\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 engeller."},merc_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Kumandadan Otomatik Ayna Katlama",desc:"Ara\xe7 kumandadan kilitlendi\u011finde yan aynalar\u0131n otomatik katlanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},merc_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"\u0130skandinav Modu Arka Stop G\xfcnd\xfcz Ayd\u0131nlatmas\u0131",desc:"G\xfcnd\xfcz farlar\u0131 ile birlikte arka LED stop lambalar\u0131n\u0131n da s\xfcrekli yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},merc_seatbelt_warning_chime_mute:{name:"Emniyet Kemeri Sesli Uyar\u0131 \u0130ptali",desc:"Tak\u0131lmayan emniyet kemeri i\xe7in s\xfcrekli \xe7alan sesli uyar\u0131y\u0131 susturur (\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131 ikaz aktif kal\u0131r)."},merc_agility_manual_mode_unlock:{name:"Agility (Sport+) & Manuel \u015eanz\u0131man Modu",desc:"Dynamic Select men\xfcs\xfcne gizli Agility ve Ger\xe7ek Manuel vites ge\xe7i\u015f s\xfcr\xfc\u015f modlar\u0131n\u0131 ekler."},merc_esp_sport_threshold_tuning:{name:"ESP Sport Dinamik Kayma A\xe7\u0131s\u0131 E\u015fi\u011fi",desc:"Pist s\xfcr\xfc\u015flerinde ESP'nin erken m\xfcdahale etmesini engelleyerek daha sportif kayma a\xe7\u0131s\u0131na izin verir."},merc_flashing_emergency_brake_light:{name:"Ani Frende Fla\u015f\xf6rl\xfc Adaptif Stop Lambalar\u0131",desc:"Sert acil fren yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda fren lambalar\u0131n\u0131n y\xfcksek frekansta (5.5 Hz) h\u0131zl\u0131ca yan\u0131p s\xf6nmesini sa\u011flar."},stell_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Kumandadan Otomatik Ayna Katlama",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde dikiz aynalar\u0131n\u0131n otomatik kapanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},stell_cornering_fog_lights:{name:"Viraj Ayd\u0131nlatmal\u0131 \xd6n Sis Farlar\u0131",desc:"Sinyal verildi\u011finde veya direksiyon \xe7evrildi\u011finde ilgili taraftaki sis far\u0131n\u0131n yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},stell_needle_sweep_cluster:{name:"Spor Kadran Selamlama",desc:"Kontak a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda g\xf6sterge ibrelerinin sona vurup geri gelmesini sa\u011flar."},stell_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Korna ile Kilit Onay Sesi",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde kornan\u0131n k\u0131sa bir bip sesi ile onay vermesini sa\u011flar."},stell_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"\u0130skandinav Arka G\xfcnd\xfcz Stop Lambalar\u0131",desc:"\xd6n g\xfcnd\xfcz farlar\u0131 devredeyken arka stoplar\u0131n da s\xfcrekli ayd\u0131nlat\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},stell_lane_assist_memory_default:{name:"\u015eerit Takip Asistan\u0131 Son Durum Haf\u0131zas\u0131",desc:"\u015eerit takip sisteminin son a\xe7\u0131k/kapal\u0131 durumunu hat\u0131rlar ve her kontak a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda otomatik devreye girmez."},stell_sport_steering_weight_calibration:{name:"EPS Spor Direksiyon A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k E\u011frisi",desc:"Elektrikli direksiyonun a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve merkezleme direncini art\u0131rarak daha net bir yol hissi sa\u011flar."},stell_digital_speedo_unit_toggle:{name:"Dijital H\u0131z G\xf6stergesi \u0130kili Birim (km/h & mph)",desc:"G\xf6sterge bilgi ekran\u0131nda hem km/h hem mph de\u011ferlerinin ayn\u0131 anda g\xf6r\xfcnmesini sa\u011flar."},ford_apim_ambient_multi_colors:{name:"SYNC 3/4 \xc7ok Renkli Ambiyans Ayd\u0131nlatma",desc:"SYNC ekran\u0131nda 7 renkli ambiyans ayd\u0131nlatma renk se\xe7im paletini a\xe7ar."},ford_lincoln_auto_fold_mirrors:{name:"Lincoln Stili Otomatik Ayna Katlama",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendi\u011finde aynalar\u0131 katlar, s\xfcr\xfcc\xfc kap\u0131s\u0131 kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda otomatik a\xe7ar."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_with_highbeam:{name:"Bambi Modu (Uzun Far ile Sis Farlar\u0131 Birlikte)",desc:"Uzun farlar a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xf6n sis farlar\u0131n\u0131n otomatik s\xf6nmesini engeller."},ford_double_honk_disable:{name:"Anahtarla Ara\xe7tan \xc7\u0131k\u0131nca \xc7ift Korna \u0130ptali",desc:"Motor \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken anahtarla ara\xe7tan inildi\u011finde \xe7alan y\xfcksek sesli \xe7ift kornay\u0131 kapat\u0131r."},ford_global_windows_remote_open_close:{name:"Kumandadan Global Cam A\xe7ma & Kapatma",desc:"Fabrika kumandas\u0131nda kilit veya a\xe7ma tu\u015funa bas\u0131l\u0131 tutarak t\xfcm camlar\u0131 a\xe7\u0131p kapat\u0131r."},ford_cluster_digital_tpms_readout:{name:"Ayr\u0131 Ayr\u0131 Lastik Bas\u0131n\xe7 De\u011ferleri (Bar/PSI)",desc:"G\xf6sterge paneline her tekerle\u011fin tam bas\u0131n\xe7 de\u011ferini say\u0131sal olarak g\xf6steren ekran\u0131 ekler."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performans Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 Logosu (ST / Raptor / RS)",desc:"SYNC ekran\u0131n\u0131n a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f logosunu Ford Performance / ST / Raptor tasar\u0131m\u0131na d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfcr."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"R-Link 2 S\xfcr\xfc\u015f Esnas\u0131nda Video \u0130zleme",desc:"Ara\xe7 hareket halindeyken USB video oynatma h\u0131z kilidini devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131r."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performans Telemetrisi Uygulamas\u0131",desc:"Multimedya ekran\u0131na turbo bas\u0131nc\u0131, tork, motor ya\u011f\u0131 s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve G-kuvveti g\xf6stergelerini ekler."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Eller Serbest Uzakla\u015f\u0131nca Kilit Bip Uyar\u0131s\u0131",desc:"Kart anahtarla ara\xe7tan uzakla\u015f\u0131l\u0131p kap\u0131lar kilitlendi\u011finde sesli onay sesi verir."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"\u0130skandinav 3D LED Arka G\xfcnd\xfcz Stoplar\u0131",desc:"G\xfcnd\xfcz s\xfcr\xfc\u015f farlar\u0131 ile birlikte arka 3D LED stop \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131n s\xfcrekli yanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Viraj Ayd\u0131nlatmal\u0131 Sis Farlar\u0131",desc:"40 km/h alt\u0131ndaki d\xf6n\xfc\u015flerde d\xf6n\xfclen taraftaki sis lambas\u0131n\u0131 otomatik yakar."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Emniyet Kemeri Sesli \u0130kaz Susturma",desc:"Kemer tak\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xe7alan sesli buzzer uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 susturur."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"EV Manuel Batarya \u015earj Limiti Aray\xfcz\xfc",desc:"Multimedya ekran\u0131nda batarya \xf6mr\xfcn\xfc korumak i\xe7in %50-%100 aras\u0131 hedef \u015farj limit s\xfcrg\xfcs\xfcn\xfc a\xe7ar."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG (Start-Stop) Son Durum Haf\u0131zas\u0131",desc:"Start-Stop butonunun son durumunu hat\u0131rlar ve her \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmada otomatik a\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 engeller."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Anahtar Yakla\u015fma Otomatik Kilit A\xe7ma Hassasiyeti",desc:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 anahtarla araca yakla\u015f\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kap\u0131lar\u0131n otomatik a\xe7\u0131lma radar menzilini kalibre eder."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"\xd6ndeki Ara\xe7 Hareket Bildirimi Hassasiyeti",desc:"Trafikte \xf6ndeki ara\xe7 hareket etti\u011finde g\xf6sterge panelinde verilen uyar\u0131n\u0131n hassasiyetini art\u0131r\u0131r."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Far Gecikmeli Kapanma S\xfcresi (Follow-Me-Home)",desc:"Ara\xe7 kilitlendikten sonra farlar\u0131n a\xe7\u0131k kalma s\xfcresini 15 saniyeden 30 veya 60 saniyeye uzat\u0131r."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Batarya Manuel \xd6n Is\u0131tma / \u015earj Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131",desc:"So\u011fuk havalarda DC h\u0131zl\u0131 \u015farj \xf6ncesi bataryay\u0131 ideal s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011fa getirmek i\xe7in manuel \u0131s\u0131tmay\u0131 a\xe7ar."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS D\xfc\u015f\xfck H\u0131z Yaya Uyar\u0131 Sesi Temalar\u0131",desc:"D\xfc\u015f\xfck h\u0131zlarda yayalar\u0131 uyarmak i\xe7in \xe7\u0131kan f\xfct\xfcristik yapay motor ses temalar\u0131n\u0131 geni\u01