ettings menu."},vag_service_interval_custom:{name:"Custom Inspection & Service Distance Threshold (VAG)",desc:"Configures custom km and day targets for next service warning."},vag_door_handle_lights_reverse:{name:"Exterior Door Handle Lights ON in Reverse (VAG)",desc:"Illuminates door handle LED puddle lights when reversing for ground visibility."},bmw_msport_exhaust_burble:{name:"M-Sport Exhaust Burble & Pop Intensity (BMW)",desc:"Adjusts overrun burble sound aggressiveness in Sport mode."},bmw_welcome_light_sequence:{name:"Welcome Light Sequence Animation (BMW)",desc:"Customizes LED headlight and Angel Eyes welcome greeting sequence."},bmw_service_history_menu:{name:"Digital Service History Menu Enable (BMW)",desc:"Unlocks iDrive digital service record book menu on central display."},bmw_hud_speed_display:{name:"Head-Up Display Digital Speedometer Overlay (BMW)",desc:"Projects real-time digital speed readout onto Head-Up Display."},bmw_cornering_lights_fog:{name:"Fog Lamp Cornering Illumination (BMW)",desc:"Turns on front fog light on turn signal or low-speed steering angle."},bmw_easy_entry_steering:{name:"Easy Entry Auto-Retracting Steering Column (BMW)",desc:"Retracts electric steering wheel upward upon engine shutdown for easy exit."},bmw_bluetooth_audio_enable:{name:"Enhanced Bluetooth Audio Streaming Unlock (BMW)",desc:"Enables A2DP Bluetooth wireless music streaming in iDrive HU_ENTRYNAV."},bmw_door_handle_lights_reverse:{name:"Exterior Door Handle Puddle Lights in Reverse (BMW)",desc:"Illuminates door handle LEDs when reverse gear is engaged."},toyota_auto_headlight_threshold:{name:"Auto Headlight Ambient Light Sensor Sensitivity (Toyota)",desc:"Adjusts twilight dusk threshold for automatic headlight activation."},toyota_turn_signal_click_volume:{name:"Turn Signal Audio Clicker Speaker Volume (Toyota)",desc:"Configures turn signal relay click chime volume (Low, Medium, High)."},toyota_smart_key_approach_lights:{name:"Smart Key Proximity Welcome Puddle Lights (Toyota)",desc:"Turns on mirror puddle lights when smart key approaches vehicle."},toyota_rear_hatch_behavior:{name:"Power Tailgate Liftgate Open/Close Operation Logic (Toyota)",desc:"Configures remote and dashboard power hatch button press duration."},toyota_open_windows_smart_key:{name:"Smart Key Remote Window Roll-Down Long Press (Toyota)",desc:"Allows opening all windows by holding remote unlock button."},toyota_interior_light_dim_timer:{name:"Interior Cabin Light Auto-Dimming Off Delay (Toyota)",desc:"Adjusts interior dome light shutdown timer after door closure."},toyota_panic_alarm_remote:{name:"Remote Key Fob Panic Alarm Siren Function (Toyota)",desc:"Enables or disables vehicle horn panic alarm via remote key hold."},toyota_eco_drive_indicator:{name:"ECO Drive Cluster Zone Indicator Light (Toyota)",desc:"Shows eco-friendly acceleration bar and indicator light on cluster."},hyundai_coming_home_duration:{name:"Escort Headlight Off Delay Timer (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Keeps low beam headlights illuminated after vehicle exit."},hyundai_drl_menu_toggle:{name:"Daytime Running Lights Menu Control (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Adds DRL ON/OFF setting to instrument cluster user options."},hyundai_welcome_sequence:{name:"Smart Key Proximity Welcome Light & Mirror Unfold (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Unfolds power mirrors and lights up door handles upon approach."},hyundai_interior_light_delay:{name:"Cabin Interior Room Lamp Auto-Cut Delay (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Sets timer before interior lights automatically turn off to save battery."},hyundai_heat_pump_efficiency:{name:"EV Climate Heat Pump Thermal Efficiency Mode (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Optimizes EV heat pump energy consumption in cold winter weather."},tesla_track_mode_params:{name:"Track Mode Stability & Torque Bias Profile (Tesla)",desc:"Configures front/rear motor drive bias and stability intervention."},tesla_regen_brake_strength:{name:"Regenerative Braking Power Profile (Tesla)",desc:"Adjusts accelerator pedal lift-off energy recovery intensity."},tesla_walkaway_door_lock:{name:"Walk-Away Phone Key Auto Door Lock (Tesla)",desc:"Locks doors and confirms with horn chirp when phone key moves away."},tesla_acceleration_boost_unlock:{name:"Powertrain Acceleration Boost Drive Profile (Tesla)",desc:"Sharpens electric motor inverter response for faster 0-100 km/h times."},tesla_interior_ambient_color:{name:"Cabin Footwell Ambient Lighting Color Preset (Tesla)",desc:"Customizes LED footwell ambient light RGB color palette."},audi_matrix_led_animation:{name:"Matrix LED Headlight Dynamic Welcome Light Dance (Audi)",desc:"Plays dynamic light choreography upon vehicle unlocking."},audi_mmi_startup_screen:{name:"MMI Touch Screen Boot Graphic Theme (Audi)",desc:"Customizes MMI central screen boot animation (S / RS / e-tron)."},audi_drive_select_efficiency:{name:"Efficiency Driving Profile in Audi Drive Select (Audi)",desc:"Enables fuel-saving Efficiency mode in Drive Select options."},audi_laptimer_boost_display:{name:"Lap Timer & Turbo Bar Pressure Gauge Overlay (Audi)",desc:"Displays track lap timer and real-time turbo boost gauge on Virtual Cockpit."},audi_needle_sweep_gauge:{name:"Sport Gauge Needle Sweep Verification (Audi)",desc:"Performs full tachometer and speedometer needle sweep test on start."},skoda_coming_home_lights:{name:"Leaving Home / Coming Home Lighting Timer (Skoda)",desc:"Configures headlight illumination timer after vehicle exit."},skoda_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Comfort Indicator Pulse Count Adjustment (Skoda)",desc:"Sets one-touch turn signal blink count between 3 and 5 flashes."},cupra_sport_display_menu:{name:"Cupra Performance Instrument & G-Meter Menu (Cupra)",desc:"Unlocks G-force meter, kW power gauge, and oil temp display."},cupra_virtual_cockpit_copper:{name:"Copper Theme Dashboard Accent Graphics (Cupra)",desc:"Applies signature Cupra copper metallic accent theme to gauge cluster."},vag_brake_disc_drying:{name:"Brake Disc Wiping / Drying Function in Rain (VAG)",desc:"Periodically applies minimal pad pressure in wet weather to dry rotors."},vag_tourist_mode_lights:{name:"Tourist Mode Headlight Beam Pattern (VAG)",desc:"Switches headlight beam pattern between LHD and RHD for driving abroad."},vag_hood_warning_mute:{name:"Bonnet Open Instrument Chime Mute (VAG)",desc:"Suppresses persistent instrument warning chime when hood is unlatched."},vag_emergency_brake_hazard:{name:"Emergency Braking Automatic Hazard Flasher (VAG)",desc:"Flashes hazard lights rapidly during hard ABS emergency stops."},vag_sunroof_comfort_open:{name:"Sunroof Tilt / Open Remote Comfort Key Fob Logic (VAG)",desc:"Configures remote key hold action to either tilt or fully open sunroof."},bmw_ecopro_display_variant:{name:"ECO PRO Instrument Cluster Gauge Styling (BMW)",desc:"Customizes blue ECO PRO efficiency gauge graphic theme."},bmw_volume_bar_hud:{name:"Head-Up Display Audio Volume Level Bar Overlay (BMW)",desc:"Shows volume change bar directly on HUD projection."},bmw_anti_dazzle_mirror:{name:"Electrochromic Anti-Dazzle Mirror Dimming Sensitivity (BMW)",desc:"Adjusts automatic rearview mirror dimming photo-sensor threshold."},bmw_camera_pdc_warning_mute:{name:"PDC & Surround View Speed Cut-off Speed Adjustment (BMW)",desc:"Adjusts vehicle speed threshold at which parking cameras turn off."},toyota_pcs_distance_preset:{name:"Pre-Collision System (PCS) Default Alert Distance (Toyota)",desc:"Sets initial radar forward collision warning distance sensitivity."},toyota_bsm_timing:{name:"Blind Spot Monitor (BSM) Warning Warning Timing (Toyota)",desc:"Adjusts blind spot side mirror warning light illumination timing."},toyota_ac_noise_reduction:{name:"A/C Compressor Blower Noise Reduction Mode (Toyota)",desc:"Limits maximum air conditioning blower fan speed for cabin quietness."},toyota_sflow_control:{name:"S-Flow Smart Climate Single-Occupant Mode (Toyota)",desc:"Directs A/C airflow exclusively to occupied seats based on weight sensors."},toyota_relock_timeout:{name:"Automatic Re-Lock Delay Timer after Remote Unlock (Toyota)",desc:"Adjusts seconds before doors auto-relock if no door is opened (30s-120s)."},lexus_mark_levinson_audio_profile:{name:"Mark Levinson Surround Sound DSP Audio Profile (Lexus)",desc:"Optimizes 3D spatial acoustic tuning for Mark Levinson premium speakers."},lexus_ev_mode_beeper_mute:{name:"Low-Speed Pedestrian EV Acoustic Alert Beeper Mute (Lexus)",desc:"Suppresses low speed electric mode synthetic exterior chime."},lexus_easy_access_seat:{name:"Easy Access Steering Wheel & Power Seat Slide-Back (Lexus)",desc:"Slides driver seat back and tilts steering wheel away for easy entry/exit."},nissan_epower_regen_mode:{name:"e-POWER One-Pedal Regenerative Braking Mode (Nissan)",desc:"Sets default e-Pedal regenerative braking deceleration level."},nissan_propilot_assist_timing:{name:"ProPILOT Lane Centering Assist Steering Sensitivity (Nissan)",desc:"Configures ProPILOT steering intervention sharpness."},nissan_intelligent_around_view:{name:"Around View Monitor Auto-Pop-Up at Low Speed (Nissan)",desc:"Triggers 360-degree camera display when front parking sensors detect obstacles."},mazda_g_vectoring_display:{name:"G-Vectoring Control Plus Dynamic Visualizer (Mazda)",desc:"Displays real-time GVC+ cornering torque vectoring graph on instrument panel."},mazda_ieloop_capacitor_monitor:{name:"i-ELOOP Brake Energy Recovery Capacitor Meter (Mazda)",desc:"Shows electric capacitor charge & discharge status on central screen."},mazda_smart_city_brake_sens:{name:"Smart City Brake Support (SCBS) Sensitivity (Mazda)",desc:"Sets low-speed automatic emergency braking sensor range."},subaru_eyesight_distance_preset:{name:"EyeSight Adaptive Cruise Control Default Distance (Subaru)",desc:"Configures stereo camera default cruise gap profile on startup."},subaru_xmode_auto_engage:{name:"X-Mode Off-Road Traction Auto-Engage Threshold (Subaru)",desc:"Sets wheel slip threshold for automatic dual-function X-Mode activation."},subaru_steering_responsive_headlights:{name:"Steering Responsive Headlights (SRH) Toggle (Subaru)",desc:"Enables or disables directional adaptive headlight swivel."},genesis_sport_plus_mode:{name:"Sport+ Powertrain & Electronic Suspension Mode (Genesis)",desc:"Unlocks track-oriented ESC OFF and stiffened damper mapping."},genesis_ambient_active_light:{name:"Active Ambient Lighting Drive Mode Sync (Genesis)",desc:"Changes interior ambient lighting color dynamically based on drive mode."},volvo_city_safety_warning:{name:"City Safety Autonomous Emergency Warning Sensitivity (Volvo)",desc:"Configures radar and lidar collision warning alert timing (Early/Normal)."},chery_ar_navigation_hud:{name:"AR Navigation Projection Overlay on HUD (Chery)",desc:"Projects 3D augmented reality navigation arrows onto windshield."},jlr_terrain_response_preset:{name:"Terrain Response Auto Off-Road Mode Preset (JLR)",desc:"Remembers last Terrain Response surface profile (Grass/Gravel/Snow)."},jlr_adaptive_dynamics_firm:{name:"Adaptive Dynamics Damper Firmness Profile (JLR)",desc:"Sets default electronic shock absorber damping stiffness."},jlr_wading_sensor_alert:{name:"Wade Sensing Depth Warning Chime Threshold (JLR)",desc:"Configures ultrasonic water depth warning chime sensitivity."},alfa_dna_dynamic_memory:{name:"Alfa DNA Selector Dynamic Mode Startup Memory (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Retains Dynamic mode throttle response after restart."},alfa_q4_torque_split:{name:"Q4 All-Wheel Drive Real-Time Torque Split Graph (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Shows AWD front/rear power split percentage on instrument display."},li_auto_range_extender_mode:{name:"REV Generator Battery Charge Retention Level (Li Auto)",desc:"Adjusts internal combustion engine generator start threshold."},li_auto_cinema_seat_position:{name:"Theater / Cinema Mode Ergonomic Seat Position (Li Auto)",desc:"Reclines rear seats and unfolds leg rests when cinema mode is active."},zeekr_drift_mode_torque:{name:"Dual Motor Performance Drift Mode Rear Bias (Zeekr)",desc:"Sends 100% torque to rear electric motor for controlled drifting."},zeekr_ambient_beat_sync:{name:"Ambient Lighting Music Rhythm Beat Sync (Zeekr)",desc:"Pulsates interior cabin lighting in sync with played music beats."},tata_drive_mode_voice:{name:"Drive Mode Switch Voice Announcement (Tata)",desc:"Enables audio voice confirmation when switching drive modes (City/Sport/Eco)."},mahindra_zip_zap_zoom_custom:{name:"Zip/Zap/Zoom Powertrain Throttle Response Profile (Mahindra)",desc:"Customizes acceleration curve for Zip, Zap, and Zoom driving modes."},fun_cyberpunk_cluster_theme:{name:"Cyberpunk 2077 Neon Graphic Cockpit Theme",desc:"Applies futuristic neon cyan & amber digital dashboard gauge styling."},fun_exhaust_flame_sound_effect:{name:"Stereo System Pop & Bang Exhaust Sound FX",desc:"Plays realistic V8 exhaust pop & bang audio effects through cabin speakers."},fun_matrix_light_show_welcome:{name:"Custom Headlight Matrix LED Dance Welcome",desc:"Plays rhythmic Light Show choreography using headlights & indicators."},fun_stealth_fighter_display:{name:"Stealth Fighter Night Driving Minimalist Cluster Mode",desc:"Turns off all cluster lights except speedometer for pitch-black night driving."},vag_lap_timer_oil_temp:{name:"Lap Timer & Oil Temperature in Gauge Cluster",desc:"Unlocks racetrack lap timer stopwatch and real-time engine oil temperature readout."},vag_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian DRL (Rear Tail Lights ON with DRL)",desc:"Illuminates rear LED tail lights constantly when front daytime running lights are active."},vag_drl_handbrake_off:{name:"Turn OFF DRL when Handbrake is Engaged",desc:"Automatically turns off daytime running lights whenever parking brake is pulled up."},vag_drl_menu_in_mib:{name:"DRL ON/OFF Toggle Switch in Touchscreen Menu",desc:"Adds Daytime Running Lights toggle checkbox under Vehicle Lights settings in MIB screen."},vag_rain_closing_windows:{name:"Rain Closing (Automatic Windows & Sunroof Close)",desc:"Closes all open