e GVC+ en temps r\xe9el sur le tableau de bord."},mazda_ieloop_capacitor_monitor:{name:"Compteur de condensateur de r\xe9cup\xe9ration d'\xe9nergie de freinage i-ELOOP (Mazda)",desc:"Affiche l'\xe9tat de charge et de d\xe9charge du condensateur \xe9lectrique sur l'\xe9cran central."},mazda_smart_city_brake_sens:{name:"Sensibilit\xe9 de l'assistance de freinage intelligente en ville (SCBS) (Mazda)",desc:"D\xe9finit la plage du capteur de freinage d\u2019urgence automatique \xe0 basse vitesse."},subaru_eyesight_distance_preset:{name:"Distance par d\xe9faut du r\xe9gulateur de vitesse adaptatif EyeSight (Subaru)",desc:"Configure le profil d'\xe9cart de croisi\xe8re par d\xe9faut de la cam\xe9ra st\xe9r\xe9o au d\xe9marrage."},subaru_xmode_auto_engage:{name:"Seuil d'engagement automatique de traction hors route X-Mode (Subaru)",desc:"D\xe9finit le seuil de patinage des roues pour l\u2019activation automatique du mode X \xe0 double fonction."},subaru_steering_responsive_headlights:{name:"Bascule de phares sensibles \xe0 la direction (SRH) (Subaru)",desc:"Active ou d\xe9sactive le pivotement directionnel adaptatif des phares."},genesis_sport_plus_mode:{name:"Mode groupe motopropulseur Sport+ et suspension \xe9lectronique (Genesis)",desc:"D\xe9verrouille l'ESC OFF orient\xe9 vers la piste et la cartographie des amortisseurs renforc\xe9e."},genesis_ambient_active_light:{name:"Synchronisation active du mode de conduite de l'\xe9clairage ambiant (Genesis)",desc:"Modifie dynamiquement la couleur de l\u2019\xe9clairage ambiant int\xe9rieur en fonction du mode de conduite."},volvo_city_safety_warning:{name:"Sensibilit\xe9 d'avertissement d'urgence autonome City Safety (Volvo)",desc:"Configure la synchronisation des alertes d'avertissement de collision radar et lidar (pr\xe9coce/normale)."},chery_ar_navigation_hud:{name:"Superposition de projection de navigation AR sur le HUD (Chery)",desc:"Projette des fl\xe8ches de navigation en r\xe9alit\xe9 augment\xe9e 3D sur le pare-brise."},jlr_terrain_response_preset:{name:"Pr\xe9r\xe9glage du mode tout-terrain automatique Terrain Response (JLR)",desc:"M\xe9morise le dernier profil de surface Terrain Response (herbe/gravier/neige)."},jlr_adaptive_dynamics_firm:{name:"Profil de fermet\xe9 de l'amortisseur Adaptive Dynamics (JLR)",desc:"D\xe9finit la rigidit\xe9 d\u2019amortissement de l\u2019amortisseur \xe9lectronique par d\xe9faut."},jlr_wading_sensor_alert:{name:"Seuil du carillon d'avertissement de profondeur de d\xe9tection de gu\xe9 (JLR)",desc:"Configure la sensibilit\xe9 du carillon d\u2019avertissement de profondeur d\u2019eau par ultrasons."},alfa_dna_dynamic_memory:{name:"M\xe9moire de d\xe9marrage du mode dynamique du s\xe9lecteur Alfa DNA (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Conserve la r\xe9ponse de l'acc\xe9l\xe9rateur en mode dynamique apr\xe8s le red\xe9marrage."},alfa_q4_torque_split:{name:"Graphique de r\xe9partition du couple en temps r\xe9el pour la transmission int\xe9grale du quatri\xe8me trimestre (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Affiche le pourcentage de r\xe9partition de la puissance avant/arri\xe8re de la transmission int\xe9grale sur l'\xe9cran des instruments."},li_auto_range_extender_mode:{name:"Niveau de r\xe9tention de charge de la batterie du g\xe9n\xe9rateur REV (Li Auto)",desc:"Ajuste le seuil de d\xe9marrage du g\xe9n\xe9rateur du moteur \xe0 combustion interne."},li_auto_cinema_seat_position:{name:"Position du si\xe8ge ergonomique en mode Th\xe9\xe2tre/Cin\xe9ma (Li Auto)",desc:"Incline les si\xe8ges arri\xe8re et d\xe9plie les repose-pieds lorsque le mode cin\xe9ma est actif."},zeekr_drift_mode_torque:{name:"Biais arri\xe8re en mode d\xe9rive de performance \xe0 double moteur (Zeekr)",desc:"Envoie 100\xa0% du couple au moteur \xe9lectrique arri\xe8re pour une d\xe9rive contr\xf4l\xe9e."},zeekr_ambient_beat_sync:{name:"\xc9clairage ambiant Musique Rythme Beat Sync (Zeekr)",desc:"Fait vibrer l\u2019\xe9clairage int\xe9rieur de l\u2019habitacle en synchronisation avec les rythmes de la musique jou\xe9e."},tata_drive_mode_voice:{name:"Annonce vocale du commutateur de mode de conduite (Tata)",desc:"Permet la confirmation vocale audio lors du changement de mode de conduite (City/Sport/Eco)."},mahindra_zip_zap_zoom_custom:{name:"Profil de r\xe9ponse de l'acc\xe9l\xe9rateur du groupe motopropulseur Zip/Zap/Zoom (Mahindra)",desc:"Personnalise la courbe d'acc\xe9l\xe9ration pour les modes de conduite Zip, Zap et Zoom."},fun_cyberpunk_cluster_theme:{name:"Th\xe8me du cockpit graphique Cyberpunk 2077 Neon",desc:"Applique un style futuriste de jauge de tableau de bord num\xe9rique n\xe9on cyan et ambre."},fun_exhaust_flame_sound_effect:{name:"Syst\xe8me st\xe9r\xe9o Pop & Bang, effets sonores d'\xe9chappement",desc:"Joue des effets audio pop & bang d'\xe9chappement V8 r\xe9alistes via les haut-parleurs de l'habitacle."},fun_matrix_light_show_welcome:{name:"Phare personnalis\xe9 Matrix LED Dance Welcome",desc:"Joue une chor\xe9graphie rythm\xe9e de Light Show \xe0 l'aide de phares et de clignotants."},fun_stealth_fighter_display:{name:"Mode cluster minimaliste de conduite nocturne de Stealth Fighter",desc:"\xc9teint tous les voyants du groupe, \xe0 l'exception du compteur de vitesse, pour la conduite de nuit dans l'obscurit\xe9 totale."},vag_lap_timer_oil_temp:{name:"Lap Timer & Oil Temperature in Gauge Cluster",desc:"Unlocks racetrack lap timer stopwatch and real-time engine oil temperature readout."},vag_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian DRL (Rear Tail Lights ON with DRL)",desc:"Illuminates rear LED tail lights constantly when front daytime running lights are active."},vag_drl_handbrake_off:{name:"Turn OFF DRL when Handbrake is Engaged",desc:"Automatically turns off daytime running lights whenever parking brake is pulled up."},vag_drl_menu_in_mib:{name:"DRL ON/OFF Toggle Switch in Touchscreen Menu",desc:"Adds Daytime Running Lights toggle checkbox under Vehicle Lights settings in MIB screen."},vag_rain_closing_windows:{name:"Rain Closing (Automatic Windows & Sunroof Close)",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof if parked vehicle detects rain on windshield."},vag_audi_dynamic_throttle:{name:"Audi Linear Direct Throttle Response",desc:"Removes electronic pedal lag by switching from time-gradient to direct linear throttle mapping."},vag_xds_differential_sensitivity:{name:"XDS Electronic Differential Lock Sensitivity",desc:"Increases cornering traction and reduces understeer by applying higher inner-wheel brake torque."},vag_offroad_display_mib:{name:"Off-Road Display & Compass in Infotainment",desc:"Unlocks Off-Road telemetry screen displaying steering angle, compass, and oil/coolant temperatures."},vag_highbeam_assist_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist (Light Assist) State Memory",desc:"Maintains Auto High-Beam Assist active across ignition cycles so driver does not have to re-arm it."},vag_comfort_turn_signals_count:{name:"Comfort Turn Signal Flash Cycles",desc:"Changes number of highway lane-change blinker pulses from standard 3 to 4 or 5."},bmw_video_in_motion_speedlock:{name:"Video in Motion (VIM) Speedlock Removal",desc:"Allows USB and DVD video playback on iDrive screen while vehicle is moving."},bmw_digital_speedo_kombi:{name:"Digital Speedometer in Instrument Cluster (V= km/h)",desc:"Adds real-time digital speed numerical readout on the onboard computer screen."},bmw_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Chirp on Lock / Unlock",desc:"Adds acoustic confirmation chirp via alarm siren with volume setting in iDrive menu."},bmw_auto_mirror_fold_comfort_close:{name:"Fold Mirrors Instantly with 1-Click Lock",desc:"Eliminates the 1.5s delay requirement for folding mirrors when pressing key lock."},bmw_rolls_royce_warning_chimes:{name:"Rolls-Royce / BMW i / MINI Warning Chime Tones",desc:"Changes the system warning chimes (door open, low temp, seatbelt) to luxury Rolls-Royce tones."},bmw_m_performance_boot_animation:{name:"M Performance / Alpina Cluster Boot Logo",desc:"Sets startup logo on digital instrument cluster to M Performance, M2, M3, M5, or Alpina."},bmw_tpms_temperature_display:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Live Display",desc:"Adds real-time individual tire temperature readouts alongside tire pressure on iDrive screen."},bmw_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights Active with Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED neon rings illuminated when daytime running lights are active in position 0/Auto."},bmw_sport_automatic_transmission_2tb:{name:"Sport Automatic Transmission (2TB) & Launch Control",desc:"Unlocks faster shifting times, rev-matching downshifts, and factory Launch Control mode."},merc_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep (AMG Staging)",desc:"Sweeps gauge needles to maximum upon turning on the ignition."},merc_highbeam_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last active state of Adaptive Highbeam Assist across ignition cycles."},merc_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Lock Chirp",desc:"Emits a short acoustic confirmation beep via alarm siren when vehicle is locked."},merc_amg_cluster_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Cluster Menu & Oil Temp",desc:"Unlocks AMG performance screen displaying engine oil & gearbox temperature, lap timer, and G-meter."},merc_ambient_lighting_64_colors:{name:"64-Color Dynamic Ambient Lighting Unlock",desc:"Expands ambient lighting color palette from standard colors to 64 multi-color dynamic themes in MBUX."},merc_start_stop_last_state_memory:{name:"ECO Start-Stop Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers ECO Start/Stop button status instead of defaulting to ON on every ignition restart."},merc_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Automatically folds side mirrors when locking with key fob and unfolds upon driver door open."},merc_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights as Daytime Running Lights (Scandinavian Mode)",desc:"Keeps rear LED tail lamps illuminated together with front DRLs during daytime driving."},merc_seatbelt_warning_chime_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Acoustic Warning Chime Mute",desc:"Disables the continuous chime sound for unbuckled seatbelts (visual warning lamp remains active)."},merc_agility_manual_mode_unlock:{name:"Agility (Sport+) & Manual Transmission Mode",desc:"Enables hidden Agility (A) and True Manual (M) driving transmission profiles in Dynamic Select."},merc_esp_sport_threshold_tuning:{name:"ESP Sport Dynamic Slip Angle Adjustment",desc:"Allows increased wheel slip angle before ESP torque intervention for track driving."},merc_flashing_emergency_brake_light:{name:"Adaptive Emergency Flashing Brake Lights",desc:"Flashes stop lamps at high frequency (5.5 Hz) during hard emergency braking (> 7 m/s\xb2)."},stell_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Folds side mirrors automatically upon pressing lock button on key fob."},stell_cornering_fog_lights:{name:"Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Activates corresponding front fog lamp when turn signal is on or steering angle > 30\xb0 below 40 km/h."},stell_needle_sweep_cluster:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep (Sport Staging)",desc:"Performs gauge sweep on startup for analog/hybrid instrument clusters."},stell_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Remote Lock",desc:"Gives a short horn tap confirmation when vehicle doors successfully lock."},stell_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Rear Scandinavian DRL Tail Lights",desc:"Illuminates rear tail lamps in conjunction with daytime running lights in Auto/0 mode."},stell_lane_assist_memory_default:{name:"Lane Keeping Assist Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last ON/OFF state of Lane Keeping Assist instead of re-activating at every start."},stell_sport_steering_weight_calibration:{name:"Dynamic Electric Power Steering (EPS) Weight Curve",desc:"Increases steering wheel resistance and centering feel for a firmer, sportier feedback."},stell_digital_speedo_unit_toggle:{name:"Digital Speedometer km/h & mph Dual Display",desc:"Shows numeric speed readout in both km/h and mph simultaneously in the center LCD."},ford_apim_ambient_multi_colors:{name:"SYNC 3/4 Multi-Color Ambient Lighting Theme",desc:"Unlocks full 7-color ambient lighting palette slider in SYNC touchscreen interface."},ford_lincoln_auto_fold_mirrors:{name:"Lincoln Style Auto-Fold Mirrors on Lock",desc:"Folds power mirrors when locking vehicle and automatically unfolds upon closing driver door."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_with_highbeam:{name:"Bambi Mode (High Beams + Fog Lights Simultaneous)",desc:"Prevents fog lights from turning off automatically when high beams are activated."},ford_double_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit",desc:"Disables loud double horn honk when driver exits running vehicle with key fob in pocket."},ford_global_windows_remote_open_close:{name:"Global Window Roll Up & Down via Key Fob",desc:"Opens or closes all power windows by holding unlock or lock button on factory key fob."},ford_cluster_digital_tpms_readout:{name:"Individual Tire Pressure (TPMS) Bar/PSI Display",desc:"Displays exact individual tire pressure numerical readouts on the instrument cluster screen."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performance Boot Splash Theme (ST / Raptor / RS)",desc:"Changes SYNC infotainment boot logo animation to Ford Performance / ST / Raptor styling."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"Video in Motion (VIM) Playback Unlock",desc:"Allows USB/video playback on R-Link 2 / EasyLink touchscreen while vehicle is in motion."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performance Telemetry App",desc:"Enables Renault Sport Monitor app displaying live turbo boost, torque, oil temp, and G-force meters."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Hands-Free Walkaway Lock",desc:"Emits a brief beep when vehicle automatically locks upon walking away with key card."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian Daytime Running Tail Lights",desc:"Keeps rear 3D LED signature tail lamps active simultaneously with front DRL strips."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Static Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Lights up the relevant front fog light during turning maneuvers below 40 km/h."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Buzzer Sound Mute",desc:"Mutes acoustic beeping for unfastened seatbelts (visual cluster alert remains active)."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"Manual EV AC/DC Charge Limit Setting UI",desc:"Unlocks 50% to 100% target SoC slider controls in infotainment for battery longevity."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG (Idle Stop & Go) Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Headlamp Escort / Follow-Me-Home Delay Timer",desc:"Extends headlamp illumination duration from 15s to 30s or 60s after locking vehicle."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Battery Manual Pre-Heating / Pre-Conditioning",desc:"Enables manual battery thermal pre-heating before DC fast charging in cold weather."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS Low-Speed Pedestrian Acoustic Warning Themes",desc:"Unlocks alternative synthesized engine / futuristic tone profiles for low-speed pedestrian alert."},byd_ambient_sound_rhythm_sync:{name:"Music Rhythm Pulse Ambient Lighting Sync",desc:"Synchronizes cabin ambient LED brightness and color shifting with music bass rhythm."},chery_auto_window_rain_close:{name:"Automatic Window & Sunroof Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof when rain sensor detects rainfall while parked."},mg_ev_one_pedal_drive_memory:{name:"One-Pedal Driving Mode Retention",desc:"Remembers the last selected regenerative braking intensity (High/One-Pedal) across starts."},porsche_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Porsche Tachometer Needle Sweep on Start",desc:"Sweeps central analog tachometer needle to redline on ignition power up."},porsche_sport_exhaust_valve_manual_mode:{name:"PSE Sport Exhaust Flaps Permanently Open",desc:"Keeps dual active exhaust valves 100% open across all RPM ranges when PSE button is active."},porsche_rear_spoiler_manual_speed_threshold:{name:"Active Rear Aerodynamic Wing Deployment Speed",desc:"Adjusts automatic rear spoiler deployment speed threshold (80 km/h vs 120 km/h)."},porsche_matrix_highbeam_unlock:{name:"PDLS+ Matrix LED Adaptive Anti-Glare High Beam",desc:"Enables European-spec variable anti-glare high beam light distribution."},porsche_acoustic_chirp_lock:{name:"Acoustic Siren Beep on Central Lock",desc:"Gives a quick chirp confirmation when locking with Porsche smart key."},actros_rsl_fleet_speed_limit:{name:"Road Speed Limiter (Fleet Limit)",desc:"Configures maximum vehicle road speed limiter (RSL) calibration for fleet operation policy."},actros_idle_shutdown_timer:{name:"Automatic Engine Idle Shutdown Timer",desc:"Automatically shuts down engine after specified idle time while stationary with parking brake set."},volvo_pto_engine_rpm_preset:{name:"PTO (Power Take-Off) Engine RPM Preset",desc:"Sets predefined constant engine idle speed when PTO is engaged for hydraulic pump and tipper operation."},volvo_ppc_eco_roll_hysteresis:{name:"I-See / PPC Topographical Speed Tolerance (Eco-Roll)",desc:"Adjusts GPS predictive cruise control speed hysteresis tolerance window for maximum rolling fuel economy."},scania_retarder_jake_brake_aggressiveness:{name:"Retarder & Jake Brake Downshift Aggressiveness",desc:"Adjusts retarder torque blending curve and automatic transmission downshifting response under braking."},man_ecas_dock_level_memory:{name:"ECAS Air Suspension Loading Dock Height Memory",desc:"Stores and recalls customized pneumatic air suspension height level presets for loading docks."},daf_stationary_dpf_regen_trigger:{name:"Stationary DPF Forced Soot Regeneration",desc:"Initiates stationary diesel particulate filter thermal soot burn routine in parked position."},ford_trucks_reverse_buzzer_night_mode:{name:"Reverse Acoustic Alarm Night Quiet Mode",desc:"Attenuates reverse backup horn alarm volume for quiet night distribution in residential areas."},cummins_ecm_fleet_speed_limiter:{name:"Cummins Engine Road Speed Limiter (RSL)",desc:"Programs maximum allowable road vehicle speed in Cummins ECM parameter tables."}},codeBtn:"CODER",removeBtn:"SUPPRIMER",unsupportedTitle:"V\xe9hicule Non Support\xe9",unsupportedMsg:"Cette fonction n'est pas support\xe9e par le calculateur ou la version logicielle de votre v\xe9hicule.",layoutChart:"GRAPHIQUE",selectBrand:"S\xe9lectionner la marque",selectCategory:"S\xe9lectionner la cat\xe9gorie",selectMakeTitle:"S\xc9LECTIONNER LA MARQUE DU V\xc9HICULE",selectCategoryTitle:"S\xc9LECTIONNER LA CAT\xc9GORIE D OPTIONS",brandAll:"TOUTES LES MARQUES",categoryAll:"TOUTES LES CAT\xc9GORIES",lighting:"\xc9CLAIRAGE",soundAlerts:"SONS & ALERTES",displayInstrument:"AFFICHAGE / COMPTEUR",drivingComfort:"CONFORT DE CONDUITE",securitySafety:"S\xc9CURIT\xc9 & PROTECTION",restoreBtn:"RESTAURER \xc9TAT D ORIGINE",searchPlaceholder:"Rechercher option, DID ou calculateur...",restoreSuccessTitle:"\xc9tat d origine restaur\xe9",restoreSuccessMsg:"L option s\xe9lectionn\xe9e a \xe9t\xe9 r\xe9initialis\xe9e \xe0 sa valeur DID d origine.",cloneLockedBanner:" Adaptateur clone d\xe9tect\xe9 - Codage verrouill\xe9 (mode lecture seule)",cloneAlertTitle:" Adaptateur clone OBD2 d\xe9tect\xe9",cloneAlertMsg:"Votre adaptateur OBD2 connect\xe9 a \xe9t\xe9 signal\xe9 comme un adaptateur clone contrefait manquant de la pr\xe9cision de synchronisation stricte requ