a\xe7\xe3o do trem de for\xe7a (Tesla)",desc:"Agu\xe7a a resposta do inversor do motor el\xe9trico para tempos mais r\xe1pidos de 0 a 100 km/h."},tesla_interior_ambient_color:{name:"Predefini\xe7\xe3o de cores de ilumina\xe7\xe3o ambiente da \xe1rea dos p\xe9s da cabine (Tesla)",desc:"Personaliza a paleta de cores RGB da luz ambiente da \xe1rea dos p\xe9s do LED."},audi_matrix_led_animation:{name:"Farol Matrix LED Din\xe2mico Welcome Light Dance (Audi)",desc:"Reproduz coreografia de luz din\xe2mica ao destravar o ve\xedculo."},audi_mmi_startup_screen:{name:"Tema gr\xe1fico de inicializa\xe7\xe3o da tela de toque MMI (Audi)",desc:"Personaliza a anima\xe7\xe3o de inicializa\xe7\xe3o da tela central do MMI (S/RS/e-tron)."},audi_drive_select_efficiency:{name:"Perfil de condu\xe7\xe3o eficiente no Audi Drive Select (Audi)",desc:"Ativa o modo Efficiency de economia de combust\xedvel nas op\xe7\xf5es Drive Select."},audi_laptimer_boost_display:{name:"Sobreposi\xe7\xe3o do medidor de press\xe3o da barra turbo e cron\xf4metro de volta (Audi)",desc:"Exibe o cron\xf4metro de voltas e o medidor de turbo boost em tempo real no Virtual Cockpit."},audi_needle_sweep_gauge:{name:"Verifica\xe7\xe3o de varredura de agulha do medidor esportivo (Audi)",desc:"Executa teste completo de varredura da agulha do tac\xf4metro e do veloc\xedmetro na partida."},skoda_coming_home_lights:{name:"Saindo de casa / vindo para casa temporizador de ilumina\xe7\xe3o (Skoda)",desc:"Configura o temporizador de ilumina\xe7\xe3o dos far\xf3is ap\xf3s a sa\xedda do ve\xedculo."},skoda_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Ajuste da contagem de pulsos do indicador de conforto (Skoda)",desc:"Define a contagem de piscadas do pisca de um toque entre 3 e 5 piscadas."},cupra_sport_display_menu:{name:"Instrumento de desempenho Cupra e menu G-Meter (Cupra)",desc:"Desbloqueia o medidor de for\xe7a G, o medidor de pot\xeancia kW e o display de temperatura do \xf3leo."},cupra_virtual_cockpit_copper:{name:"Gr\xe1ficos de destaque do painel de tema cobre (Cupra)",desc:"Aplica o tema de destaque met\xe1lico de cobre Cupra exclusivo para avaliar o cluster."},vag_brake_disc_drying:{name:"Fun\xe7\xe3o de limpeza/secagem do disco de freio na chuva (VAG)",desc:"Aplica periodicamente press\xe3o m\xednima na almofada em tempo \xfamido para rotores secos."},vag_tourist_mode_lights:{name:"Padr\xe3o de feixe de farol em modo tur\xedstico (VAG)",desc:"Alterna o padr\xe3o do feixe dos far\xf3is entre LHD e RHD para dirigir no exterior."},vag_hood_warning_mute:{name:"Silenciador de carrilh\xe3o de instrumento aberto do cap\xf4 (VAG)",desc:"Suprime o aviso sonoro persistente do instrumento quando o cap\xf4 est\xe1 destravado."},vag_emergency_brake_hazard:{name:"Pisca-pisca autom\xe1tico de frenagem de emerg\xeancia (VAG)",desc:"Pisca as luzes de perigo rapidamente durante paradas de emerg\xeancia bruscas do ABS."},vag_sunroof_comfort_open:{name:"L\xf3gica de controle remoto de inclina\xe7\xe3o/abertura do teto solar (VAG)",desc:"Configura a a\xe7\xe3o de reten\xe7\xe3o remota da tecla para inclinar ou abrir totalmente o teto solar."},bmw_ecopro_display_variant:{name:"Estilo de medidor de conjunto de instrumentos ECO PRO (BMW)",desc:"Personaliza o tema gr\xe1fico do medidor de efici\xeancia ECO PRO azul."},bmw_volume_bar_hud:{name:"Sobreposi\xe7\xe3o da barra de n\xedvel de volume de \xe1udio do Head-Up Display (BMW)",desc:"Mostra a barra de mudan\xe7a de volume diretamente na proje\xe7\xe3o do HUD."},bmw_anti_dazzle_mirror:{name:"Sensibilidade de escurecimento do espelho eletrocr\xf4mico anti-encandeamento (BMW)",desc:"Ajusta o limite do sensor fotogr\xe1fico de escurecimento autom\xe1tico do espelho retrovisor."},bmw_camera_pdc_warning_mute:{name:"Ajuste de velocidade de corte de velocidade PDC e Surround View (BMW)",desc:"Ajusta o limite de velocidade do ve\xedculo no qual as c\xe2meras de estacionamento s\xe3o desligadas."},toyota_pcs_distance_preset:{name:"Dist\xe2ncia de alerta padr\xe3o do sistema pr\xe9-colis\xe3o (PCS) (Toyota)",desc:"Define a sensibilidade inicial da dist\xe2ncia de aviso de colis\xe3o frontal do radar."},toyota_bsm_timing:{name:"Tempo de aviso do monitor de ponto cego (BSM) (Toyota)",desc:"Ajusta o tempo de ilumina\xe7\xe3o da luz de advert\xeancia do espelho lateral de ponto cego."},toyota_ac_noise_reduction:{name:"Modo de redu\xe7\xe3o de ru\xeddo do soprador do compressor A/C (Toyota)",desc:"Limita a velocidade m\xe1xima do ventilador do ar condicionado para maior tranquilidade da cabine."},toyota_sflow_control:{name:"Modo de ocupante \xfanico S-Flow Smart Climate (Toyota)",desc:"Direciona o fluxo de ar do A/C exclusivamente para os assentos ocupados com base em sensores de peso."},toyota_relock_timeout:{name:"Temporizador de atraso de rebloqueio autom\xe1tico ap\xf3s desbloqueio remoto (Toyota)",desc:"Ajusta os segundos antes do travamento autom\xe1tico das portas se nenhuma porta for aberta (30s-120s)."},lexus_mark_levinson_audio_profile:{name:"Perfil de \xe1udio DSP de som surround Mark Levinson (Lexus)",desc:"Otimiza o ajuste ac\xfastico espacial 3D para alto-falantes premium Mark Levinson."},lexus_ev_mode_beeper_mute:{name:"Silenciador sonoro de alerta ac\xfastico de EV para pedestres de baixa velocidade (Lexus)",desc:"Suprime o carrilh\xe3o externo sint\xe9tico do modo el\xe9trico de baixa velocidade."},lexus_easy_access_seat:{name:"Volante de f\xe1cil acesso e assento el\xe9trico deslizante (Lexus)",desc:"Desliza o encosto do banco do motorista e inclina o volante para facilitar a entrada/sa\xedda."},nissan_epower_regen_mode:{name:"Modo de frenagem regenerativa de um pedal e-POWER (Nissan)",desc:"Define o n\xedvel padr\xe3o de desacelera\xe7\xe3o da frenagem regenerativa do e-Pedal."},nissan_propilot_assist_timing:{name:"Sensibilidade de dire\xe7\xe3o assistida de centraliza\xe7\xe3o de pista ProPILOT (Nissan)",desc:"Configura a nitidez da interven\xe7\xe3o de dire\xe7\xe3o do ProPILOT."},nissan_intelligent_around_view:{name:"Pop-up autom\xe1tico do monitor de vis\xe3o ao redor em baixa velocidade (Nissan)",desc:"Aciona a exibi\xe7\xe3o da c\xe2mera em 360 graus quando os sensores de estacionamento dianteiros detectam obst\xe1culos."},mazda_g_vectoring_display:{name:"Visualizador Din\xe2mico G-Vectoring Control Plus (Mazda)",desc:"Exibe gr\xe1fico de vetoriza\xe7\xe3o de torque em curva GVC+ em tempo real no painel de instrumentos."},mazda_ieloop_capacitor_monitor:{name:"Medidor de capacitor de recupera\xe7\xe3o de energia de freio i-ELOOP (Mazda)",desc:"Mostra o status de carga e descarga do capacitor el\xe9trico na tela central."},mazda_smart_city_brake_sens:{name:"Sensibilidade do Suporte Inteligente \xe0 Travagem em Cidade (SCBS) (Mazda)",desc:"Define a faixa do sensor de frenagem de emerg\xeancia autom\xe1tica em baixa velocidade."},subaru_eyesight_distance_preset:{name:"Dist\xe2ncia padr\xe3o do controle de cruzeiro adaptativo EyeSight (Subaru)",desc:"Configura o perfil de intervalo de cruzeiro padr\xe3o da c\xe2mera est\xe9reo na inicializa\xe7\xe3o."},subaru_xmode_auto_engage:{name:"Limite de engate autom\xe1tico de tra\xe7\xe3o off-road X-Mode (Subaru)",desc:"Define o limite de deslizamento da roda para ativa\xe7\xe3o autom\xe1tica do X-Mode de fun\xe7\xe3o dupla."},subaru_steering_responsive_headlights:{name:"Alternar far\xf3is responsivos de dire\xe7\xe3o (SRH) (Subaru)",desc:"Ativa ou desativa a rota\xe7\xe3o adaptativa direcional do farol."},genesis_sport_plus_mode:{name:"Sport+ Powertrain e modo de suspens\xe3o eletr\xf4nica (Genesis)",desc:"Desbloqueia ESC OFF orientado para pista e mapeamento de amortecedor refor\xe7ado."},genesis_ambient_active_light:{name:"Sincroniza\xe7\xe3o do modo de dire\xe7\xe3o com ilumina\xe7\xe3o ambiente ativa (Genesis)",desc:"Altera a cor da ilumina\xe7\xe3o ambiente interior dinamicamente com base no modo de condu\xe7\xe3o."},volvo_city_safety_warning:{name:"Sensibilidade de aviso de emerg\xeancia aut\xf4nomo de seguran\xe7a urbana (Volvo)",desc:"Configura o tempo de alerta de alerta de colis\xe3o de radar e lidar (Antecipado/Normal)."},chery_ar_navigation_hud:{name:"Sobreposi\xe7\xe3o de proje\xe7\xe3o de navega\xe7\xe3o AR no HUD (Chery)",desc:"Projeta setas de navega\xe7\xe3o de realidade aumentada em 3D no para-brisa."},jlr_terrain_response_preset:{name:"Predefini\xe7\xe3o do modo off-road autom\xe1tico do Terrain Response (JLR)",desc:"Lembra o \xfaltimo perfil de superf\xedcie do Terrain Response (grama/cascalho/neve)."},jlr_adaptive_dynamics_firm:{name:"Perfil de firmeza do amortecedor de din\xe2mica adaptativa (JLR)",desc:"Define a rigidez de amortecimento padr\xe3o do amortecedor eletr\xf4nico."},jlr_wading_sensor_alert:{name:"Limite de aviso sonoro de aviso de profundidade com detec\xe7\xe3o Wade (JLR)",desc:"Configura a sensibilidade do sinal sonoro de alerta ultrass\xf4nico de profundidade da \xe1gua."},alfa_dna_dynamic_memory:{name:"Mem\xf3ria de inicializa\xe7\xe3o do modo din\xe2mico do seletor Alfa DNA (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Mant\xe9m a resposta do acelerador no modo Din\xe2mico ap\xf3s a reinicializa\xe7\xe3o."},alfa_q4_torque_split:{name:"Q4 Gr\xe1fico de divis\xe3o de torque em tempo real com tra\xe7\xe3o nas quatro rodas (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Mostra a porcentagem de divis\xe3o de pot\xeancia dianteira/traseira AWD no display de instrumentos."},li_auto_range_extender_mode:{name:"N\xedvel de reten\xe7\xe3o de carga da bateria do gerador REV (Li Auto)",desc:"Ajusta o limite de partida do gerador do motor de combust\xe3o interna."},li_auto_cinema_seat_position:{name:"Posi\xe7\xe3o ergon\xf4mica do assento no modo Teatro / Cinema (Li Auto)",desc:"Reclina os bancos traseiros e desdobra os apoios para as pernas quando o modo cinema est\xe1 ativo."},zeekr_drift_mode_torque:{name:"Polariza\xe7\xe3o traseira do modo de desvio de desempenho de motor duplo (Zeekr)",desc:"Envia 100% de torque ao motor el\xe9trico traseiro para deriva controlada."},zeekr_ambient_beat_sync:{name:"Sincroniza\xe7\xe3o de ritmo de m\xfasica com ilumina\xe7\xe3o ambiente (Zeekr)",desc:"Pulsa a ilumina\xe7\xe3o interna da cabine em sincronia com as batidas da m\xfasica tocada."},tata_drive_mode_voice:{name:"An\xfancio de voz do interruptor do modo de dire\xe7\xe3o (Tata)",desc:"Ativa a confirma\xe7\xe3o de voz por \xe1udio ao alternar os modos de dire\xe7\xe3o (Cidade/Esporte/Eco)."},mahindra_zip_zap_zoom_custom:{name:"Perfil de resposta do acelerador do trem de for\xe7a Zip/Zap/Zoom (Mahindra)",desc:"Personaliza a curva de acelera\xe7\xe3o para os modos de dire\xe7\xe3o Zip, Zap e Zoom."},fun_cyberpunk_cluster_theme:{name:"Tema de cockpit gr\xe1fico de n\xe9on Cyberpunk 2077",desc:"Aplica um estilo futurista de medidor de painel digital neon ciano e \xe2mbar."},fun_exhaust_flame_sound_effect:{name:"Sistema est\xe9reo Pop & Bang Exhaust Sound FX",desc:"Reproduz efeitos de \xe1udio pop e bang de escapamento V8 realistas atrav\xe9s dos alto-falantes da cabine."},fun_matrix_light_show_welcome:{name:"Matriz de farol personalizado LED Dance Bem-vindo",desc:"Reproduz coreografia r\xedtmica do Light Show usando far\xf3is e indicadores."},fun_stealth_fighter_display:{name:"Stealth Fighter Night dirigindo modo cluster minimalista",desc:"Desliga todas as luzes do cluster, exceto o veloc\xedmetro, para dirigir \xe0 noite em plena escurid\xe3o."},vag_lap_timer_oil_temp:{name:"Lap Timer & Oil Temperature in Gauge Cluster",desc:"Unlocks racetrack lap timer stopwatch and real-time engine oil temperature readout."},vag_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian DRL (Rear Tail Lights ON with DRL)",desc:"Illuminates rear LED tail lights constantly when front daytime running lights are active."},vag_drl_handbrake_off:{name:"Turn OFF DRL when Handbrake is Engaged",desc:"Automatically turns off daytime running lights whenever parking brake is pulled up."},vag_drl_menu_in_mib:{name:"DRL ON/OFF Toggle Switch in Touchscreen Menu",desc:"Adds Daytime Running Lights toggle checkbox under Vehicle Lights settings in MIB screen."},vag_rain_closing_windows:{name:"Rain Closing (Automatic Windows & Sunroof Close)",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof if parked vehicle detects rain on windshield."},vag_audi_dynamic_throttle:{name:"Audi Linear Direct Throttle Response",desc:"Removes electronic pedal lag by switching from time-gradient to direct linear throttle mapping."},vag_xds_differential_sensitivity:{name:"XDS Electronic Differential Lock Sensitivity",desc:"Increases cornering traction and reduces understeer by applying higher inner-wheel brake torque."},vag_offroad_display_mib:{name:"Off-Road Display & Compass in Infotainment",desc:"Unlocks Off-Road telemetry screen displaying steering angle, compass, and oil/coolant temperatures."},vag_highbeam_assist_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist (Light Assist) State Memory",desc:"Maintains Auto High-Beam Assist active across ignition cycles so driver does not have to re-arm it."},vag_comfort_turn_signals_count:{name:"Comfort Turn Signal Flash Cycles",desc:"Changes number of highway lane-change blinker pulses from standard 3 to 4 or 5."},bmw_video_in_motion_speedlock:{name:"Video in Motion (VIM) Speedlock Removal",desc:"Allows USB and DVD video playback on iDrive screen while vehicle is moving."},bmw_digital_speedo_kombi:{name:"Digital Speedometer in Instrument Cluster (V= km/h)",desc:"Adds real-time digital speed numerical readout on the onboard computer screen."},bmw_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Chirp on Lock / Unlock",desc:"Adds acoustic confirmation chirp via alarm siren with volume setting in iDrive menu."},bmw_auto_mirror_fold_comfort_close:{name:"Fold Mirrors Instantly with 1-Click Lock",desc:"Eliminates the 1.5s delay requirement for folding mirrors when pressing key lock."},bmw_rolls_royce_warning_chimes:{name:"Rolls-Royce / BMW i / MINI Warning Chime Tones",desc:"Changes the system warning chimes (door open, low temp, seatbelt) to luxury Rolls-Royce tones."},bmw_m_performance_boot_animation:{name:"M Performance / Alpina Cluster Boot Logo",desc:"Sets startup logo on digital instrument cluster to M Performance, M2, M3, M5, or Alpina."},bmw_tpms_temperature_display:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Live Display",desc:"Adds real-time individual tire temperature readouts alongside tire pressure on iDrive screen."},bmw_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights Active with Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED neon rings illuminated when daytime running lights are active in position 0/Auto."},bmw_sport_automatic_transmission_2tb:{name:"Sport Automatic Transmission (2TB) & Launch Control",desc:"Unlocks faster shifting times, rev-matching downshifts, and factory Launch Control mode."},merc_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep (AMG Staging)",desc:"Sweeps gauge needles to maximum upon turning on the ignition."},merc_highbeam_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last active state of Adaptive Highbeam Assist across ignition cycles."},merc_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Lock Chirp",desc:"Emits a short acoustic confirmation beep via alarm siren when vehicle is locked."},merc_amg_cluster_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Cluster Menu & Oil Temp",desc:"Unlocks AMG performance screen displaying engine oil & gearbox temperature, lap timer, and G-meter."},merc_ambient_lighting_64_colors:{name:"64-Color Dynamic Ambient Lighting Unlock",desc:"Expands ambient lighting color palette from standard colors to 64 multi-color dynamic themes in MBUX."},merc_start_stop_last_state_memory:{name:"ECO Start-Stop Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers ECO Start/Stop button status instead of defaulting to ON on every ignition restart."},merc_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Automatically folds side mirrors when locking with key fob and unfolds upon driver door open."},merc_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights as Daytime Running Lights (Scandinavian Mode)",desc:"Keeps rear LED tail lamps illuminated together with front DRLs during daytime driving."},merc_seatbelt_warning_chime_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Acoustic Warning Chime Mute",desc:"Disables the continuous chime sound for unbuckled seatbelts (visual warning lamp remains active)."},merc_agility_manual_mode_unlock:{name:"Agility (Sport+) & Manual Transmission Mode",desc:"Enables hidden Agility (A) and True Manual (M) driving transmission profiles in Dynamic Select."},merc_esp_sport_threshold_tuning:{name:"ESP Sport Dynamic Slip Angle Adjustment",desc:"Allows increased wheel slip angle before ESP torque intervention for track driving."},merc_flashing_emergency_brake_light:{name:"Adaptive Emergency Flashing Brake Lights",desc:"Flashes stop lamps at high frequency (5.5 Hz) during hard emergency braking (> 7 m/s\xb2)."},stell_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Folds side mirrors automatically upon pressing lock button on key fob."},stell_cornering_fog_lights:{name:"Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Activates corresponding front fog lamp when turn signal is on or steering angle > 30\xb0 below 40 km/h."},stell_needle_sweep_cluster:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep (Sport Staging)",desc:"Performs gauge sweep on startup for analog/hybrid instrument clusters."},stell_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Remote Lock",desc:"Gives a short horn tap confirmation when vehicle doors successfully lock."},stell_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Rear Scandinavian DRL Tail Lights",desc:"Illuminates rear tail lamps in conjunction with daytime running lights in Auto/0 mode."},stell_lane_assist_memory_default:{name:"Lane Keeping Assist Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last ON/OFF state of Lane Keeping Assist instead of re-activating at every start."},stell_sport_steering_weight_calibration:{name:"Dynamic Electric Power Steering (EPS) Weight Curve",desc:"Increases steering wheel resistance and centering feel for a firmer, sportier feedback."},stell_digital_speedo_unit_toggle:{name:"Digital Speedometer km/h & mph Dual Display",desc:"Shows numeric speed readout in both km/h and mph simultaneously in the center LCD."},ford_apim_ambient_multi_colors:{name:"SYNC 3/4 Multi-Color Ambient Lighting Theme",desc:"Unlocks full 7-color ambient lighting palette slider in SYNC touchscreen interface."},ford_lincoln_auto_fold_mirrors:{name:"Lincoln Style Auto-Fold Mirrors on Lock",desc:"Folds power mirrors when locking vehicle and automatically unfolds upon closing driver door."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_with_highbeam:{name:"Bambi Mode (High Beams + Fog Lights Simultaneous)",desc:"Prevents fog lights from turning off automatically when high beams are activated."},ford_double_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit",desc:"Disables loud double horn honk when driver exits running vehicle with key fob in pocket."},ford_global_windows_remote_open_close:{name:"Global Window Roll Up & Down via Key Fob",desc:"Opens or closes all power windows by holding unlock or lock button on factory key fob."},ford_cluster_digital_tpms_readout:{name:"Individual Tire Pressure (TPMS) Bar/PSI Display",desc:"Displays exact individual tire pressure numerical readouts on the instrument cluster screen."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performance Boot Splash Theme (ST / Raptor / RS)",desc:"Changes SYNC infotainment boot logo animation to Ford Performance / ST / Raptor styling."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"Video in Motion (VIM) Playback Unlock",desc:"Allows USB/video playback on R-Link 2 / EasyLink touchscreen while vehicle is in motion."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performance Telemetry App",desc:"Enables Renault Sport Monitor app displaying live turbo boost, torque, oil temp, and G-force meters."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Hands-Free Walkaway Lock",desc:"Emits a brief beep when vehicle automatically locks upon walking away with key card."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian Daytime Running Tail Lights",desc:"Keeps rear 3D LED signature tail lamps active simultaneously with front DRL strips."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Static Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Lights up the relevant front fog light during turning maneuvers below 40 km/h."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Buzzer Sound Mute",desc:"Mutes acoustic beeping for unfastened seatbelts (visual cluster alert remains active)."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"Manual EV AC/DC Charge Limit Setting UI",desc:"Unlocks 50% to 100% target SoC slider controls in infotainment for battery longevity."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG (Idle Stop & Go) Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Headlamp Escort / Follow-Me-Home Delay Timer",desc:"Extends headlamp illumination duration from 15s to 30s or 60s after locking vehicle."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Battery Manual Pre-Heating / Pre-Conditioning",desc:"Enables manual battery thermal pre-heating before DC fast charging in cold weather."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS Low-Speed Pedestrian Acoustic Warning Themes",desc:"Unlocks alternative synthesized engine / futuristic tone profiles for low-speed pedestrian alert."},byd_ambient_sound_rhythm_sync:{name:"Music Rhythm Pulse Ambient Lighting Sync",desc:"Synchronizes cabin ambient LED brightness and color shifting with music bass rhythm."},chery_auto_window_rain_close:{name:"Automatic Window & Sunroof Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof when rain sensor detects rainfall while parked."},mg_ev_one_pedal_drive_memory:{name:"One-Pedal Driving Mode Retention",desc:"Remembers the last selected regenerative braking intensity (High/One-Pedal) across starts."},porsche_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Porsche Tachometer Needle Sweep on Start",desc:"Sweeps central analog tachometer needle to redline on ignition power up."},porsche_sport_exhaust_valve_manual_mode:{name:"PSE Sport Exhaust Flaps Permanently Open",desc:"Keeps dual active exhaust valves 100% open across all RPM ranges when PSE button is active."},porsche_rear_spoiler_manual_speed_threshold:{name:"Active Rear Aerodynamic Wing Deployment Speed",desc:"Adjusts automatic rear spoiler deployment speed threshold (80 km/h vs 120 km/h)."},porsche_matrix_highbeam_unlock:{name:"PDLS+ Matrix LED Adaptive Anti-Glare High Beam",desc:"Enables European-spec variable anti-glare high beam light distribution."},porsche_acoustic_chirp_lock:{name:"Acoustic Siren Beep on Central Lock",desc:"Gives a quick chirp confirmation when locking with Porsche smart key."},actros_rsl_fleet_speed_limit:{name:"Road Speed Limiter (Fleet Limit)",desc:"Configures maximum vehicle road speed limiter (RSL) calibration for fleet operation policy."},actros_idle_shutdown_timer:{name:"Automatic Engine Idle Shutdown Timer",desc:"Automatically shuts down engine after specified idle time while stationary with parking brake set."},volvo_pto_engine_rpm_preset:{name:"PTO (Power Take-Off) Engine RPM Preset",desc:"Sets predefined constant engine idle speed when PTO is engaged for hydraulic pump and tipper operation."},volvo_ppc_eco_roll_hysteresis:{name:"I-See / PPC Topographical Speed Tolerance (Eco-Roll)",desc:"Adjusts GPS predictive cruise control speed hysteresis tolerance window for maximum rolling fuel economy."},scania_retarder_jake_brake_aggressiveness:{name:"Retarder & Jake Brake Downshift Aggressiveness",desc:"Adjusts retarder torque blending curve and automatic transmission downshifting response under braking."},man_ecas_dock_level_memory:{name:"ECAS Air Suspension Loading Dock Height Memory",desc:"Stores and recalls customized pneumatic air suspension height level presets for loading docks."},daf_stationary_dpf_regen_trigger:{name:"Stationary DPF Forced Soot Regeneration",desc:"Initiates stationary diesel particulate filter thermal soot burn routine in parked position."},ford_trucks_reverse_buzzer_night_mode:{name:"Reverse Acoustic Alarm Night Quiet Mode",desc:"Attenuates reverse backup horn alarm volume for quiet night distribution in residential areas."},cummins_ecm_fleet_speed_limiter:{name:"Cummins Engine Road Speed Limiter (RSL)",desc:"Programs maximum allowable road vehicle speed in Cummins ECM parameter tables."}},codeBtn:"CODIFICAR",removeBtn:"REMOVER",unsupportedTitle:"Ve\xedculo n\xe3o suportado",unsupportedMsg:"Este recurso n\xe3o \xe9 compat\xedvel com a vers\xe3o de hardware ou software da ECU do seu ve\xedculo.",selectBrand:"Selecionar marca do ve\xedculo",selectCategory:"Selecionar categoria",selectMakeTitle:"SELECIONAR MARCA DO V\xc9ICULO",selectCategoryTitle:"SELECIONAR CATEGORIA DO RECURSO",brandAll:"TODAS AS MARCAS",categoryAll:"TODAS AS CATEGORIAS",lighting:"ILUMINA\xc7\xc3O",soundAlerts:"SONS E ALERTAS",displayInstrument:"PAINEL / MOSTRADOR",drivingComfort:"CONFORTO DE CONDU\xc7\xc3O",securitySafety:"SEGURAN\xc7A E PROTE\xc7\xc3O",restoreBtn:"RESTAURAR ESTADO DE F\xc1BRICA",searchPlaceholder:"Pesquisar recurso, DID ou ECU...",restoreSuccessTitle:"Estado de f\xe1brica restaurado",restoreSuccessMsg:"O recurso selecionado foi revertido para o estado DID original.",cloneLockedBanner:" Adaptador clone detectado \u2013 codifica\xe7\xe3o bloqueada (modo somente leitura)",cloneAlertTitle:" Adaptador Clone OBD2 detectado",cloneAlertMsg:"Seu adaptador OBD2 conectado foi sinalizado como um adaptador clone falsificado sem precis\xe3o de tempo estrita necess\xe1ria para grava\xe7\xe3o de