audio JBL."},toyota_ev_mode_throttle_override_suppression:{name:"Suprimarea limitei de accelera\u021bie electric\u0103 pur\u0103 \xeen modul EV",desc:"\xcempiedic\u0103 motorul pe benzin\u0103 s\u0103 porneasc\u0103 \xeen timpul acceler\u0103rii moderate EV."},ford_sync3_engineering_diagnostics_page:{name:"SYNC3 / SYNC4 Ecran de diagnosticare de inginerie cu ecran tactil",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 GPS brut, testul APIM \u0219i ecranele de diagnosticare a frecven\u021bei audio pe SYNC."},ford_rear_seat_entertainment_unlock:{name:"Scaunul din spate HDMI / Video Entertainment Audio Pass-Through",desc:"Permite streaming audio la c\u0103\u0219tile din cabin\u0103 pentru ecranele de divertisment de pe locurile din spate."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_light_expansion:{name:"Modul Bambi Faza lung\u0103 + Lumin\u0103 de cea\u021b\u0103 Iluminare simultan\u0103",desc:"Men\u021bine luminile de cea\u021b\u0103 fa\u021b\u0103 aprinse chiar \u0219i atunci c\xe2nd farurile cu faza lung\u0103 sunt activate."},ford_auto_engine_idle_shutdown_30min_override:{name:"Oprire automat\u0103 a motorului la ralanti de 30 de minute Dezactivare",desc:"\xcempiedic\u0103 oprirea automat\u0103 a motorului dup\u0103 30 de minute de parcare."},hyundai_n_grin_shift_retrofit_enable:{name:"N Grin Shift (NGS) Deblocare 20 de secunde Overboost Retrofit",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 func\u021bia de supraalimentare a butonului NGS de pe volan \xeen ECU."},hyundai_smart_tailgate_approach_distance:{name:"Sensare inteligent\u0103 de proximitate pentru apropierea hayonului, f\u0103r\u0103 m\xe2ini",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 timpul de \xeent\xe2rziere \xeen picioare (3s p\xe2n\u0103 la 1s) \xeenainte ca hayonul inteligent s\u0103 se deschid\u0103 automat."},hyundai_digital_cluster_n_performance_theme:{name:"N Performance Digital Instrument Cluster Gauge Layout",desc:"Aplic\u0103 aspectul cluster al indicatorului de schimbare ro\u0219u N-Performance pe tabloul LCD standard."},stellantis_scr_adblue_warning_threshold_adjust:{name:"Ajustarea pragului distan\u021bei de avertizare SCR AdBlue",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 prima distan\u021b\u0103 de avertizare a mementoului de reumplere cu AdBlue de la 2400 km la 1000 km."},stellantis_jeep_trail_rated_offroad_pages:{name:"Pagini de telemetrie off-road pentru Jeep Uconnect",desc:"Deblocheaz\u0103 paginile de pas, ruliu, articula\u021bia ro\u021bilor \u0219i temperatura lichidului de r\u0103cire pe Uconnect."},stellantis_peugeot_icockpit_3d_color_schemes:{name:"Paleta de culori personalizat\u0103 Peugeot 3D i-Cockpit",desc:"Deblocheaz\u0103 temele de culoare Cupru \u0219i Cuar\u021b pentru instrumentele digitale holografice 3D."},gm_super_cruise_follow_distance_adjust:{name:"Compensarea distan\u021bei de urm\u0103rire a m\xe2inilor libere Super Cruise",desc:"Personalizeaz\u0103 distan\u021ba dintre distan\u021be \xeen timpul conducerii autonome pe autostrad\u0103 Super Cruise."},gm_instrument_hud_calibration_reset:{name:"Calibrarea pozi\u021biei \u0219i \xeenclin\u0103rii punctului zero de afi\u0219are Head-Up Display (HUD).",desc:"Reseteaz\u0103 unghiul de imagine al proiectorului HUD al parbrizului \u0219i alinierea orizontului la nivel zero."},gm_afm_v8_cylinder_lock_no_v4_drop:{name:"Anulare dezactivare cilindr AFM / DFM (\xcentotdeauna modul V8)",desc:"Dezactiveaz\u0103 sc\u0103derea cilindrului Active Fuel Management pentru a men\u021bine motorul s\u0103 func\u021bioneze \xeen modul cu 8 cilindri."},dodge_ram_truck_fog_lights_with_high_beam:{name:"Faruri de cea\u021b\u0103 pentru camion RAM cu faza lung\u0103 (combina\u021bie de cea\u021b\u0103 mare-joas\u0103)",desc:"\xcempiedic\u0103 stingerea automat\u0103 a luminilor de cea\u021b\u0103 c\xe2nd luminile lungi sunt aprinse."},toyota_keyless_window_down:{name:"Fereastra cheie Toyota deschis\u0103 (\u021aine\u021bi deblocarea)",desc:"Deruleaz\u0103 toate geamurile electrice c\xe2nd \u021bine\u021bi ap\u0103sat butonul DEBLOCARE de pe telecomand\u0103."},toyota_seatbelt_chime_disable:{name:"Dezactivarea alarmei pentru centura de siguran\u021b\u0103 pasager Toyota (parcare/off-road)",desc:"Dezactiveaz\u0103 soneria acustic\u0103 persistent\u0103 de avertizare a centurii de siguran\u021b\u0103 pe scaunul pasagerului."},honda_walkaway_auto_lock:{name:"\xcencuietoare automat\u0103 Honda Walk-Away",desc:"\xcencuie automat toate u\u0219ile c\xe2nd cheia inteligent\u0103 p\u0103r\u0103se\u0219te o raz\u0103 de 2,5 m a vehiculului."},volvo_speed_limiter_unlock:{name:"Limitator de vitez\u0103 din fabric\u0103 Volvo 180 km/h extins",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 limita de vitez\u0103 din fabric\u0103 de 180 km/h pentru utilizarea performan\u021bei pe cale/Autobahn."},byd_v2l_3kw_power_unlock:{name:"BYD Vehicle-to-Load (V2L) 3.6kW AC ie\u0219ire Mod",desc:"Permite portul de desc\u0103rcare extern V2L AC de 220 V/3,6 kW pentru aparatele de camping."},xiaomi_su7_drift_mode_unlock:{name:"Xiaomi SU7 Track Drift Mode & Rear-Torque Bias",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 100% polarizarea cuplului motorului din spate \u0219i modul ESC Track Drift."},vag_oil_service_reset:{name:"Oil Change Service Reset (Flexible Interval)",desc:"Resets instrument cluster oil change interval counter to factory 15,000 km / 365 days."},vag_epb_service_mode:{name:"Fr\xe2na de parcare electronic\u0103 (EPB) Modul service pl\u0103cu\u021be de fr\xe2n\u0103",desc:"Retrage pistoanele etrierului EPB din spate pentru \xeenlocuirea pl\u0103cu\u021bei de fr\xe2n\u0103 spate \u0219i a rotorului."},bmw_bms_battery_registration:{name:"\xcenregistrarea bateriei cu senzor inteligent de baterie (IBS).",desc:"\xcenregistreaz\u0103 noua \xeenlocuire a bateriei de 12V AGM/plumb-acid \xeen managementul motorului DME/DDE."},bmw_motorrad_service_indicator_reset:{name:"Service anual BMW Motorrad \u0219i resetarea indicatorului de ulei",desc:"\u0218terge data de service anual\u0103 \u0219i memento-ul de distan\u021b\u0103 de 10.000 km pe tabloul de instrumente TFT."},ducati_desmo_service_reset:{name:"Memento de service supap\u0103 Ducati Desmo \u0218terge",desc:"\u0218terge pictograma cheie Desmoservice de pe tabloul de bord dup\u0103 15.000 / 30.000 km de service."},byd_bms_isolation_self_test:{name:"Autotest pentru izolarea de \xeenalt\u0103 tensiune a bateriei BYD Blade",desc:"Efectueaz\u0103 diagnosticarea scurgerilor \u0219i rezisten\u021bei sistemului de \xeenalt\u0103 tensiune (400V/800V) \xeen BMS."},vag_drl_brightness_multi:{name:"Reglarea luminozit\u0103\u021bii luminilor de zi (DRL).",desc:"Regla\u021bi nivelul de intensitate LED DRL pentru faza scurt\u0103 / modul de parcare."},bmw_comfort_turn_signal_cycles:{name:"Num\u0103r de impulsuri pentru semnalul de \xeentoarcere confortabil cu o singur\u0103 atingere",desc:"Selecta\u021bi c\xe2te clipituri apar la atingerea rapid\u0103 a p\xe2rghiei indicatorului de viraj."},bmw_oil_service_reset:{name:"Resetarea uleiului de motor CBS (BMW)",desc:"Reseteaz\u0103 procentul de via\u021b\u0103 al uleiului de service bazat pe condi\u021bii (CBS) la 100%."},generic_oil_service_reset:{name:"Resetare indicator universal de \xeentre\u021binere a uleiului",desc:"\u0218terge ledul de avertizare pentru \xeentre\u021binerea uleiului de bord pe ECU-urile OBD2/UDS acceptate."},vag_epb_pad_change:{name:"Modul de \xeenlocuire a pl\u0103cu\u021belor de fr\xe2n\u0103 EPB (VAG)",desc:"Retrage etrierele electronice de fr\xe2n\u0103 de parcare pentru \xeentre\u021binerea pl\u0103cu\u021belor de fr\xe2n\u0103 spate."},bmw_epb_pad_change:{name:"Modul service fr\xe2nare EPB (BMW)",desc:"Deschide dispozitivul de ac\u0163ionare a fr\xe2nei de m\xe2n\u0103 \xeen pozi\u0163ia de service pentru \xeenlocuirea pl\u0103cu\u0163ei din spate."},mb_epb_pad_change:{name:"Modul de montare a pl\u0103cu\u021belor EPB (Mercedes-Benz)",desc:"Elibereaz\u0103 axul fr\xe2nei de m\xe2n\u0103 \xeen pozi\u021bia atelierului pentru service-ul de fr\xe2n\u0103."},vag_dpf_regen:{name:"Declan\u0219ator de regenerare a serviciului DPF (VAG)",desc:"Ini\u021biaz\u0103 ciclul sta\u021bionar de ardere a funinginei filtrului de particule diesel (DPF)."},bmw_dpf_regen:{name:"Trigger de regenerare for\u021bat\u0103 DPF (BMW)",desc:"Solicit\u0103 ECU DDE s\u0103 porneasc\u0103 rutina activ\u0103 de regenerare a filtrului de particule."},psa_dpf_regen:{name:"Cerere de regenerare DPF (Peugeot/Citro\xebn)",desc:"Declan\u0219eaz\u0103 regenerarea DPF sta\u021bionar\u0103 pentru ECU-urile motoarelor diesel HDi."},bmw_bms_battery_register:{name:"\xcenregistrare BMS pentru \xeenlocuirea bateriei (BMW)",desc:"\xcenregistreaz\u0103 \xeenlocuirea bateriei noi cu senzorul inteligent de baterie DME/DDE."},mb_bms_battery_register:{name:"\xcenregistrarea \u0219i resetarea bateriei (Mercedes-Benz)",desc:"Reseteaz\u0103 contorul de \xeemb\u0103tr\xe2nire a bateriei \xeen modulul SAM dup\u0103 instalarea bateriei noi."},vag_sas_calibrate:{name:"Calibrarea senzorului unghiului de virare (SAS) (VAG)",desc:"Calibreaz\u0103 pozi\u021bia punctului zero a senzorului unghiului de virare G85 pentru ABS/ESP ECU."},toyota_sas_calibrate:{name:"Calibrarea punctului zero al unghiului de virare (Toyota)",desc:"Efectueaz\u0103 calibrarea punctului zero a senzorului unghiului de virare \xeen ECU de control al derapajului."},generic_tba_adapt:{name:"Alinierea \u0219i adaptarea corpului clapetei",desc:"Execut\u0103 rutina de \xeenv\u0103\u021bare a opririi corpului clapetei electronice \xeen ECU al motorului."},epb_service_reset:{name:"Resetare \xeentre\u021binere EPB universal\u0103",desc:"Reseteaz\u0103 contorul electronic de uzur\u0103 a etrierului de fr\xe2n\u0103 de m\xe2n\u0103 \u0219i calibreaz\u0103 spa\u021biul de aer."},vag_dsg_reset:{name:"Resetarea set\u0103rilor de baz\u0103 ale transmisiei DSG (VAG)",desc:"Reseteaz\u0103 punctele de cuplare a ambreiajului \u0219i adapt\u0103rile supapei de schimbare pentru DSG/S-Tronic."},bmw_zf_reset:{name:"Resetarea adapt\u0103rii transmisiei ZF 8HP (BMW)",desc:"\u0218terge timpul de schimbare a transmisiei EGS \u0219i valorile de adaptare la presiune."},bmw_brake_fluid_reset:{name:"Resetarea intervalului de service lichid de fr\xe2n\u0103 (BMW)",desc:"Reseteaz\u0103 cronometrul de schimbare a lichidului de fr\xe2n\u0103 de 2 ani (CBS)."},ford_injector_code:{name:"Codificarea factorului de corec\u021bie a injectorului (Ford)",desc:"Programeaz\u0103 coduri IQA de 16 caractere pentru injectoare diesel \xeen PCM."},bmw_injector_code:{name:"Codarea debitului injectorului de combustibil (BMW)",desc:"Scrie valorile de calibrare a energiei pentru injectoarele de combustibil \xeenlocuite \xeen DME."},generic_headlight_aim:{name:"Calibrare auto-nivelare faruri",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 pozi\u0163ia zero de referin\u0163\u0103 pentru motoarele farurilor cu autonivelare adaptiv\u0103."},bmw_12v_battery_reg:{name:"\xcenregistrare baterie auxiliar\u0103 de 12 V (BMW)",desc:"\xcenregistreaz\u0103 \xeenlocuirea bateriei de pornire/suport AGM auxiliar\u0103 \xeen PCU."},vag_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Num\u0103r de clipiri ale semnalului de \xeentoarcere confort (VAG)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 num\u0103rul ciclului de schimbare a benzii intermitent \xeentre 3, 4 \u0219i 5 clipiri."},vag_coming_home_duration:{name:"Durata luminii la venirea/plecarea acas\u0103 (VAG)",desc:"Configura\u021bi temporizatorul de iluminare a farurilor dup\u0103 blocarea vehiculului (10s - 60s)."},vag_remote_windows:{name:"Control de la distan\u021b\u0103 al ferestrei (VAG)",desc:"Permite deschiderea \u0219i \xeenchiderea geamurilor electrice prin ap\u0103sare lung\u0103 a telecomenzii."},vag_auto_lock_15kmh:{name:"Blocare automat\u0103 a u\u0219ii la 15 km/h (VAG)",desc:"\xcenchide automat toate u\u0219ile c\xe2nd viteza vehiculului atinge 15 km/h."},vag_sfd_unlock_prep:{name:"Preg\u0103tirea st\u0103rii protec\u021biei SFD Gateway (VAG 2020+)",desc:"Preg\u0103te\u0219te sesiunea de simboluri gateway MQB-evo SFD pentru scrierea DID-urilor protejate."},bmw_asd_deactivate:{name:"Dezactivare Active Sound Design (ASD) (BMW)",desc:"Dezactiveaz\u0103 sunetul sintetic al motorului redat prin difuzoarele din cabin\u0103."},bmw_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Num\u0103r de semnale de viraj confort (BMW)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 num\u0103rul de impulsuri al indicatorului cu o singur\u0103 atingere (1 p\xe2n\u0103 la 5 clipiri)."},bmw_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Oglind\u0103 cu acces confortabil rabatabil pe blocare (BMW)",desc:"Pliaz\u0103 automat oglinzile laterale imediat dup\u0103 blocarea vehiculului."},toyota_coming_home_duration:{name:"\xcent\xe2rziere de curtoazie pentru faruri/\xcentoarcere acas\u0103 (Toyota)",desc:"Configura\u021bi temporizatorul de \xeent\xe2rziere pentru oprirea farurilor dup\u0103 oprirea contactului (30s-120s)."},toyota_lane_change_flash:{name:"Num\u0103r bli\u021b pentru semnalul de viraj pentru schimbarea benzii (Toyota)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 num\u0103rul de cicluri de schimbare a benzii cu o singur\u0103 atingere."},toyota_remote_window_close:{name:"\xcenchidere geam electric la distan\u021b\u0103 (Toyota)",desc:"Permite \xeenchiderea tuturor geamurilor electrice \u021bin\xe2nd ap\u0103sat butonul de blocare de la distan\u021b\u0103."},toyota_autolock_behavior:{name:"Personalizare blocare/deblocare automat\u0103 a u\u0219ilor (Toyota)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 declan\u0219atorul de blocare a u\u0219ilor (Schift out of P vs Vehicle Speed > 20 km/h)."},toyota_approach_welcome_lights:{name:"Lumini de \xeent\xe2mpinare Smart Key Approach (Toyota)",desc:"Aprinde luminile interioare ale b\u0103l\u021bii/cabinei c\xe2nd cheia inteligent\u0103 se apropie de vehicul."},hyundai_autolock_behavior:{name:"Comportament de blocare/deblocare automat\u0103 a u\u0219ilor (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"\xcencuie automat u\u0219ile \xeen schimbare sau vitez\u0103 \u0219i se deblocheaz\u0103 pe P sau cu contactul oprit."},hyundai_window_remote:{name:"Deschidere/\xcenchidere fereastr\u0103 de la distan\u021b\u0103 (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Permite rularea ferestrelor \xeen sus/\xeen jos, folosind butoanele inteligente pentru chei."},hyundai_sport_mode_memory:{name:"Memorie de selectare a modului de conducere (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"\xce\u0219i aminte\u0219te ultimul mod de conducere selectat (Sport/Eco) dup\u0103 repornirea motorului."},tesla_charge_limit_custom:{name:"Personalizare limit\u0103 de \xeenc\u0103rcare a bateriei (Tesla)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 procentul implicit de \xeenc\u0103rcare a bateriei HV (80% zilnic / 100% c\u0103l\u0103torie)."},tesla_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Pliere automat\u0103 \xeen oglind\u0103 pe blocarea Walk-Away (Tesla)",desc:"Pliaz\u0103 automat oglinzile laterale atunci c\xe2nd se declan\u0219eaz\u0103 blocarea cheii telefonului."},nissan_coming_home:{name:"\xcent\xe2rziere pentru oprirea farurilor de curtoazie (Nissan)",desc:"P\u0103streaz\u0103 farurile aprinse timp de 30 de secunde dup\u0103 ie\u0219irea din vehiculul Nissan."},nissan_lane_change_flash:{name:"Num\u0103r de lumini pentru schimbarea benzii de la atingere pentru trecere (Nissan)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 num\u0103rul de puls al indicatorului de semnalizare la robinetul luminii."},nissan_autolock_behavior:{name:"Blocare automat\u0103 a u\u0219ii \xeen func\u021bie de vitez\u0103 (Nissan)",desc:"\xcencuie automat toate u\u0219ile c\xe2nd vehiculul atinge 24 km/h."},nissan_window_remote:{name:"Telecomand\u0103 cu telecomand\u0103 pentru geam electric (Nissan)",desc:"Deschide/\xeenchide geamurile din fa\u021b\u0103 prin ap\u0103sarea lung\u0103 a butonului de deblocare a cheii."},nissan_seatbelt_chime_mute:{name:"Suprimare sonor\u0103 audio de avertizare centur\u0103 de siguran\u021b\u0103 (Nissan)",desc:"Dezactiveaz\u0103 sunetul repetitiv de avertizare pentru centura de siguran\u021b\u0103, p\u0103str\xe2nd pictograma grupului."},porsche_sport_chrono_launch:{name:"Profil de r\u0103spuns la controlul lans\u0103rii Sport Chrono (Porsche)",desc:"Optimizeaz\u0103 controlul lans\u0103rii transmisiei PDK pragul RPM \u0219i mu\u015fc\u0103tura ambreiajului."},porsche_pasm_default:{name:"Presetare de pornire a modului de suspensie PASM (Porsche)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 rigiditatea implicit\u0103 a suspensiei adaptive PASM la pornirea contactului."},porsche_exhaust_flap:{name:"Clapeta de evacuare sport Compensare deschis\u0103 constant\u0103 (Porsche)",desc:"For\u021beaz\u0103 supapele de evacuare active s\u0103 r\u0103m\xe2n\u0103 deschise 100% \xeen toate intervalele de tura\u021bii."},audi_drive_select_memory:{name:"Audi Drive Select Mode Memory Retention (Audi)",desc:"P\u0103streaz\u0103 ultimul profil activ Drive Select (Dinamic/Individual) la repornire."},audi_virtual_cockpit_themes:{name:"Audi Virtual Cockpit S/RS Sport Graphic Layout (Audi)",desc:"Deblocheaz\u0103 op\u021biunile de aranjare a tahometrului central S/RS pe Virtual Cockpit."},vag_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Modul DRL scandinav (VAG)",desc:"Men\u021bine luminile spate aprinse \xeen mod continuu al\u0103turi de DRL-urile din fa\u021b\u0103."},vag_mirror_dip_reverse:{name:"Cobor\xe2rea oglinzii pasagerului \xeen mar\u0219arier (VAG)",desc:"Pune oglinda pasagerului \xeen jos c\xe2nd treapta de mar\u0219arier este cuplat\u0103."},vag_dynamic_turn_signal:{name:"Mod de semnalizare dinamic/secvential (VAG)",desc:"Permite modelul de intermitent dinamic cu LED-uri pe modulele de lumini spate compatibile."},vag_seatbelt_warning_duration:{name:"Reglarea duratei soneriei de avertizare a centurii de siguran\u021b\u0103 (VAG)",desc:"Scurteaz\u0103 sau suprim\u0103 temporizatorul de sonerie repetitiv\u0103 de avertizare a centurii de siguran\u021b\u0103."},vag_sunroof_remote:{name:"Control de confort de la distan\u021b\u0103 (VAG)",desc:"Permite deschiderea \u0219i \xeenclinarea trapei panoramice prin men\u021binerea telecomenzii pentru chei."},vag_acc_distance_preset:{name:"ACC Adaptive Cruise Distan\u021ba de urm\u0103rire implicit\u0103 (VAG)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 profilul de distan\u021b\u0103 de urm\u0103rire a radarului implicit la pornirea contactului."},vag_infotainment_startup_logo:{name:"Infotainment Boot Graphic Logo (VAG)",desc:"Personalizeaz\u0103 logo-ul ecranului de pornire infotainment (R-Line, GTI, RS)."},vag_ambient_color_cycle:{name:"Deblocarea spectrului de culori a luminii ambientale interioare (VAG)",desc:"Extinde op\u021biunile paletei de iluminare ambiental\u0103 \xeen meniul de set\u0103ri ale vehiculului."},vag_service_interval_custom:{name:"Pragul de distan\u021b\u0103 personalizat de inspec\u021bie \u0219i service (VAG)",desc:"Configura\u021bi km personalizate \u0219i obiective zilnice pentru urm\u0103torul avertisment de service."},vag_door_handle_lights_reverse:{name:"Luminile exterioare ale m\xe2nerului u\u0219ii aprinse \xeen mar\u0219arier (VAG)",desc:"Ilumineaz\u0103 luminile LED pentru m\xe2nerul u\u0219ii atunci c\xe2nd merge\u021bi \xeenapoi pentru vizibilitate la sol."},bmw_msport_exhaust_burble:{name:"Evacuare M-Sport Burble & Pop Intensity (BMW)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 agresivitatea sunetului burble \xeen modul Sport."},bmw_welcome_light_sequence:{name:"Anima\u021bie de secven\u021b\u0103 de lumini de bun venit (BMW)",desc:"Personalizeaz\u0103 farul LED \u0219i secven\u021ba de salut de bun venit Angel Eyes."},bmw_service_history_menu:{name:"Activare meniul istoric al serviciilor digitale (BMW)",desc:"Deblocheaz\u0103 meniul c\u0103r\u021bii de \xeenregistrare a serviciului digital iDrive de pe afi\u0219ajul central."},bmw_hud_speed_display:{name:"Suprapunere a vitezometrului digital cu afi\u0219aj head-up (BMW)",desc:"Proiecteaz\u0103 citirea vitezei digitale \xeen timp real pe afi\u0219ajul Head-Up."},bmw_cornering_lights_fog:{name:"Lamp\u0103 de cea\u021b\u0103 pentru viraj (BMW)",desc:"Aprinde lumina de cea\u021b\u0103 fa\u021b\u0103 la semnalul de direc\u021bie sau la unghiul de virare la vitez\u0103 mic\u0103."},bmw_easy_entry_steering:{name:"Coloan\u0103 de direc\u021bie cu intrare u\u0219oar\u0103 cu retractare automat\u0103 (BMW)",desc:"Retrage volanul electric \xeen sus la oprirea motorului pentru o ie\u0219ire u\u0219oar\u0103."},bmw_bluetooth_audio_enable:{name:"Deblocare \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bit\u0103 a fluxului audio Bluetooth (BMW)",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 streamingul de muzic\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 fir Bluetooth A2DP \xeen iDrive HU_ENTRYNAV."},bmw_door_handle_lights_reverse:{name:"Lumini de balt\u0103 \xeen mar\u0219arier pentru m\xe2nerul u\u0219ii exterioare (BMW)",desc:"Aprinde LED-urile m\xe2nerului u\u0219ii c\xe2nd este cuplat\u0103 mar\u0219arierul."},toyota_auto_headlight_threshold:{name:"Sensibilitatea senzorului de lumin\u0103 ambiental\u0103 a farurilor automate (Toyota)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 pragul de amurg pentru activarea automat\u0103 a farurilor."},toyota_turn_signal_click_volume:{name:"Volumul difuzorului semnalizator audio Clicker (Toyota)",desc:"Configura\u021bi volumul soneriei de clic a releului semnalizatorului (Sc\u0103zut, Mediu, \xcenalt)."},toyota_smart_key_approach_lights:{name:"Lumini pentru b\u0103l\u021bi de bun venit cu cheie inteligent\u0103 de proximitate (Toyota)",desc:"Aprinde luminile din oglind\u0103 c\xe2nd cheia inteligent\u0103 se apropie de vehicul."},toyota_rear_hatch_behavior:{name:"Logic\u0103 de func\u021bionare a hayonului electric, deschidere/\xeenchidere (Toyota)",desc:"Configura\u021bi durata de ap\u0103sare a butonului de trap\u0103 de alimentare de la telecomand\u0103 \u0219i de pe tabloul de bord."},toyota_open_windows_smart_key:{name:"Ap\u0103sare lung\u0103 de derulare a ferestrei de la distan\u021b\u0103 cu cheie inteligent\u0103 (Toyota)",desc:"Permite deschiderea tuturor ferestrelor \u021bin\xe2nd ap\u0103sat butonul de deblocare de la distan\u021b\u0103."},toyota_interior_light_dim_timer:{name:"\xcent\xe2rziere la oprire automat\u0103 a luminii interioare a cabinei (Toyota)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 temporizatorul de oprire a luminii interioare dup\u0103 \xeenchiderea u\u0219ii."},toyota_panic_alarm_remote:{name:"Telecomanda cu telecomand\u0103 pentru alarm\u0103 de panic\u0103 Func\u021bia siren\u0103 (Toyota)",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 sau dezactiveaz\u0103 alarma de panic\u0103 a claxonului vehiculului prin men\u021binerea cheii de la distan\u021b\u0103."},toyota_eco_drive_indicator:{name:"Indicator luminos pentru zona ECO Drive Cluster (Toyota)",desc:"Afi\u0219eaz\u0103 bara de accelera\u021bie ecologic\u0103 \u0219i indicatorul luminos pe grup."},hyundai_coming_home_duration:{name:"Temporizator de \xeent\xe2rziere pentru oprirea farurilor pentru escort\u0103 (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"P\u0103streaz\u0103 farurile de faz\u0103 scurt\u0103 aprinse dup\u0103 ie\u0219irea din vehicul."},hyundai_drl_menu_toggle:{name:"Controlul meniului luminilor de zi (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Adaug\u0103 setarea DRL ON/OFF la op\u021biunile utilizatorului grupului de instrumente."},hyundai_welcome_sequence:{name:"Lumin\u0103 de bun venit pentru proximitate cheie inteligent\u0103 \u0219i deschidere a oglinzii (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Desface oglinzile electrice \u0219i lumineaz\u0103 m\xe2nerele u\u0219ilor la apropiere."},hyundai_interior_light_delay:{name:"\xcent\xe2rzierea t\u0103ierii automate a l\u0103mpii de camer\u0103 din interiorul cabinei (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 temporizatorul \xeenainte ca luminile interioare s\u0103 se sting\u0103 automat pentru a economisi bateria."},hyundai_heat_pump_efficiency:{name:"Modul de eficien\u021b\u0103 termic\u0103 a pompei de c\u0103ldur\u0103 EV Climate (Hyundai/Kia)",desc:"Optimizeaz\u0103 consumul de energie al pompei de c\u0103ldur\u0103 EV pe vreme rece de iarn\u0103."},tesla_track_mode_params:{name:"Stabilitate mod pist\u0103 \u0219i profil de polarizare a cuplului (Tesla)",desc:"Configura\u021bi polarizarea motorului fa\u021b\u0103/spate \u0219i interven\u021bia de stabilitate."},tesla_regen_brake_strength:{name:"Profilul puterii de fr\xe2nare regenerativ\u0103 (Tesla)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 intensitatea recuper\u0103rii energiei la ridicarea pedalei de accelera\u021bie."},tesla_walkaway_door_lock:{name:"Blocare automat\u0103 a u\u0219ii (Tesla)",desc:"\xcencuie u\u0219ile \u0219i confirm\u0103 cu un claxon c\xe2nd tasta telefonului se \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103."},tesla_acceleration_boost_unlock:{name:"Profil de propulsie pentru accelerarea grupului motopropulsor (Tesla)",desc:"M\u0103re\u0219te r\u0103spunsul invertorului motorului electric pentru timpi mai rapidi de la 0 la 100 km/h."},tesla_interior_ambient_color:{name:"Preseta\u021bi culori pentru iluminarea ambiental\u0103 a zonei picioarelor cabinei (Tesla)",desc:"Personalizeaz\u0103 paleta de culori RGB pentru lumin\u0103 ambiental\u0103 LED pentru picioare."},audi_matrix_led_animation:{name:"Faruri Matrix LED Dynamic Welcome Light Dance (Audi)",desc:"Red\u0103 coregrafie luminoas\u0103 dinamic\u0103 la deblocarea vehiculului."},audi_mmi_startup_screen:{name:"Tema grafic\u0103 de pornire cu ecran tactil MMI (Audi)",desc:"Personalizeaz\u0103 anima\u021bia de pornire a ecranului central MMI (S / RS / e-tron)."},audi_drive_select_efficiency:{name:"Profil de eficien\u021b\u0103 de conducere \xeen Audi Drive Select (Audi)",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 modul Eficien\u021b\u0103 de economisire a combustibilului \xeen op\u021biunile Drive Select."},audi_laptimer_boost_display:{name:"Suprapunere cronometru \u0219i turbobar pentru manometru (Audi)",desc:"Afi\u0219eaz\u0103 cronometrul turei pe pist\u0103 \u0219i indicatorul turbo boost \xeen timp real pe Virtual Cockpit."},audi_needle_sweep_gauge:{name:"Verificare m\u0103turare ac al indicatorului sport (Audi)",desc:"Efectueaz\u0103 testul complet de m\u0103turare a acului tahometrului \u0219i vitezometrului la pornire."},skoda_coming_home_lights:{name:"Temporizator de iluminare pentru plecarea de acas\u0103/venirea acas\u0103 (Skoda)",desc:"Configura\u021bi temporizatorul de iluminare a farurilor dup\u0103 ie\u0219irea din vehicul."},skoda_comfort_turn_signal:{name:"Reglarea num\u0103rului de puls al indicatorului de confort (Skoda)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 num\u0103rul de clipiri ale semnalului de \xeentoarcere cu o singur\u0103 atingere \xeentre 3 \u0219i 5 clipiri."},cupra_sport_display_menu:{name:"Instrument de performan\u021b\u0103 Cupra \u0219i meniul G-Meter (Cupra)",desc:"Deblocheaz\u0103 contorul de for\u021b\u0103 G, indicatorul de putere kW \u0219i afi\u0219ajul temperaturii uleiului."},cupra_virtual_cockpit_copper:{name:"Grafic\u0103 de accent pentru tabloul de bord cu tem\u0103 de cupru (Cupra)",desc:"Aplic\u0103 tema cu accent metalic Cupra cupru la clusterul de m\u0103surare."},vag_brake_disc_drying:{name:"Func\u021bia de \u0219tergere/uscare a discului de fr\xe2n\u0103 \xeen ploaie (VAG)",desc:"Aplic\u0103 periodic o presiune minim\u0103 pe tampon pe vreme umed\u0103 rotoarelor uscate."},vag_tourist_mode_lights:{name:"Modelul fasciculului farurilor pentru modul turistic (VAG)",desc:"Comut\u0103 modelul fasciculului farurilor \xeentre LHD \u0219i RHD pentru a conduce \xeen str\u0103in\u0103tate."},vag_hood_warning_mute:{name:"Capota deschis\u0103 pentru instrumentul Chime Mute (VAG)",desc:"Suprim\u0103 soneria persistent\u0103 de avertizare a instrumentului c\xe2nd capota este deblocat\u0103."},vag_emergency_brake_hazard:{name:"Intermitent automat de pericol pentru fr\xe2nare de urgen\u021b\u0103 (VAG)",desc:"Aprinde intermitent luminile de avarie rapid \xeen timpul opririlor dure de urgen\u021b\u0103 ABS."},vag_sunroof_comfort_open:{name:"\xcenclinarea trapei/Deschiderea telecomenzii Comfort Key Fob Logic (VAG)",desc:"Configura\u021bi ac\u021biunea de men\u021binere a tastei de la distan\u021b\u0103 pentru a \xeenclina sau a deschide complet trapa."},bmw_ecopro_display_variant:{name:"Stilul instrumentului de bord ECO PRO (BMW)",desc:"Personalizeaz\u0103 tema grafic\u0103 albastr\u0103 a indicatorului de eficien\u021b\u0103 ECO PRO."},bmw_volume_bar_hud:{name:"Afi\u0219aj Head-Up Bara nivel de volum audio (BMW)",desc:"Afi\u0219eaz\u0103 bara de modificare a volumului direct pe proiec\u021bia HUD."},bmw_anti_dazzle_mirror:{name:"Sensibilitate la diminuarea oglinzii anti-orbire electrocrom\u0103 (BMW)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 automat oglinda retrovizoare atenuarea pragului foto-senzor."},bmw_camera_pdc_warning_mute:{name:"Reglarea vitezei PDC \u0219i Vizualizare Surround (BMW)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 pragul de vitez\u0103 a vehiculului la care se opresc camerele de parcare."},toyota_pcs_distance_preset:{name:"Distan\u021ba de alert\u0103 implicit\u0103 a sistemului de pre-coliziune (PCS) (Toyota)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 sensibilitatea ini\u021bial\u0103 a distan\u021bei de avertizare de coliziune direct\u0103 a radarului."},toyota_bsm_timing:{name:"Monitorizarea punctului mort (BSM) Timpul avertismentului de avertizare (Toyota)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 sincronizarea ilumin\u0103rii luminii de avertizare a unghiului mort al oglinzii laterale."},toyota_ac_noise_reduction:{name:"Modul de reducere a zgomotului compresorului de aer condi\u021bionat (Toyota)",desc:"Limiteaz\u0103 viteza maxim\u0103 a suflantei de aer condi\u021bionat pentru lini\u0219tea cabinei."},toyota_sflow_control:{name:"S-Flow Smart Climate Modul pentru un singur ocupant (Toyota)",desc:"Direc\u021bioneaz\u0103 fluxul de aer A/C exclusiv c\u0103tre locurile ocupate pe baza senzorilor de greutate."},toyota_relock_timeout:{name:"Temporizator de \xeent\xe2rziere pentru reblocarea automat\u0103 dup\u0103 deblocarea de la distan\u021b\u0103 (Toyota)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 cu secunde \xeenainte de reblocarea automat\u0103 a u\u0219ilor dac\u0103 nu este deschis\u0103 nicio u\u0219\u0103 (30s-120s)."},lexus_mark_levinson_audio_profile:{name:"Mark Levinson Sunet surround DSP Audio Profil (Lexus)",desc:"Optimizeaz\u0103 reglarea acustic\u0103 spa\u021bial\u0103 3D pentru difuzoarele premium Mark Levinson."},lexus_ev_mode_beeper_mute:{name:"Avertisment acustic EV pentru pietoni de vitez\u0103 mic\u0103 Dezactivare semnal sonor (Lexus)",desc:"Suprim\u0103 sunetul exterior sintetic \xeen modul electric de vitez\u0103 mic\u0103."},lexus_easy_access_seat:{name:"Volan cu acces u\u0219or \u0219i spate al scaunului electric (Lexus)",desc:"Gliseaz\u0103 scaunul \u0219oferului \u0219i \xeenclin\u0103 volanul pentru o intrare/ie\u0219ire u\u0219oar\u0103."},nissan_epower_regen_mode:{name:"Modul de fr\xe2nare regenerativ\u0103 e-POWER cu o singur\u0103 pedal\u0103 (Nissan)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 nivelul implicit de decelerare a fr\xe2n\u0103rii regenerative e-Pedal."},nissan_propilot_assist_timing:{name:"Sensibilitatea direc\u021biei de asisten\u021b\u0103 la centrarea benzii ProPILOT (Nissan)",desc:"Configura\u021bi claritatea interven\u021biei de direc\u021bie ProPILOT."},nissan_intelligent_around_view:{name:"Afi\u0219are automat\u0103 a monitorului Vizualizare \xeen jurul valorii la vitez\u0103 mic\u0103 (Nissan)",desc:"Declan\u0219eaz\u0103 afi\u0219area camerei la 360 de grade atunci c\xe2nd senzorii de parcare din fa\u021b\u0103 detecteaz\u0103 obstacole."},mazda_g_vectoring_display:{name:"G-Vectoring Control Plus Dynamic Visualizer (Mazda)",desc:"Afi\u0219eaz\u0103 graficul vectorial al cuplului \xeen viraje GVC+ \xeen timp real pe tabloul de bord."},mazda_ieloop_capacitor_monitor:{name:"Contor de condensator de recuperare a energiei de fr\xe2nare i-ELOOP (Mazda)",desc:"Afi\u0219eaz\u0103 starea de \xeenc\u0103rcare \u0219i desc\u0103rcare a condensatorului electric pe ecranul central."},mazda_smart_city_brake_sens:{name:"Sensibilitate Smart City Brake Support (SCBS) (Mazda)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 intervalul senzorului de fr\xe2nare de urgen\u021b\u0103 automat\u0103 la vitez\u0103 mic\u0103."},subaru_eyesight_distance_preset:{name:"Distan\u021ba implicit\u0103 EyeSight Adaptive Cruise Control (Subaru)",desc:"Configura\u021bi profilul implicit al intervalului de croazier\u0103 al camerei stereo la pornire."},subaru_xmode_auto_engage:{name:"Pragul de activare automat\u0103 a trac\u021biunii off-road \xeen modul X (Subaru)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 pragul de alunecare a ro\u021bilor pentru activarea automat\u0103 a modului X cu dubl\u0103 func\u021bie."},subaru_steering_responsive_headlights:{name:"Comutator faruri sensibile la direc\u021bie (SRH) (Subaru)",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 sau dezactiveaz\u0103 rotirea direc\u021bional\u0103 adaptiv\u0103 a farurilor."},genesis_sport_plus_mode:{name:"Sistemul de propulsie Sport+ \u0219i modul suspensie electronic\u0103 (Genesis)",desc:"Deblocheaz\u0103 ESC OFF orientat pe pist\u0103 \u0219i maparea amortizoare rigid\u0103."},genesis_ambient_active_light:{name:"Sincronizarea modului de ac\u021bionare a iluminatului ambiental activ (Genesis)",desc:"Schimb\u0103 dinamic culoarea luminii ambientale interioare \xeen func\u021bie de modul de conducere."},volvo_city_safety_warning:{name:"Sensibilitate autonom\u0103 de avertizare de urgen\u021b\u0103 pentru siguran\u021ba ora\u0219ului (Volvo)",desc:"Configura\u021bi temporizarea alertei de avertizare de coliziune radar \u0219i lidar (Devreme/Normal)."},chery_ar_navigation_hud:{name:"Suprapunere de proiec\u021bie pentru naviga\u021bie AR pe HUD (Chery)",desc:"Proiecteaz\u0103 s\u0103ge\u021bi de navigare \xeen realitate augmentat\u0103 3D pe parbriz."},jlr_terrain_response_preset:{name:"Presetare pentru modul Terrain Response Auto Off-Road (JLR)",desc:"\xce\u0219i aminte\u0219te ultimul profil de suprafa\u021b\u0103 Terrain Response (iarb\u0103/pietri\u0219/z\u0103pad\u0103)."},jlr_adaptive_dynamics_firm:{name:"Profil de fermitate al amortizorului dinamic adaptiv (JLR)",desc:"Seteaz\u0103 rigiditatea de amortizare a amortizorului electronic implicit."},jlr_wading_sensor_alert:{name:"Pragul soneriei de avertizare a ad\xe2ncimii de detectare a vad\u0103ului (JLR)",desc:"Configura\u021bi sensibilitatea soneriei de avertizare cu ultrasunete la ad\xe2ncimea apei."},alfa_dna_dynamic_memory:{name:"Memorie de pornire \xeen modul dinamic al selectorului Alfa DNA (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"P\u0103streaz\u0103 r\u0103spunsul accelera\u021biei \xeen modul dinamic dup\u0103 repornire."},alfa_q4_torque_split:{name:"Grafic \xeemp\u0103r\u021bit \xeen timp real cu trac\u021biunea integral\u0103 Q4 (Alfa Romeo)",desc:"Afi\u0219eaz\u0103 procentul de \xeemp\u0103r\u021bire a puterii AWD fa\u021b\u0103/spate pe afi\u0219ajul instrumentului."},li_auto_range_extender_mode:{name:"Nivelul de re\u021binere a \xeenc\u0103rc\u0103rii bateriei generator REV (Li Auto)",desc:"Regleaz\u0103 pragul de pornire a generatorului motorului cu ardere intern\u0103."},li_auto_cinema_seat_position:{name:"Pozi\u021bie ergonomic\u0103 a scaunului \xeen modul teatru / cinema (Li Auto)",desc:"\xcenclin\u0103 scaunele din spate \u0219i desf\u0103\u0219oar\u0103 suporturile pentru picioare atunci c\xe2nd modul cinema este activ."},zeekr_drift_mode_torque:{name:"Motor dual de performan\u021b\u0103 \xeen modul Drift Bias spate (Zeekr)",desc:"Trimite un cuplu de 100% c\u0103tre motorul electric din spate pentru o deplasare controlat\u0103."},zeekr_ambient_beat_sync:{name:"Iluminare ambiental\u0103 Muzic\u0103 Rhythm Beat Sync (Zeekr)",desc:"Pulseaz\u0103 iluminarea interioar\u0103 a cabinei \xeen sincronizare cu ritmurile muzicii redate."},tata_drive_mode_voice:{name:"Anun\u021b vocal comutator mod de conducere (Tata)",desc:"Activeaz\u0103 confirmarea audio vocal\u0103 la schimbarea modurilor de conducere (Ora\u0219/Sport/Eco)."},mahindra_zip_zap_zoom_custom:{name:"Profil de r\u0103spuns la accelera\u021bia Zip/Zap/Zoom (Mahindra)",desc:"Personalizeaz\u0103 curba de accelera\u021bie pentru modurile de conducere Zip, Zap \u0219i Zoom."},fun_cyberpunk_cluster_theme:{name:"Cyberpunk 2077 Neon Graphic Cockpit Theme",desc:"Aplic\u0103 stilul futurist neon cyan \u0219i chihlimbar al indicatorului digital al tabloului de bord."},fun_exhaust_flame_sound_effect:{name:"Sistem stereo Pop & Bang Exhaust Sound FX",desc:"Red\u0103 efecte audio realiste pop & bang de evacuare V8 prin difuzoarele din cabin\u0103."},fun_matrix_light_show_welcome:{name:"Faruri personalizate Matrix LED Dance Bun venit",desc:"Red\u0103 coregrafie ritmic\u0103 Light Show folosind faruri \u0219i indicatoare."},fun_stealth_fighter_display:{name:"Stealth Fighter Night Driving Modul Cluster minimalist",desc:"Opre\u0219te toate luminile de grup, cu excep\u021bia vitezometrului pentru conducerea pe timp de noapte \xeentuneric."},vag_lap_timer_oil_temp:{name:"Lap Timer & Oil Temperature in Gauge Cluster",desc:"Unlocks racetrack lap timer stopwatch and real-time engine oil temperature readout."},vag_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian DRL (Rear Tail Lights ON with DRL)",desc:"Illuminates rear LED tail lights constantly when front daytime running lights are active."},vag_drl_handbrake_off:{name:"Turn OFF DRL when Handbrake is Engaged",desc:"Automatically turns off daytime running lights whenever parking brake is pulled up."},vag_drl_menu_in_mib:{name:"DRL ON/OFF Toggle Switch in Touchscreen Menu",desc:"Adds Daytime Running Lights toggle checkbox under Vehicle Lights settings in MIB screen."},vag_rain_closing_windows:{name:"Rain Closing (Automatic Windows & Sunroof Close)",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof if parked vehicle detects rain on windshield."},vag_audi_dynamic_throttle:{name:"Audi Linear Direct Throttle Response",desc:"Removes electronic pedal lag by switching from time-gradient to direct linear throttle mapping."},vag_xds_differential_sensitivity:{name:"XDS Electronic Differential Lock Sensitivity",desc:"Increases cornering traction and reduces understeer by applying higher inner-wheel brake torque."},vag_offroad_display_mib:{name:"Off-Road Display & Compass in Infotainment",desc:"Unlocks Off-Road telemetry screen displaying steering angle, compass, and oil/coolant temperatures."},vag_highbeam_assist_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist (Light Assist) State Memory",desc:"Maintains Auto High-Beam Assist active across ignition cycles so driver does not have to re-arm it."},vag_comfort_turn_signals_count:{name:"Comfort Turn Signal Flash Cycles",desc:"Changes number of highway lane-change blinker pulses from standard 3 to 4 or 5."},bmw_video_in_motion_speedlock:{name:"Video in Motion (VIM) Speedlock Removal",desc:"Allows USB and DVD video playback on iDrive screen while vehicle is moving."},bmw_digital_speedo_kombi:{name:"Digital Speedometer in Instrument Cluster (V= km/h)",desc:"Adds real-time digital speed numerical readout on the onboard computer screen."},bmw_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Chirp on Lock / Unlock",desc:"Adds acoustic confirmation chirp via alarm siren with volume setting in iDrive menu."},bmw_auto_mirror_fold_comfort_close:{name:"Fold Mirrors Instantly with 1-Click Lock",desc:"Eliminates the 1.5s delay requirement for folding mirrors when pressing key lock."},bmw_rolls_royce_warning_chimes:{name:"Rolls-Royce / BMW i / MINI Warning Chime Tones",desc:"Changes the system warning chimes (door open, low temp, seatbelt) to luxury Rolls-Royce tones."},bmw_m_performance_boot_animation:{name:"M Performance / Alpina Cluster Boot Logo",desc:"Sets startup logo on digital instrument cluster to M Performance, M2, M3, M5, or Alpina."},bmw_tpms_temperature_display:{name:"Tire Pressure & Temperature Live Display",desc:"Adds real-time individual tire temperature readouts alongside tire pressure on iDrive screen."},bmw_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights Active with Daytime Running Lights",desc:"Keeps rear LED neon rings illuminated when daytime running lights are active in position 0/Auto."},bmw_sport_automatic_transmission_2tb:{name:"Sport Automatic Transmission (2TB) & Launch Control",desc:"Unlocks faster shifting times, rev-matching downshifts, and factory Launch Control mode."},merc_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep (AMG Staging)",desc:"Sweeps gauge needles to maximum upon turning on the ignition."},merc_highbeam_memory:{name:"High-Beam Assist State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last active state of Adaptive Highbeam Assist across ignition cycles."},merc_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Alarm Lock Chirp",desc:"Emits a short acoustic confirmation beep via alarm siren when vehicle is locked."},merc_amg_cluster_menu_unlock:{name:"AMG Performance Cluster Menu & Oil Temp",desc:"Unlocks AMG performance screen displaying engine oil & gearbox temperature, lap timer, and G-meter."},merc_ambient_lighting_64_colors:{name:"64-Color Dynamic Ambient Lighting Unlock",desc:"Expands ambient lighting color palette from standard colors to 64 multi-color dynamic themes in MBUX."},merc_start_stop_last_state_memory:{name:"ECO Start-Stop Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers ECO Start/Stop button status instead of defaulting to ON on every ignition restart."},merc_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Automatically folds side mirrors when locking with key fob and unfolds upon driver door open."},merc_rear_drl_scandinavian:{name:"Rear Tail Lights as Daytime Running Lights (Scandinavian Mode)",desc:"Keeps rear LED tail lamps illuminated together with front DRLs during daytime driving."},merc_seatbelt_warning_chime_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Acoustic Warning Chime Mute",desc:"Disables the continuous chime sound for unbuckled seatbelts (visual warning lamp remains active)."},merc_agility_manual_mode_unlock:{name:"Agility (Sport+) & Manual Transmission Mode",desc:"Enables hidden Agility (A) and True Manual (M) driving transmission profiles in Dynamic Select."},merc_esp_sport_threshold_tuning:{name:"ESP Sport Dynamic Slip Angle Adjustment",desc:"Allows increased wheel slip angle before ESP torque intervention for track driving."},merc_flashing_emergency_brake_light:{name:"Adaptive Emergency Flashing Brake Lights",desc:"Flashes stop lamps at high frequency (5.5 Hz) during hard emergency braking (> 7 m/s\xb2)."},stell_auto_mirror_fold_lock:{name:"Automatic Mirror Folding on Key Lock",desc:"Folds side mirrors automatically upon pressing lock button on key fob."},stell_cornering_fog_lights:{name:"Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Activates corresponding front fog lamp when turn signal is on or steering angle > 30\xb0 below 40 km/h."},stell_needle_sweep_cluster:{name:"Instrument Needle Sweep (Sport Staging)",desc:"Performs gauge sweep on startup for analog/hybrid instrument clusters."},stell_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Remote Lock",desc:"Gives a short horn tap confirmation when vehicle doors successfully lock."},stell_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Rear Scandinavian DRL Tail Lights",desc:"Illuminates rear tail lamps in conjunction with daytime running lights in Auto/0 mode."},stell_lane_assist_memory_default:{name:"Lane Keeping Assist Last State Memory",desc:"Remembers the last ON/OFF state of Lane Keeping Assist instead of re-activating at every start."},stell_sport_steering_weight_calibration:{name:"Dynamic Electric Power Steering (EPS) Weight Curve",desc:"Increases steering wheel resistance and centering feel for a firmer, sportier feedback."},stell_digital_speedo_unit_toggle:{name:"Digital Speedometer km/h & mph Dual Display",desc:"Shows numeric speed readout in both km/h and mph simultaneously in the center LCD."},ford_apim_ambient_multi_colors:{name:"SYNC 3/4 Multi-Color Ambient Lighting Theme",desc:"Unlocks full 7-color ambient lighting palette slider in SYNC touchscreen interface."},ford_lincoln_auto_fold_mirrors:{name:"Lincoln Style Auto-Fold Mirrors on Lock",desc:"Folds power mirrors when locking vehicle and automatically unfolds upon closing driver door."},ford_bambi_mode_fog_with_highbeam:{name:"Bambi Mode (High Beams + Fog Lights Simultaneous)",desc:"Prevents fog lights from turning off automatically when high beams are activated."},ford_double_honk_disable:{name:"Disable Double Horn Honk on Keyless Exit",desc:"Disables loud double horn honk when driver exits running vehicle with key fob in pocket."},ford_global_windows_remote_open_close:{name:"Global Window Roll Up & Down via Key Fob",desc:"Opens or closes all power windows by holding unlock or lock button on factory key fob."},ford_cluster_digital_tpms_readout:{name:"Individual Tire Pressure (TPMS) Bar/PSI Display",desc:"Displays exact individual tire pressure numerical readouts on the instrument cluster screen."},ford_sync_boot_splash_st_raptor:{name:"SYNC Performance Boot Splash Theme (ST / Raptor / RS)",desc:"Changes SYNC infotainment boot logo animation to Ford Performance / ST / Raptor styling."},renault_rlink_video_in_motion:{name:"Video in Motion (VIM) Playback Unlock",desc:"Allows USB/video playback on R-Link 2 / EasyLink touchscreen while vehicle is in motion."},renault_rs_monitor_telemetry_unlock:{name:"RS Monitor Performance Telemetry App",desc:"Enables Renault Sport Monitor app displaying live turbo boost, torque, oil temp, and G-force meters."},renault_acoustic_lock_chirp:{name:"Acoustic Horn Chirp on Hands-Free Walkaway Lock",desc:"Emits a brief beep when vehicle automatically locks upon walking away with key card."},renault_rear_scandinavian_drl:{name:"Scandinavian Daytime Running Tail Lights",desc:"Keeps rear 3D LED signature tail lamps active simultaneously with front DRL strips."},renault_cornering_fog_lamps:{name:"Static Cornering Fog Light Illumination",desc:"Lights up the relevant front fog light during turning maneuvers below 40 km/h."},renault_seatbelt_buzzer_mute:{name:"Seatbelt Warning Buzzer Sound Mute",desc:"Mutes acoustic beeping for unfastened seatbelts (visual cluster alert remains active)."},hyundai_ev_charge_limit_ui_unlock:{name:"Manual EV AC/DC Charge Limit Setting UI",desc:"Unlocks 50% to 100% target SoC slider controls in infotainment for battery longevity."},hyundai_isg_start_stop_memory:{name:"ISG (Idle Stop & Go) Last State Memory",desc:"Retains the last selected state of the Start-Stop button across vehicle restarts."},hyundai_approach_auto_unlock_distance:{name:"Smart Key Approach Auto-Unlock Sensitivity",desc:"Adjusts proximity radar detection sensitivity for automatic welcome door unlocking."},hyundai_lead_vehicle_departure_alert:{name:"Lead Vehicle Departure Notification Sensitivity",desc:"Enhances front camera sensitivity when alerting that the front vehicle has started moving in traffic."},hyundai_welcome_escort_lighting_timer:{name:"Headlamp Escort / Follow-Me-Home Delay Timer",desc:"Extends headlamp illumination duration from 15s to 30s or 60s after locking vehicle."},byd_battery_preconditioning_manual_toggle:{name:"Blade Battery Manual Pre-Heating / Pre-Conditioning",desc:"Enables manual battery thermal pre-heating before DC fast charging in cold weather."},byd_vess_pedestrian_sound_customization:{name:"VESS Low-Speed Pedestrian Acoustic Warning Themes",desc:"Unlocks alternative synthesized engine / futuristic tone profiles for low-speed pedestrian alert."},byd_ambient_sound_rhythm_sync:{name:"Music Rhythm Pulse Ambient Lighting Sync",desc:"Synchronizes cabin ambient LED brightness and color shifting with music bass rhythm."},chery_auto_window_rain_close:{name:"Automatic Window & Sunroof Rain Closing",desc:"Closes all open windows and panoramic sunroof when rain sensor detects rainfall while parked."},mg_ev_one_pedal_drive_memory:{name:"One-Pedal Driving Mode Retention",desc:"Remembers the last selected regenerative braking intensity (High/One-Pedal) across starts."},porsche_needle_sweep_staging:{name:"Porsche Tachometer Needle Sweep on Start",desc:"Sweeps central analog tachometer needle to redline on ignition power up."},porsche_sport_exhaust_valve_manual_mode:{name:"PSE Sport Exhaust Flaps Permanently Open",desc:"Keeps dual active exhaust valves 100% open across all RPM ranges when PSE button is active."},porsche_rear_spoiler_manual_speed_threshold:{name:"Active Rear Aerodynamic Wing Deployment Speed",desc:"Adjusts automatic rear spoiler deployment speed threshold (80 km/h vs 120 km/h)."},porsche_matrix_highbeam_unlock:{name:"PDLS+ Matrix LED Adaptive Anti-Glare High Beam",desc:"Enables European-spec variable anti-glare high beam light distribution."},porsche_acoustic_chirp_lock:{name:"Acoustic Siren Beep on Central Lock",desc:"Gives a quick chirp confirmation when locking with Porsche smart key."},actros_rsl_fleet_speed_limit:{name:"Road Speed Limiter (Fleet Limit)",desc:"Configures maximum vehicle road speed limiter (RSL) calibration for fleet operation policy."},actros_idle_shutdown_timer:{name:"Automatic Engine Idle Shutdown Timer",desc:"Automatically shuts down engine after specified idle time while stationary with parking brake set."},volvo_pto_engine_rpm_preset:{name:"PTO (Power Take-Off) Engine RPM Preset",desc:"Sets predefined constant engine idle speed when PTO is engaged for hydraulic pump and tipper operation."},volvo_ppc_eco_roll_hysteresis:{name:"I-See / PPC Topographical Speed Tolerance (Eco-Roll)",desc:"Adjusts GPS predictive cruise control speed hysteresis tolerance window for maximum rolling fuel economy."},scania_retarder_jake_brake_aggressiveness:{name:"Retarder & Jake Brake Downshift Aggressiveness",desc:"Adjusts retarder torque blending curve and automatic transmission downshifting response under braking."},man_ecas_dock_level_memory:{name:"ECAS Air Suspension Loading Dock Height Memory",desc:"Stores and recalls customized pneumatic air suspension height level presets for loading docks."},daf_stationary_dpf_regen_trigger:{name:"Stationary DPF Forced Soot Regeneration",desc:"Initiates stationary diesel particulate filter thermal soot burn routine in parked position."},ford_trucks_reverse_buzzer_night_mode:{name:"Reverse Acoustic Alarm Night Quiet Mode",desc:"Attenuates reverse backup horn alarm volume for quiet night distribution in residential areas."},cummins_ecm_fleet_speed_limiter:{name:"Cummins Engine Road Speed Limiter (RSL)",desc:"Programs maximum allowable road vehicle speed in Cummins ECM parameter tables."}},codeBtn:"COD",removeBtn:"ELIMINA\u021aI",unsupportedTitle:"Vehicul nu este acceptat",unsupportedMsg:"Aceast\u0103 caracteristic\u0103 nu este acceptat\u0103 de versiunea hardware sau software ECU a vehiculului dumneavoastr\u0103.",selectBrand:"Selecta\u021bi marca vehiculului",selectCategory:"Selecta\u021bi Categorie",selectMakeTitle:"SELECTA\u021aI MARCA VEHICULUI",selectCategoryTit